{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the start scene is a stub - it hasn't been implemented with a full script and choices yet. Let me design this game. This seems like a horror/survival game set in an apocalyptic scenario. Let me create:\\n\\n1. Some locations (the apartment, the alley, etc.)\\n2. Some characters (the neighbor, maybe others)\\n3. Create the full scene structure\\n\\nLet me start by creating locations and characters, then flesh out the start scene with choices.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! I have a dark, atmospheric horror setup. Let me now build out locations, characters, and the full game structure. First, let me create the key locations and characters."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_iFJE9yqqyXSIE1uzqp1G2873","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Apartment 3C","vignette":"Your small, cluttered one-bedroom apartment. The emergency power from a dying battery lantern on the coffee table casts long, dancing shadows across walls decorated with movie posters and a corkboard of personal photos. The air smells of dust, stale coffee, and the metallic tang of fear.","appearanceDescription":"A modest apartment in disarray. Overturned furniture, a shattered picture frame, and the faint glow of a dying battery lantern. The front door has a deadbolt and chain lock, while the fire escape window is partially open.","backstoryDescription":"You've lived here for three years since moving to the city for work. It's been your sanctuary, but tonight the thin walls feel like paper against whatever is happening outside."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_i7iKnlGzGYmEf7f3Zikb2938","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Alleyway Below","vignette":"A narrow garbage-choked alley running between the apartment building and the derelict warehouse next door. Broken glass glitters like malicious stars under the flickering streetlight, and shadows pool in every corner.","appearanceDescription":"Dark, narrow passage lined with dumpsters and scattered refuse. A single buzzing streetlight casts unreliable illumination. The fire escape ladder descends into this space.","backstoryDescription":"Normally just a shortcut to the bodega on the corner, tonight it's become a hunting ground for something that doesn't belong in this world."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_kwdjtouanskKsdbFUh3m2815","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Hallway","vignette":"A narrow corridor with threadbare carpet, flickering fluorescent lights, and the faint smell of Mrs. Gable's cooking from downstairs—now overwhelmed by the scent of smoke and something acrid. The emergency lights cast a sickly red glow.","appearanceDescription":"Long hallway with numbered doors on either side, a fire extinguisher mounted on the wall, and a stairwell door at the far end. The lights strobe erratically.","backstoryDescription":"The artery of your building, connecting the apartments to the stairs and fire escape. You've passed through it a thousand times without a second thought."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_03_jJjPzzLNwe7nhabMZkkQ0264","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Rooftop","vignette":"The flat tar-paper roof offers a panoramic view of a city in chaos. Fires bloom like terrible flowers across the skyline, and the stars are blotted out by smoke. The access door groans on rusty hinges.","appearanceDescription":"Open rooftop with a gravel surface, a television antenna, and a low parapet wall. From here you can see several blocks in every direction—and everything you see is burning.","backstoryDescription":"A place you came to watch fireworks on the Fourth of July. Now it offers a view of the apocalypse."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_04_9jBkKUPsZAbfyNedDx2x6571","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Neighbor (Marcus)","vignette":"A breathless, terrified voice on the other side of the door. Marcus, your neighbor from 3B, a quiet IT worker you've exchanged pleasantries with in the elevator. He sounds utterly desperate.","appearanceDescription":"Through the peephole: a disheveled man in a blood-stained t-shirt, his face pale with terror, eyes wide and scanning frantically.","backstoryDescription":"Marcus has lived next door for about a year. He keeps to himself, works late hours, and occasionally plays music too loud. He's always seemed like a decent, if unremarkable, person."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":451,"output":1130,"cacheRead":2304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3885,"cost":{"input":0.00004059,"output":0.00020339999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00004608,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00029006999999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783088293450,"responseId":"gen-1783088293-aZOwlDpa6xh3YA38JEFs","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
