{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me build out the start scene and its branching choices.\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7e107f35543049d4b365bc74","name":"create_scene","arguments":{"id":"start","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The emergency broadcast on your phone didn't end with instructions; it ended with a wet, choking scream that cut to static just as the power grid blew, plunging your apartment into an oppressive, heavy darkness. Outside your third-story window, the familiar hum of the city has mutated into a chaotic symphony of screeching tires, distant explosions, and an underlying, rhythmic scuffling sound that makes the hairs on your arms stand up.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A frantic, heavy pounding suddenly rattles your front door, accompanied by the panicked voice of your neighbor Marcus begging to be let in. Through the peephole, you see his terrified face, streaked with something dark. From the alleyway directly below your fire escape, you hear the unmistakable sound of breaking glass and a guttural, distinctly non-human howl.","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Open the door for Marcus","description":"Your hands trembling, you unlock the deadbolt and swing the door open. Marcus stumbles in, gasping, and you catch a glimpse of movement in the dark hallway beyond before slamming the door shut again. He says the building is compromised—they're in the stairwells.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetScene":"marcus_inside","targetSceneDescription":"Marcus is inside your apartment, breathing hard. He tells you what he saw on the street below—things crawling out of shadows, people being taken. You need to decide your next move with a second perspective in the room."},{"label":"Look through the peephole before deciding","description":"You press your eye to the peephole, and your breath catches. Beyond Marcus's panicked form, you see something in the stairwell door at the end of the hall—a long, pale limb curling around the edge, followed by a sideways-glancing eye that seems to look directly at you. The peephole offers a wider view of the danger.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetScene":"peephole_view","targetSceneDescription":"You've seen what's in the hallway. Marcus is still pounding. The fire escape window rattles behind you. You have information now—and a timer ticking down."},{"label":"Head for the fire escape immediately","description":"Ignoring the door, you rush to the window. The fire escape ladder groans as you step onto it, the cold metal biting into your hands. Below, the alley is dark, but you can make out shapes moving in the shadows. It's a risk, but maybe the only way out.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetScene":"fire_escape","targetSceneDescription":"You're on the fire escape, descending into the unknown. The alley below is treacherous, and something is down there."},{"label":"Arm yourself and prepare to fight","description":"You grab the heavy flashlight from your emergency kit and a kitchen knife. The pounding continues—Marcus is still begging. But you're not going out there unarmed, and you're not opening the door until you understand what you're facing. You steel yourself for whatever comes next.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetScene":"armed_and_ready","targetSceneDescription":"Armed with a knife and a powerful flashlight, you take stock of your apartment as a fortress. The sounds outside are getting closer."}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":4350,"output":923,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":5273,"cost":{"input":0.0003915,"output":0.00016614,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00055764}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783088314875,"responseId":"gen-1783088314-IoZgzhKtMotpIEGsTa5Q","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
