{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a great start - a zombie apocalypse style scene! The player is in their apartment during an emergency. They hear their neighbor begging at the front door, and something non-human in the alley below.\\n\\nLet me design a full choose-your-own-adventure game. I'll need to:\\n\\n1. Create locations (like the apartment, alleyway, etc.)\\n2. Create characters (the neighbor, maybe others)\\n3. Implement the start scene with choices\\n4. Create more scenes branching out\\n\\nLet me start by creating some locations and characters, then implement the start scene with choices.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! A zombie/apocalypse survival story is already brewing. Let me build out this world with locations, characters, and a branching narrative.\\n\\nFirst, let me create the essential locations and characters."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ru1EuHmJTVPVJCv5C8En6269","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Apartment 3C","vignette":"Your small, cluttered one-bedroom apartment. The power is out, leaving everything bathed in an oppressive darkness punctuated only by the faint orange glow of distant fires through the window.","appearanceDescription":"A modest apartment with a living room, kitchenette, bedroom, and a fire escape balcony. The furniture is disheveled from panic. A front door leads to the hallway, and a window overlooks the alley below.","backstoryDescription":"You've lived here for three years. It's your sanctuary, but now its thin walls and single exit make it feel like a trap."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_KN5VjTMM7sQvxrrQjlC78369","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Hallway","vignette":"The narrow, dimly lit corridor of your apartment building's third floor. Emergency lights flicker weakly, casting long, dancing shadows. The air smells of smoke and something metallic.","appearanceDescription":"Carpeted hallway with numbered doors on either side. A stairwell door at one end, a window at the other overlooking the street. Flickering emergency lights create an eerie atmosphere.","backstoryDescription":"Once a mundane passage you walked daily, now a potential death trap with unknown horrors lurking around corners."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_udOC0B3sU0gSetEWIr1Q9546","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Alleyway","vignette":"A narrow, garbage-strewn alley running between your building and the next. Dumpsters overflow with trash, and the broken glass from a shattered window glitters menacingly in the firelight.","appearanceDescription":"Dark, cramped, and reeking of rot. A chain-link fence blocks one end. Puddles of unknown liquid reflect the orange glow of the burning city.","backstoryDescription":"Normally an unremarkable urban space, now echoing with guttural howls and the sounds of chaos."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_03_oH8E6se0l2495o3N0Hiz2235","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Rooftop","vignette":"The flat, tar-paper roof of the apartment building. HVAC units and abandoned patio furniture dot the space. From here, you can see the city burning in the distance, a hellish panorama of smoke and flame.","appearanceDescription":"Open sky above, a ladder access from below, and a low wall around the perimeter. The wind whips fiercely, carrying ash and the distant sounds of screams and sirens.","backstoryDescription":"A forgotten space where tenants occasionally sunbathed. Now it might be your only escape route or your final stand."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_04_vL08CjDelxkEGS6l8Yoc1655","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Street Level","vignette":"The chaotic urban battlefield that your quiet street has become. Overturned cars burn like bonfires. Shadows move erratically between the flames. The city's familiar skyline is obscured by thick, black smoke.","appearanceDescription":"Broken asphalt littered with debris, abandoned vehicles, and things best not examined too closely. The street signs hang crooked, and storefronts are smashed open.","backstoryDescription":"What was once a normal city street is now a war zone. The outbreak has transformed the familiar into something terrifying."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":505,"output":1079,"cacheRead":2304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3888,"cost":{"input":0.00004545,"output":0.00019422,"cacheRead":0.00004608,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00028575}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783089513362,"responseId":"gen-1783089513-RSVeSaowUHoAGBhfhK3O","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
