{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, locations created. Now let me create some characters.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me create the characters"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_eb4c4add9db94d4dac7baa86","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"You","vignette":"A survivor. You were just an ordinary person living an ordinary life when the world ended. Now you must make choices that will determine if you live to see tomorrow.","appearanceDescription":"You look like yourself - disheveled, wide-eyed, gripping whatever you could grab in the chaos.","backstoryDescription":"Your past doesn't matter now. Only what you do next."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f60a72c21c34403b49b77a5","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Mrs. Gutierrez","vignette":"Your elderly neighbor from apartment 3D. She's a kind widow who always brought you homemade cookies during the holidays. Now her voice is choked with terror as she pounds on your door.","appearanceDescription":"A small woman in her late 60s, gray hair disheveled, wearing a floral nightgown and slippers. Her eyes are wide with primal fear.","backstoryDescription":"She's lived in this building for thirty years. Her husband passed away two years ago. She has no family nearby."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bb161d0a301d46ce80895004","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"The Infected","vignette":"Former humans, now twisted by whatever catastrophe has befallen the city. They move with an unnatural, jerky speed, driven by a ravenous hunger that has erased all traces of their humanity.","appearanceDescription":"Pale, blood-streaked skin. Eyes that are fully black or filmed over white. Clothes torn and stained. They move with a shuddering, predatory gait.","backstoryDescription":"No one knows exactly what caused the转变. Something in the air, the water, or perhaps something that was always sleeping inside humanity has now awakened."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_294002b85c7249679b216c81","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Marcus","vignette":"A man you recognize from the building - he lives on the second floor. You've seen him fixing his motorcycle in the parking lot. He's tough, practical, and has the look of someone who's been through hard times before.","appearanceDescription":"Late 30s, muscular build, tattooed arms, short-cropped hair. He wears a leather jacket over a grey shirt, jeans, and heavy boots. He carries a crowbar.","backstoryDescription":"An army veteran who keeps to himself. He's been preparing for something like this for years, though he never said so out loud."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1914,"output":736,"cacheRead":2048,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4698,"cost":{"input":0.00017226,"output":0.00013248,"cacheRead":0.00004096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0003457}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783089525012,"responseId":"gen-1783089525-RlcbO9AJ0s3Fo4ZtxhMr","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
