{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me implement the start scene with full branching choices:\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e2c0acd0099d4c9fb4a43d00","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"start","location":"Apartment 3C","script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The emergency broadcast on your phone didn't end with instructions; it ended with a wet, choking scream that cut to static just as the power grid blew, plunging your apartment into an oppressive, heavy darkness. Outside your third-story window, the familiar hum of the city has mutated into a chaotic symphony of screeching tires, distant explosions, and an underlying, rhythmic scuffling sound that makes the hairs on your arms stand up.","instantLocationEffects":["dark"],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"A frantic, heavy pounding suddenly rattles your front door, accompanied by the panicked voice of your neighbor, Mrs. Gutierrez, begging to be let in.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","content":"Please! Oh God, please let me in! They're in the building! They got Mr. Chen from 2B! I saw... I saw them *tear* him apart!","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"},{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"From the alleyway directly below your fire escape, you hear the unmistakable sound of breaking glass and a guttural, distinctly non-human howl. You have moments to decide.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"choices":[{"label":"Open the door for Mrs. Gutierrez","description":"You rush to the front door, fumbling with the locks. Mrs. Gutierrez is terrified and alone in the hallway. You can't leave her out there to die. But opening the door means letting in whatever else might be lurking in the hallway too.","targetScene":"let-in-neighbor","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The door swings open and Mrs. Gutierrez stumbles inside, sobbing with relief. But as you slam the door shut, you hear heavy, scrabbling footsteps in the hallway. Something is coming. You're now trapped inside your apartment with a panicking elderly woman, and the infected are right outside your door."},{"label":"Barricade the door and take the fire escape","description":"Your instincts scream at you: stay quiet, stay hidden. Help Mrs. Gutierrez and you might both die. You quickly drag your bookshelf in front of the front door, muffling her desperate cries with guilt, and scramble toward the fire escape window. Below, shapes move in the alley. You'll have to go up, to the rooftop.","targetScene":"fire-escape-rooftop","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You climb out onto the rusted fire escape, your hands shaking. The metal groans beneath you. As you climb upward toward the rooftop, you hear the front door of your apartment splinter open below. Mrs. Gutierrez's scream is cut short. You force yourself to keep climbing."},{"label":"Yell for Mrs. Gutierrez to hide while you prepare","description":"You press your mouth against the door and whisper urgently through it, telling Mrs. Gutierrez to hide in the stairwell closet while you grab supplies. You can't just open the door blind. You need a weapon, a plan. You start frantically grabbing anything useful—a kitchen knife, a flashlight, your backpack.","targetScene":"prepared-exit","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Armed with makeshift supplies and a rough plan, you crack open the door. The hallway is empty and eerily silent—until you hear a wet, choking sound from the stairwell. Mrs. Gutierrez didn't make it to the closet. Something got her. The infected are already moving through the building."}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":4604,"output":1059,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":5663,"cost":{"input":0.00041436,"output":0.00019062,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00060498}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783089534682,"responseId":"gen-1783089534-Ge3yhy7ZVl7yffccMyVO","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
