{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have 7 scene stubs. Let me implement them all in batches. I'll start with the three rooftop-related ones since they flow from the same parent scene, then the apartment branch, then the hallway branch.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me implement the rooftop branch scenes first:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_A3zk2Mj5vOFtP3ilDnlH0282","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"rooftop-truth","location":"The Rooftop","passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"script":[{"type":"internal_dialogue","content":"I left her. I heard her die. And I kept climbing. What kind of person does that make me?","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"I... I left my neighbor. Mrs. Gutierrez. She was at my door. I barricaded it and ran. She didn't make it.","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Marcus listens in silence. The wind whips between you. Finally, he speaks.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Hard choices are all that's left now. You think I didn't leave people behind? My own damn brother—he got bit right in front of me. I had to put him down before he turned. This is the world now. You survive, or you don't. Don't let guilt get you killed.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"sad"},{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"He spits over the edge. 'The building is surrounded. But I've been watching next door. The gap between rooftops is about eight feet. I found a plank we can use to cross. You in?'","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Cross the gap with Marcus","description":"You accept Marcus's offer. Together, you drag the plank across the gap to the adjacent building. It's a terrifying crossing—one wrong step and you'll fall three stories into the alley below. But on the other side, there might be a way down.","targetScene":"cross-gap","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You and Marcus cross to the adjacent building. Below, the infected mill about, unaware. You find a fire door leading inside. It's dark, but Marcus has a lighter. The building is a former office space—cubicles, shattered glass, and the smell of stale coffee. Something rustles in the darkness ahead."},{"label":"Refuse and go your own way","description":"You appreciate the offer, but you can't shake the feeling that you need to move alone. You tell Marcus you'll take your chances elsewhere. He shrugs, 'Suit yourself. Stay alive.' You head for the drainage pipe you spotted earlier.","targetScene":"drainpipe-descent","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You shimmy down the drainage pipe, your hands burning on the cold metal. You drop into a narrow alley behind a dumpster. Two infected are shuffling past, their backs to you. You freeze, holding your breath. They pass. You're on street level, alone, with the burning city stretching out before you."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_tBwWvNQ0HFVXrh2wL3OJ8285","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"rooftop-plan","location":"The Rooftop","passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"script":[{"type":"dialogue","content":"What's the situation? You got a way out of this?","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Marcus jerks his thumb toward the adjoining building—a slightly taller structure about eight feet away. 'Fire escape on that side is clear. I've been watching it for twenty minutes. Nothing's come out or gone up. But we gotta cross the gap first.'","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"He kicks a wooden plank at his feet—a long, sturdy piece of lumber, probably salvaged from a construction pile on the roof.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"I found this. Lay it across, walk slow, don't look down. On the other side, we take the fire escape down to street level. From there... well, we play it by ear. There's a police station six blocks east. If any safe zone exists, it'll be there.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"He looks at you hard. 'Or we stay here and wait for the cavalry. Your call. But I'm not waiting.'","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Cross to the next building with Marcus","description":"You help Marcus lay the plank across the gap. It wobbles precariously. One by one, you cross—heart pounding, eyes fixed forward. You make it. The fire escape on this side leads down to a dark alley.","targetScene":"cross-gap","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You successfully cross to the adjacent building with Marcus. The fire door leads into a dark office building. Cubicles stretch into the darkness. As your eyes adjust, you see overturned chairs, papers scattered everywhere, and a vending machine with its glass front smashed. From somewhere in the dark, a faint clicking sound echoes."},{"label":"Convince Marcus to stay and fortify the rooftop","description":"You argue that the rooftop is defensible. You can see approaches from all sides. Maybe you should wait for daylight, or for military rescue. Marcus reluctantly agrees to wait—for now. You start gathering whatever you can use to fortify your position.","targetScene":"rooftop-standoff","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You and Marcus fortify the rooftop access as best you can. Hours pass. The city burns below you. Then, just before dawn, you hear it—helicopter blades. A military chopper sweeps low over the rooftops. Rescue might actually be coming. But so are more infected, drawn by the noise."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_d1cemOh99NpqAezPCMv09363","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"rooftop-alone","location":"The Rooftop","passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You ignore Marcus and move past him, scanning the rooftop's perimeter. He watches you with narrowed eyes but doesn't try to stop you. 'Suit yourself,' he mutters, turning back to his own planning.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You find what you're looking for: a thick drainage pipe running down the side of the building, bolted to the brick. Below, an alley snakes between buildings, shrouded in shadow. You can't see any infected in that immediate area.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The pipe is slick with moisture and grime. It'll be a dangerous climb, but it's a way down that doesn't involve trusting a stranger with a crowbar.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"internal_dialogue","content":"Alone is safer. Alone means I only have to watch my own back.","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Climb down the drainage pipe","description":"You grab the pipe and lower yourself over the edge. The cold metal is slippery, but you find footholds. You descend into the shadowy alley, leaving Marcus and the rooftop behind.","targetScene":"drainpipe-descent","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You land hard in the alley, your ankles jarring from the drop. You're at street level. The alley opens onto a side street. You can hear the distant moans of the infected. A convenience store at the end of the alley has its door smashed open—a potential source of supplies."},{"label":"Reconsider and call Marcus back","description":"Before you commit to the climb, you reconsider. Maybe going alone is suicide. You turn back to find Marcus—but he's already gone. The rooftop is empty. You're truly alone now, with only one way down.","targetScene":"alone-on-rooftop","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Marcus has vanished—probably crossed to the next building without you. The rooftop access door below is beginning to shudder. Something is trying to break through from inside the building. The only way off the roof is down the drainage pipe. You have no choice now."}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":4958,"output":2296,"cacheRead":8192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15446,"cost":{"input":0.00044622,"output":0.00041328,"cacheRead":0.00016384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00102334}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783089635074,"responseId":"gen-1783089635-pxH69z5ly93OZCkUkt2G","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
