{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now I need to implement the remaining stubs:\\n- barricade-stand\\n- fire-escape-with-neighbor\\n- hallway-window\\n- stairwell-fight\\n- cross-gap (referenced by two scenes)\\n- drainpipe-descent\\n- rooftop-standoff\\n- alone-on-rooftop\\n\\nLet me implement all of them.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me continue implementing the remaining stubs."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_JKtS4CmoAM5xT8KDzitG9024","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"barricade-stand","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You shout at Mrs. Gutierrez to help you. Together, you drag the sofa, the bookshelf, and the dining table against the door. The wood splinters as the infected throw themselves against it from the other side.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"It's holding! It's holding! Oh please, Jesus, let it hold!","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You back away from the door, your heart hammering. The pounding continues, rhythmic, relentless. But the barricade holds. You allow yourself a moment to breathe. Then you hear it—a metallic scrape from the fire escape window. Something is climbing up.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You whirl around. Through the grimy glass of the fire escape window, a pale hand slaps against the pane, leaving a bloody smear. A face presses against the glass—sunken eyes, gaping mouth. The infected are coming from both sides.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"},{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"We're trapped! We're trapped!","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"sad"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Fight the infected at the window","description":"You grab the kitchen knife and approach the window. If you can break the glass and stab the infected before it gets inside, you might be able to close it off. It's a risky gambit.","targetScene":"window-fight","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You shatter the window with a lamp and lunge at the infected creature clinging to the fire escape. The fight is brutal and desperate. You manage to push it off, but not before it claws your arm. Blood wells from the wound. Mrs. Gutierrez screams behind you. In the other room, the front door splinters."},{"label":"Try to escape out the window past the infected","description":"There's no winning this fight. You grab Mrs. Gutierrez and make a break for the window. There's one infected on the fire escape—maybe you can shove past it and climb to the rooftop before more come.","targetScene":"fire-escape-with-neighbor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"label":"Find a hiding spot in the apartment","description":"You pull Mrs. Gutierrez into the bedroom closet, pulling the doors shut, pressing your hands over her mouth. If you stay silent, maybe they'll pass through without finding you.","targetScene":"closet-hide","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You and Mrs. Gutierrez huddle in the dark closet, barely breathing. The infected break through both entrances. You hear them shuffling through your apartment, knocking things over. One pauses right outside the closet door. You can hear it breathing—wet, labored rasps. Then it moves on."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_WfHr6n1hWeWGp2qqPFZp9048","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"fire-escape-with-neighbor","location":"The Alleyway","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You help Mrs. Gutierrez climb onto the fire escape. The old metal groans under your combined weight. Her hands are trembling so badly she nearly slips, but you catch her arm and guide her up the ladder.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Below, shapes lurch through the alley—three, maybe four infected, drawn by the noise. They haven't seen you yet, but it's only a matter of time. Above, the rooftop offers uncertain safety.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Halfway up, the fire escape shudders violently. A section of the ladder below breaks loose, clattering against the wall. The infected below look up and screech. They've seen you. They begin climbing after you, their movements jerky but fast.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Keep climbing! Don't stop!","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Pull Mrs. Gutierrez up to the rooftop","description":"You redouble your efforts, practically dragging Mrs. Gutierrez up the last few rungs. The infected are climbing fast, but you might make it if you work together.","targetScene":"rooftop-with-neighbor","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You haul Mrs. Gutierrez onto the rooftop just as the first infected reaches the top of the ladder. You kick the ladder away, sending it crashing down into the alley. You're safe for now—but you're on the rooftop with a terrified elderly woman, and the ladder is gone. A man with a crowbar watches you from across the roof."},{"label":"Save yourself and leave Mrs. Gutierrez","description":"The infected are gaining. Mrs. Gutierrez is slowing you down. In a moment of terrible clarity, you realize you can't save both of you. You scramble ahead, leaving her behind.","targetScene":"rooftop-alone","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_ojuCkHkcDIOT3RPXR3Ig8103","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"hallway-window","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You force the window open, gasping at the rush of cool, smoke-tinged air. Below, a dumpster sits against the wall—your landing pad. The drop is two stories. It'll hurt, but it won't kill you.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You swing your legs over the sill and drop. You hit the dumpster lid with a deafening CLANG, the impact jarring your knees and spine. Pain shoots up your leg as you roll off and tumble to the pavement.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"fall"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're on the street. Overturned cars burn nearby, casting flickering orange light. Across the road, you spot a pharmacy with its front window smashed in. Medical supplies, maybe food. A survivor's dream. But from the darkness of the store, you hear a low, wet growl.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Enter the pharmacy for supplies","description":"Medical supplies are too valuable to pass up. You grip your weapon and step through the shattered glass into the dark pharmacy. The growl grows louder. Something is in there with you.","targetScene":"pharmacy","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The pharmacy is dark and smells of medicine and decay. Shelves have been toppled. As your eyes adjust, you see a figure hunched over by the counter—an infected, feeding. It hasn't noticed you yet. The back room may have more supplies, but you'll have to get past it."},{"label":"Cross the street and keep moving toward a safer area","description":"Supplies mean nothing if you're dead. You decide to push forward, staying to the shadows, heading east where the fires seem less intense.","targetScene":"street-run","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You move quickly through the burning streets, sticking to shadows and alleyways. You pass bodies and wreckage. After several blocks, you hear gunshots—not infected, but *human*. Someone else is alive out here, and they're fighting back."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_03_SYAMm3su1AxQz58gtuOc9839","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"stairwell-fight","location":"The Hallway","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You push through the stairwell door, knife raised, stomach churning.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The stairwell is a slaughterhouse. Blood paints the walls in grotesque arcs. Two infected crouch over a shape on the landing—a body you force yourself not to look at. Their heads snap toward you simultaneously, moving with an unnatural, fluid synchronization that makes your blood run cold.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"},{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"They rise. They screech—a sound that tears through the stairwell like broken glass. And they charge.","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Fight them head-on","description":"You have a knife, and they're between you and the ground floor. There's no other way. You scream and lunge at the closest infected, driving the blade forward.","targetScene":"stairwell-battle","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The fight is savage. You manage to stab one infected through the eye, but the other tackles you down the stairs. Pain explodes through your body. You and the infected tumble to the ground floor landing in a heap. You're wounded, but you made it to the bottom. The exit door is right there."},{"label":"Retreat back into the hallway","description":"There are two of them and one of you with a kitchen knife. Bravery is just another word for suicide. You slam the stairwell door shut and back away, looking for another route.","targetScene":"hallway-window","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":247,"output":2806,"cacheRead":15360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18413,"cost":{"input":0.00002223,"output":0.00050508,"cacheRead":0.0003072,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00083451}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783089659025,"responseId":"gen-1783089659-pwFL6HxwibTSSKD9zF3S","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
