{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, all 13 stubs still exist because my implementations failed. Let me implement them one at a time or in small batches properly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5889dbad2e5d4b5a87f07568","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"office-building","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You and Marcus descend into the dark office building. The interior is a maze of cubicles, overturned desks, and shattered computer monitors. Emergency lights cast dim red shadows across the space.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"A faint clicking sound echoes ahead—rhythmic, like fingernails tapping on a desk. But no one is at the computers. The sound comes from deeper in the darkness.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"You hearing that? It's not infected. Infected don't tap—they just... scream and bite.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Investigate the clicking sound with Marcus","description":"The sound might be another survivor. You and Marcus creep toward the source, weapons ready.","targetScene":"security-guard","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You find a security guard named Delroy hiding in a janitor's closet, tapping his fingernails nervously against a metal shelf. He's terrified but unharmed. He has keys, a flashlight, and knowledge of the building's layout. He says there's an underground parking garage with a service exit nearby."},{"label":"Head straight for the stairwell","description":"You can't risk unknown threats. You suggest to Marcus that you find the emergency stairwell and head down directly.","targetScene":"office-stairwell","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You and Marcus find the emergency stairwell. It's clear for now. You descend floor by floor. On the second floor landing, you hear voices below—human voices. A group of survivors is in the lobby, arguing."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3f431d4a13b74cc081a0d938","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"vehicle-search","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"Marcus leads you down the fire escape to street level. A parking lot behind the building holds several cars—most are damaged, windshields smashed, tires slashed. But one vehicle catches your eye: an old pickup truck sitting alone in the corner.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Nearby, a sport motorcycle lies on its side. The keys are still in the ignition. Both are options.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"We take the truck, we can carry more. We take the bike, we're faster. Your call.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Take the pickup truck","description":"The truck is sturdy and can carry supplies. You approach carefully. The keys are in the visor. The engine turns over with a roar.","targetScene":"vehicle-escape","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You're in a stolen pickup truck, careening through ruined streets. Infected scatter as you barrel past. Marcus navigates from the passenger seat. You're heading for the police station, but the road ahead is blocked by a collapsed overpass."},{"label":"Take the motorcycle instead","description":"The motorcycle is faster and more maneuverable. You right the bike and kick-start it. Marcus climbs on behind you.","targetScene":"motorcycle-escape","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The motorcycle weaves through alleys and side streets that a car couldn't fit. You feel exposed, but you're making good time toward the highway. Then you hear it—a massive crash ahead, and the roar of something bigger than infected."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a0b771c7532d467588c48892","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"convenience-store","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The convenience store is a treasure trove. Shelves are still stocked—the looters haven't gotten here yet. You grab bottled water, energy bars, batteries, a flashlight, and a small first-aid kit from behind the counter.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"As you're stuffing your backpack, you hear it—a vehicle engine. Tires crunching on debris. You peer through the shattered front window and see a pickup truck rolling slowly down the street, its bed full of armed people.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"They look like survivors, not raiders. They're scanning the buildings, clearly looking for supplies or other survivors.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Try to flag down the vehicle","description":"You step out and wave. The truck screeches to a halt. Armed survivors stare at you. 'You bit?' the driver asks. You prove you're clean.","targetScene":"survivor-truck","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The survivors in the truck are heading to a refugee camp set up at the city stadium. They offer you a ride. The truck bed is crowded but safe—for now."},{"label":"Avoid the vehicle and go solo","description":"You don't know these people. You grab what you can and slip out the back, disappearing into the alley network.","targetScene":"street-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_553b7593bed94f399e530f23","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"helicopter-rescue","location":"The Rooftop","passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The helicopter swings back toward your rooftop, its searchlight bathing you in blinding light. The rotors create a hurricane of wind and noise. A soldier leans out, motioning frantically.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"But the noise has drawn every infected for blocks. They pour onto the rooftop—climbing over the edges, breaking through the door. The barricade crumbles.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Run for the rope ladder","description":"You sprint toward the descending rope ladder as the helicopter hovers. Infected close in from all sides. It's a desperate dash for survival.","targetScene":"helicopter-rope","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You grab the rope ladder as the helicopter begins to ascend. Infected grab at your legs. You kick them off and haul yourself up. Looking down, you see Marcus fighting alone on the rooftop, surrounded. You reach for him, but the helicopter is already climbing."},{"label":"Fight back-to-back with Marcus","description":"You and Marcus stand together, swinging your weapons, covering each other as the helicopter descends to land. It's risky—it gives the infected time to surround you—but it keeps you both alive.","targetScene":"helicopter-landing","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The helicopter touches down. You and Marcus fight your way to the open door. Soldiers pull you aboard. The chopper lifts off as infected swarm the landing skids. You made it. Both of you. The city shrinks below as you fly toward safety."}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":144,"output":2356,"cacheRead":32256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34756,"cost":{"input":0.00001296,"output":0.00042408,"cacheRead":0.00064512,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00108216}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783090549824,"responseId":"gen-1783090549-sTQXy3KVmevjNqpSYFlV","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
