{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, 4 more done. Let me continue with the remaining stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_538b73109368494695af108b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"desperate-cross","location":"The Rooftop","passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You run for the plank, your heart hammering. Behind you, the infected swarm onto the rooftop—dozens of them, pouring through the shattered door. They see you. They charge.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The plank stretches across the gap, eight feet of wooden hope. Below, a three-story drop into darkness.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You have a split second to decide.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Sprint across the plank","description":"You take a deep breath and sprint across the plank. It wobbles wildly beneath you. An infected lunges onto the plank behind you, scrambling forward.","targetScene":"desperate-cross-result","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You reach the other side and kick the plank away, sending the creature plummeting. But you're on the wrong rooftop now—farther from safety, with no way back. You need to find a new way down, and the infected are watching from across the gap."},{"label":"Abandon the plank and go down the pipe","description":"The plank is too risky. You dive for the drainage pipe instead, sliding down it in a controlled fall, hitting the ground hard and rolling to your feet.","targetScene":"drainpipe-descent","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d609c8b9911148bc939c3f3f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"last-stand","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You grab the jagged metal rod from the shattered lamp and face the door. The infected pour through—not one, not two, but a flood of twisted bodies. You swing, connecting with the first one's skull. It drops. A second takes its place.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"},{"character":"You","effect":"angry"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You fight with everything you have. You take down three, four of them. But there are too many. They drag you down, their claws tearing, their teeth finding purchase. Mrs. Gutierrez's scream is the last thing you hear before the world goes dark.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Your story ends here, in your own apartment, surrounded by the monsters the world has become.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_054003fd242b4a4fb4dc0706","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"supply-apartment","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You emerge from the closet, heart pounding. The apartment is destroyed—furniture overturned, drawers pulled out, your belongings scattered. But the infected are gone.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You move quickly, grabbing what you can: a kitchen knife, a flashlight that still works, a half-full water bottle, some granola bars. Mrs. Gutierrez finds a heavy frying pan and clutches it like a lifeline.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"What now? Where do we go?","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"sad"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Take the hallway to the ground floor","description":"The hallway is clear now. You and Mrs. Gutierrez creep toward the stairwell, hoping the infected have moved on to other hunting grounds.","targetScene":"stairwell-clear","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The stairwell is empty, stained with blood and violence. You descend carefully, Mrs. Gutierrez following close behind. The ground floor lobby is a wreck, but the front doors are open. Outside, the street is eerily quiet."},{"label":"Head up to the rooftop via fire escape","description":"Going down means risking more infected. You decide to go up to the rooftop and see if there's a better view of the situation—or a way to signal for help.","targetScene":"rooftop-with-neighbor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2102e073a4c04f24be18d9d3","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"dawn-after","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"Dawn creeps through the closet's slats, pale and gray. You've survived the night. Your legs are cramped, your mouth dry, but you're alive.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You emerge from the closet stiff and hungry. Mrs. Gutierrez follows, her eyes red from crying. Through the apartment window, you see the city in daylight for the first time since it fell. Smoke rises from a dozen fires. Wreckage litters the streets. But in the distance, you see movement—figures picking their way through the debris.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Survivors. They're heading east, away from the worst of the fires. You could try to catch up to them.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Follow the survivors east","description":"There's safety in numbers. You and Mrs. Gutierrez gather your meager supplies and head out, trying to catch up to the group in the distance.","targetScene":"follow-survivors","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You follow the group at a distance, keeping to cover. They lead you through back alleys and side streets, avoiding main roads. After an hour, you reach a makeshift checkpoint—a survivor encampment at a school. Armed men and women watch the perimeter."},{"label":"Search for supplies first, then head out","description":"You can't travel without more supplies. You check neighboring apartments for food, water, and medicine before attempting the journey.","targetScene":"neighbor-search","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You search the other apartments on your floor. Most are empty or ransacked. In apartment 3A, you find canned food, a medical kit, and a radio. The radio crackles with a recorded message: 'Survivors report to the stadium. Military evacuation in progress.'"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":35006,"output":2140,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37146,"cost":{"input":0.00315054,"output":0.0003852,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00353574}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783090569968,"responseId":"gen-1783090570-YWtWuJbiQrC0OJIzBGS2","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
