{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good progress. Let me continue with the remaining stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_RC09Bgc263hDP0xSDDoI8959","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"pharmacy-sneak","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You hold your breath and creep along the wall, keeping low behind the pharmacy shelves. The infected is distracted, making wet sounds as it feeds. Your hand finds bandages, antiseptic wipes, and a bottle of painkillers. You stuff them into your bag.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You reach for a box of antibiotics on the top shelf. Your fingers brush it—and it falls. The bottle clatters on the linoleum floor. The infected's head snaps up. Its black eyes lock onto you. It screeches.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You bolt for the exit, crashing through the broken window and landing hard on the sidewalk. Behind you, the infected scrambles through the glass after you. You run, ignoring the burning in your lungs.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Keep running and lose it in the alleys","description":"You duck into a maze of alleys, leaping over trash and debris. The infected gives chase but you're faster, more desperate. You lose it after several blocks.","targetScene":"street-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"label":"Turn and fight","description":"You can't outrun everything. You stop, spin, and raise your weapon. The infected lunges. You sidestep and bring your weapon down on its skull.","targetScene":"pharmacy-fight-win","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You take down the infected with a well-aimed strike. Panting, you look around. The street is empty. You have medical supplies, but you're exhausted and exposed. A distant siren wails."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_Cx2vlfeOy4B0e3MscHIm4723","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"pharmacy-kill","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You approach the infected from behind, your weapon raised. Your hand trembles. One clean strike—that's all it takes. You bring the blade down at the base of its skull.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The creature crumples without a sound. You stand over it, breathing hard, staring at what you've done. It was a person once. Maybe someone's father, someone's brother. But you don't have time for that now.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You gather supplies quickly—antibiotics, bandages, painkillers, antiseptic. As you're stuffing them into your bag, you hear heavy footsteps outside. A group of infected is passing by the pharmacy entrance.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Hide behind the counter until they pass","description":"You duck behind the prescription counter, clutching your bag of supplies. The infected shuffle past the pharmacy entrance, their guttural moans fading as they move on.","targetScene":"pharmacy-hide","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The infected pass. You emerge from hiding. You're alive, armed with medical supplies, and alone. The street outside is empty now. You can hear distant gunfire to the east. People are still fighting."},{"label":"Try to slip out the back","description":"There might be a back exit. You search the pharmacy's rear and find a stockroom door leading to an alley. You slip out quietly.","targetScene":"alley-escape","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You emerge into a narrow alley behind the pharmacy. A chain-link fence blocks one end, but the other leads to a side street. As you move toward the street, you see a man in a leather jacket crouched behind a dumpster—Marcus."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_cPzwOiqXrUgTEGunPAEG4508","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"reach-barricade","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You spot a drainage culvert that runs under the street—a dark, narrow tunnel that leads past the horde. It's filled with filthy water and God knows what else, but it's your only path.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You lower yourself into the culvert. The water is freezing cold and rises to your chest. You wade through the darkness, your hand on the slimy wall, trying not to think about what you're touching.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You emerge on the other side, dripping and shivering. The barricade is twenty yards away. A survivor spots you and shouts. Hands wave you in. You run.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You scramble over the sandbags and collapse inside the perimeter. Rough hands pat you down for bites, check you for fever. You're in. You've found a safe zone—for now.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Tell the survivors what you've seen","description":"You share information about the building you came from, the infected activity, and the general state of the streets. The survivors are grateful for the intel.","targetScene":"safe-zone-intel","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The survivors welcome your information. Their leader, a former police officer named Rivera, explains that they're trying to hold this intersection as a checkpoint for evacuees. They have radios, and they've heard the military is evacuating people from the stadium downtown."},{"label":"Rest and recover before deciding your next move","description":"You're exhausted, cold, and hungry. You ask for a moment to rest. Someone hands you a blanket and a cup of water. You sit against a sandbag and close your eyes, just for a moment.","targetScene":"rest-at-barricade","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You rest at the barricade for an hour. When you wake, the situation has changed—the horde has moved on, but more survivors have trickled in with news of a military evacuation at the football stadium, three miles east."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_03_zaQsob201bnNiIl70NTJ9334","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"side-street","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You turn away from the barricade and head down a quieter side street. The residential neighborhood is eerily peaceful compared to the chaos behind you. Lawns are overgrown, mail sits in boxes, and a child's bicycle lies abandoned on a driveway.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You find an abandoned bicycle leaning against a fence. The tires are good. A map is tucked into the basket. The highway is marked two miles east.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You pedal through the quiet streets, the only sound the whir of wheels on asphalt. It feels almost normal—until you round a corner and see a military checkpoint ahead. Real soldiers, with real guns.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Approach the military checkpoint","description":"The soldiers see you. They raise their weapons but don't fire. You raise your hands. 'I'm not infected!' you shout. They motion you forward for screening.","targetScene":"military-checkpoint","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The soldiers are from the National Guard. They've set up an evacuation point. They screen you for bites and fever, then wave you toward a waiting bus. 'We're taking survivors to the stadium. Safe zone's there.'"},{"label":"Avoid the checkpoint and keep going on your own","description":"You don't trust the military. You've seen too many movies where the safe zone is just another trap. You veer away and continue east on your own.","targetScene":"highway-escape","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You bypass the checkpoint and continue toward the highway. The road is clogged with abandoned cars. You weave between them on your bike. In the distance, you see columns of smoke rising from what might be the stadium."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_04_tlCXduWqq8ENAMD4IKEv5526","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"basement-tunnels","location":"Street Level","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You descend into the basement. The air grows cold and damp. Emergency lights flicker, casting long shadows across concrete walls. You find a service door marked 'MAINTENANCE TUNNEL.'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The tunnel stretches into darkness, connecting to neighboring buildings. It's a hidden path through the city's underbelly—safe from the infected above. But as you move deeper, you hear whispers. Faint, echoing voices.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The whispers grow louder. You round a corner and see them—a group of survivors huddled around a small fire in a junction of tunnels. They see you. Hands reach for weapons.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"},{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Whoa there! Who are you? You bit?","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Prove you're clean and join the tunnel survivors","description":"You show them your arms, let them check you. They relax slightly. Their leader, a woman named Rosa, explains they've been living in the tunnels since the outbreak. They know a safe route to the city outskirts.","targetScene":"tunnel-survivors","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Rosa and her group have built a small community in the tunnels. They have food, water, and a plan to escape the city through an old storm drain that leads beyond the quarantine zone. They offer you a place among them."},{"label":"Back away and find another route","description":"You don't trust anyone down here. You raise your hands and slowly back away, disappearing back into the dark tunnel.","targetScene":"tunnel-alone","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You retreat into the darkness, navigating the tunnels alone. After an hour of wandering, you find a ladder leading up to a manhole cover. You push it open and climb out onto an empty street on the edge of the city."}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":11778,"output":3050,"cacheRead":23808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38636,"cost":{"input":0.00106002,"output":0.000549,"cacheRead":0.00047616,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00208518}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783090594775,"responseId":"gen-1783090594-RWGKK4djUlRScNVEL6L1","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
