{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me keep going and implement the remaining stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_LvdVsK3DUYF9EUacmH612774","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You grab the rope ladder and start climbing as the helicopter ascends. Infected grab at your legs, but you kick them off. You pull yourself up, gasping. Below, Marcus is surrounded.","label":"Reach for Marcus from the ladder","targetScene":"marcus-saved-or-lost","targetSceneDescription":"You cling to the rope ladder, reaching down for Marcus. He makes a desperate leap and grabs your hand. The helicopter climbs higher. You haul him up as infected snatch at the air below. You both make it, dangling from the ladder as the city falls away beneath you.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You scramble up the rope, not looking back. Marcus was a useful ally, but you can't die for him. You climb into the helicopter and collapse on the floor.","label":"Save yourself","targetScene":"evacuated-alone","targetSceneDescription":"You're pulled into the helicopter. Below, Marcus disappears under a wave of infected. The soldier closes the door. You close your eyes. You survived. But the look the soldier gives you says everything.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}],"id":"helicopter-rope","location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You sprint for the rope ladder as it descends from the hovering helicopter. The rotor wash batters you, threatening to knock you off your feet. Behind you, infected claw their way across the rooftop.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You grab the rope. It swings wildly. Below you, an infected lunges—its fingers brush your ankle. You kick out, feeling its jaw break. You start to climb.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Looking down, you see Marcus fighting alone on the rooftop, his crowbar swinging. He's holding them back, giving you time. But he's being surrounded.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_iLI7VOGlx1XhOQaEFJNT5778","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The helicopter touches down. You and Marcus fight your way to the open door as soldiers cover you. You're both pulled aboard as the chopper lifts off, leaving the infected behind.","label":"Both of you make it","targetScene":"evacuated-together","targetSceneDescription":"You and Marcus sit on the vibrating floor of the helicopter, gasping, bleeding, but alive. A medic checks your wounds. Below, the city burns. You're heading to a military base outside the city. You made it. You both made it.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"At the last second, Marcus shoves you toward the helicopter and turns to face the horde. 'Go!' he roars. 'I'll hold them off!'","label":"Marcus sacrifices himself","targetScene":"evacuated-alone","targetSceneDescription":"You're dragged into the helicopter as Marcus throws himself at the advancing infected, buying you precious seconds. The last image you see is him swinging his crowbar, disappearing beneath a sea of bodies.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}],"id":"helicopter-landing","location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The helicopter touches down on the rooftop, its skids barely finding purchase on the tar-paper surface. A soldier leans out, screaming over the rotor noise, 'GET IN! NOW!'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You and Marcus fight back-to-back, a whirlwind of crowbar and pipe. An infected charges—you smash its skull. Another lunges—Marcus's crowbar takes it in the throat. You're a team, moving in perfect sync.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"angry"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You reach the helicopter door. Soldiers grab your arms and haul you inside. Marcus is right behind you. An infected grabs his leg as he reaches for the door.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"fall"},{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_gfIKPXDTwHW6m1LUOtnN1105","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You wake up to find the horde has moved on. More survivors have trickled in. The leader, Rivera, approaches you with news: 'The military is evacuating people from the stadium. We're going to make a run for it. You in?'","label":"Join the run to the stadium","targetScene":"stadium-run","targetSceneDescription":"You join a group of survivors making their way to the stadium. The journey is three miles through infected territory. But the group is armed and determined. Together, you might make it.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You thank Rivera but decide to stay at the barricade. It's safer here. Maybe the military will come to you.","label":"Stay at the barricade","targetScene":"barricade-siege","targetSceneDescription":"You stay at the barricade. Days pass. The infected grow bolder. Supplies run low. One night, the barricade falls. You make your last stand with the people who took you in. It's a good way to go.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}],"id":"rest-at-barricade","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You accept the blanket and cup of water gratefully. You find a spot against a sandbag and close your eyes, just for a moment. The sounds of the city fade into a dull backdrop.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You wake with a jolt. An hour has passed. The sun is higher now. Around you, the barricade is bustling with activity—more survivors have arrived, and the mood has shifted.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Good, you're awake. Listen—the horde moved on, but we've been hearing reports. Military evacuation at the football stadium. We're putting together a group to try to reach it.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_03_3lJl7Z0Fh0bgZ7jP1gTi0153","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The group welcomes you. Rosa, their leader, offers you a spot in their tunnel community. They have food, water, and a plan to escape through an old storm drain.","label":"Join the tunnel community","targetScene":"tunnel-escape","targetSceneDescription":"You join Rosa's group. They've been surviving in the tunnels for weeks. They know every passage, every junction. Their escape route leads to an old drainage system that empties into a river beyond the quarantine zone. Freedom awaits—if you can make it through the tunnels.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You politely decline and ask if they can point you toward the surface exit instead.","label":"Ask for directions and leave","targetScene":"tunnel-alone","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"tunnel-survivors","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You hold your ground and show them your arms. Clean. No bites. The tension eases slightly. A woman with short gray hair and kind eyes steps forward.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Rosa. I'm the one keeping these folks alive down here. You lost?","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You explain your situation. Rosa listens, nodding. Around her, the tunnel survivors watch you with wary eyes—men, women, even a few children. They've made a life down here in the darkness.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"We've been down here since Day One. The infected don't come into the tunnels—too dark, too cold. We've got food, water, and a plan. There's an old storm drain that leads beyond the quarantine zone. We're leaving tonight. You can join us.","character":"Rosa","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_04_0kEdcJHALIPbcxnPmuPX8464","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You hike through the damaged streets, following the trail of other survivors. The road to the stadium is littered with obstacles, but you push through. After two hours, the massive structure looms ahead, surrounded by military vehicles.","label":"Walk to the stadium","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneDescription":"You arrive at the stadium refugee camp. Thousands of survivors are packed into the structure and surrounding tents. Soldiers patrol the perimeter. It's crowded, chaotic, but safe—for now. You've found sanctuary.","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You find a working bicycle and pedal toward the stadium, making better time. The wind in your face feels like freedom.","label":"Find a bicycle","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"follow-survivors","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You and Mrs. Gutierrez leave the apartment building, stepping into the daylight for the first time since the world ended. The street is a graveyard of cars and debris. Smoke hangs in the air like fog.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You spot the group of survivors ahead—maybe a dozen people moving single file along the side of the road. They're heading east, away from the worst of the fires. You follow at a distance, keeping to cover.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The trail leads through back alleys and side streets. After an hour, you see what they're heading toward: a massive structure rising above the low buildings. The football stadium. And around it, military vehicles.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Is that... rescue?","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"happy"}]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":3830,"output":2980,"cacheRead":38528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45338,"cost":{"input":0.0003447,"output":0.0005364,"cacheRead":0.00077056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00165166}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783090665821,"responseId":"gen-1783090665-ECtgX0hajNOh29ONGjrf","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
