{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The desperate-cross-result scene failed because of the garbled input. Let me try again with a clean call.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me fix the desperate-cross-result scene and continue with the remaining stubs\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dd2f40ef8dee4ff28632c6b7","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You find a maintenance ladder on the side of the building. Climbing down, you emerge onto a quiet street.","label":"Climb down the maintenance ladder","targetScene":"alley-escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You spot a broken window on the top floor of this building. Inside, you might find supplies or another way down.","label":"Enter through a broken window","targetScene":"building-interior","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You climb through a broken window into a ransacked apartment. You find a working radio. A voice crackles: '...stadium... evacuation... repeat... military evacuation at the football stadium...'"}],"id":"desperate-cross-result","location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You land hard on the opposite rooftop, roll, and scramble to your feet. The plank wobbles behind you. An infected lunges onto it, but you kick it away before it can cross. It plummets into the alley below with a wet crunch.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're alone on an unfamiliar rooftop. Across the gap, the infected that pursued you mill about, unable to cross. For now, you're safe. But you need to find a way down.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c88900c85b994ae9afa1a293","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The staircase is clear. You and Mrs. Gutierrez descend carefully, making it to the ground floor. The lobby is destroyed, but the front doors are open. You step out onto the street.","label":"Exit onto the street","targetScene":"street-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You spot a basement door. Maybe there's another way out—or a place to hide.","label":"Check the basement","targetScene":"basement-tunnels","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"stairwell-clear","location":"The Hallway","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You open the front door of your apartment. The hallway is empty, lit only by the flickering emergency lights. The air is still.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Mrs. Gutierrez follows close behind, clutching her frying pan like a lifeline. You creep toward the stairwell. The door groans as you push it open.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The stairwell is empty. Blood stains the walls, but the infected are gone. You descend floor by floor, holding your breath at every landing.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You reach the ground floor. The lobby doors are open to the street. Outside, the world has changed forever.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_35d776b9e8f142af943aa01e","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You find canned food, bottled water, and a first-aid kit in apartment 3A. More importantly, you find a handgun in a nightstand drawer, with a box of ammunition. Mrs. Gutierrez looks at it with fear, but you feel safer.","label":"Take the gun and supplies","targetScene":"armed-exit","targetSceneDescription":"Armed and supplied, you're ready to face the city. You and Mrs. Gutierrez head for the stairwell, determined to reach the stadium where rescue awaits.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You find a radio and manage to get a signal. A recorded message loops: 'Survivors report to the football stadium. Military evacuation in progress. Repeat: all survivors report to the stadium.'","label":"Listen to the radio message","targetScene":"stadium-call","targetSceneDescription":"The radio message gives you hope. The stadium is where you need to go. You pack what you can and set out, Mrs. Gutierrez at your side, heading toward the distant structure visible above the rooftops.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}],"id":"neighbor-search","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You step into the hallway, checking neighboring apartments. Most doors are open, the rooms ransacked. But apartment 3A is locked from the inside.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Mrs. Chen lives here. She's... she was my bridge partner.","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You try the door. It's unlocked. You push it open slowly. The apartment is empty, but there are signs of a hurried departure. In the kitchen, you find canned food. In the bedroom, a first-aid kit. And in a nightstand drawer—a handgun.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_409ec746805b4dab9b6e4506","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You catch your breath and check your supplies. The street ahead is clear. You decide to head east, following the sound of distant gunfire—where there's fighting, there are survivors.","label":"Head toward the gunfire","targetScene":"street-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You duck into a nearby building to rest and regroup. Any port in a storm.","label":"Take shelter in a building","targetScene":"building-interior","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"pharmacy-fight-win","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You stop running. You turn. The infected lunges. You sidestep, using its momentum against it, and bring your weapon down on the base of its skull with all your strength.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"angry"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"It crumples. You stand over it, panting, your hands shaking. You did it. You won.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You check your bag. The medical supplies are still there. You're bleeding from a dozen small cuts from the pharmacy window, but nothing serious. You need to keep moving.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f1a3cc54b87243a8b94c71ce","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The infected pass. You emerge from behind the counter, grab your supplies, and slip out onto the street. The coast is clear—for now.","label":"Head to the street","targetScene":"street-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You find a back door leading to an alley. You slip out, avoiding the street entirely.","label":"Exit through the back","targetScene":"alley-escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"pharmacy-hide","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You duck behind the prescription counter, pressing yourself into the shadows. Your heart hammers so loud you're sure it'll give you away.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The infected shuffle past the pharmacy entrance. You count their footsteps—six, maybe seven of them. One pauses at the door, letting out a low, guttural moan. Then it moves on.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The sounds fade. You're alone. You have a bag full of medical supplies and a clear path out.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_80a3136eaf9146039bcc6ace","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You take the information about the barricade and the horde movements. Rivera radios ahead to warn others. You feel like you've made a difference.","label":"Share what you know","targetScene":"stadium-run","targetSceneDescription":"Rivera organizes a group to move toward the stadium. You travel with the barricade survivors, sharing your knowledge of the area. The journey is dangerous, but together you make it.","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You decide to stay at the barricade and help defend it. It may not be the stadium, but it's home now.","label":"Stay and defend the barricade","targetScene":"barricade-siege","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"safe-zone-intel","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You sit down with Rivera, the barricade's leader. He's a weathered police officer in his fifties, his eyes carrying the weight of everything he's seen.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Tell me what you saw out there. Where'd you come from? How bad is it?","character":"Rivera","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Rivera","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You describe the apartment building, the infected in the stairwell, the chaos in the streets. Rivera listens intently, nodding.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Good intel. We've been hearing reports that the military is setting up evacuation at the football stadium. We're planning to make a run for it. You in?","character":"Rivera","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Rivera","effect":"happy"}]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":53098,"output":3204,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56302,"cost":{"input":0.00477882,"output":0.00057672,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00535554}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783090731150,"responseId":"gen-1783090731-mvG1McdemGIvDoaenlcQ","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
