{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a124a4f7974e48efa4765f4d","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You reach down and grab Marcus's hand. He clings to you, his weight nearly pulling you off the ladder. But you hold on. Together, you climb to safety.","label":"Pull Marcus up","targetScene":"evacuated-together","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't hold on. Marcus slips. You watch him fall, disappearing into the horde below. You close your eyes and climb.","label":"Watch Marcus fall","targetScene":"evacuated-alone","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"marcus-saved-or-lost","location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You cling to the rope ladder, the helicopter ascending. Below, Marcus fights alone, surrounded. He looks up and sees you on the ladder.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"GO! Just GO!","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"angry"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"But then he makes a break for it—sprinting toward the ladder, cutting through the infected with his crowbar. He leaps, his hand grabbing the bottom rung just as the helicopter climbs higher.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"He's dangling below you, his weight threatening to pull the ladder loose. You have to decide now.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_99dcee4668c7429e805e0b51","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You sit in the helicopter, alone with your thoughts. The medic bandages your wounds. The city disappears into the smoke. You survived. That will have to be enough.","label":"Accept the solitude","targetScene":"ending-survivor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You demand the pilot take you back. 'There are more survivors!' you shout. 'We can't just leave them!'","label":"Demand to go back","targetScene":"ending-survivor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"evacuated-alone","location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You're pulled into the helicopter. The soldier slams the door shut. Below, through the window, you see the rooftop disappear—and with it, Marcus.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The helicopter banks away from the city. The burning skyline fills the window. A medic checks your wounds, saying something you can't hear over the rotor noise.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're alive. That's what matters. That's what everyone will tell you. But as you fly away from the ruins of your city, you can't help but feel like you left a part of yourself behind.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c2ccb895dc9549a38da9b037","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You and Marcus slump against the helicopter wall, gasping. A medic hands you both water. Marcus meets your eyes and nods once. No words needed.","label":"Share the moment with Marcus","targetScene":"ending-together","targetSceneDescription":"You and Marcus made it out together. Two strangers who became allies, who became friends. The road ahead is uncertain, but you won't walk it alone.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You look out the window as the city burns below. You think about everyone you've lost. But you're here, you're alive, and you'll carry their memories forward.","label":"Look out at the burning city","targetScene":"ending-survivor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"evacuated-together","location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You grab Marcus's hand and haul him aboard. He tumbles into the helicopter, gasping. An infected lunges after him, but a soldier kicks it back into the void and slams the door.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"fall"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The helicopter banks hard. You and Marcus slide across the metal floor, landing in a heap. For a long moment, neither of you speaks—just breathing, just being alive.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"You... you came back for me.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"We're in this together. That's what you said, right?","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The helicopter carries you both away from the burning city. Below, the world you knew crumbles into ash. But above the clouds, a new world is waiting.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_051f07f7efab4fbf962143b5","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You join the march through the city. The group moves quickly, staying to shadows. You encounter infected three times, fighting through each time. The stadium gates appear just as dusk falls.","label":"March with the group","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The group is too large and too loud. You break off from them, choosing to make your own way to the stadium.","label":"Go solo to the stadium","targetScene":"highway-escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"stadium-run","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The group assembles in the lobby. Twelve people, ranging from office workers to security guards. Makeshift weapons in hand. Fear in every eye.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Alright, listen up! We're heading to the stadium. It's three miles east. Stay together, stay quiet, and we'll make it.","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You file out the back entrance. The streets are quiet—too quiet. The infected are out there, but for now, they're hidden. You move in a tight formation, checking every intersection.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The journey takes hours. Twice you hide from passing hordes. Once, you fight—losing one of your group. But the stadium grows closer with every step.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_30bb9623cd604d71b5e26e57","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The barricade holds for days. But eventually, the infected come in force. You fight alongside Rivera and the others. It's a good last stand.","label":"Make your last stand","targetScene":"ending-last-stand","targetSceneDescription":"The barricade falls. You fight until the end, surrounded by the people who became your family in the darkest of times. The world may have ended, but you faced it on your feet.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"When the barricade comes under attack, you slip away in the chaos, heading for the stadium alone.","label":"Escape in the chaos","targetScene":"stadium-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"barricade-siege","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"Days pass at the barricade. You fall into a rhythm—watch, sleep, scavenge, watch again. The infected grow bolder. Supplies dwindle.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"On the third night, they come in force. A wave of infected, dozens strong, crashes against the barricade. Sandbags shift. Cars rock. The defenders fight with everything they have.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"},{"character":"You","effect":"angry"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Rivera falls beside you, his gun empty. You grab his weapon and keep firing. But there are too many. The barricade is breached.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7b8a03cf89e742f4bd4425d1","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You follow Rosa's group through the storm drain. The tunnel is dark and claustrophobic, but it leads beyond the quarantine zone. You emerge into a forest on the outskirts of the city.","label":"Escape through the storm drain","targetScene":"ending-free","targetSceneDescription":"You emerge from the tunnel into a dense forest. The sounds of the city are distant. You're free. Rosa's group has a camp nearby. You've found a new family and a new home.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Halfway through the tunnel, you hear voices ahead—not Rosa's group. Raiders. You turn back, leaving the group to their fate.","label":"Turn back and go your own way","targetScene":"tunnel-alone","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"tunnel-escape","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"Rosa leads the group through the winding tunnels. Children cling to their parents. The adults carry what supplies they have. The only light comes from flashlights and a few dim emergency bulbs.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"The storm drain is just ahead. It leads under the quarantine wall. Once we're out, we're in the uninfected zone.","character":"Rosa","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Rosa","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The tunnel narrows. Water trickles around your ankles. The sound of dripping echoes all around you. Then you see it—a grate, with moonlight streaming through.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Rosa works the bolts free. The grate swings open. Fresh air floods in. Freedom.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bfdc769a57fa4297b82e46d6","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"Together, you and Delroy clear enough rubble to squeeze the van through. You emerge onto a side street. Delroy knows a route to the stadium that avoids main roads.","label":"Clear the rubble together","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The rubble is too heavy. You search the garage and find a service elevator. It's risky, but it might take you to the roof where you can cross to another building.","label":"Take the service elevator up","targetScene":"desperate-cross-result","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"rubble-clear","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You, Marcus, and Delroy work together to move the rubble. It's exhausting, dangerous work. The concrete is heavy, and you're all on edge, listening for infected.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Almost there! Just a few more pieces!","character":"Delroy","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Delroy","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You shift the last piece of rubble. The path is clear. You pile into the van, and Delroy takes the wheel. The engine echoes through the garage as you speed toward the exit ramp.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You burst out onto the street. Sunlight floods the cabin. You're moving. You're alive.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":58347,"output":3952,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62299,"cost":{"input":0.00525123,"output":0.00071136,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00596259}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783090833318,"responseId":"gen-1783090833-JWn1S3EbAyu5fBIIInoD","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
