{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue implementing the last remaining stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3bbafe2875714f5cb48ac31b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You settle into the police station. It's organized and safe. Officers coordinate with the military. You're assigned a cot and a meal. You've found refuge.","label":"Stay at the station","targetScene":"ending-survivor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The police are organizing a convoy to the stadium. You decide to join it, hoping the larger safe zone offers more long-term security.","label":"Join the convoy","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"police-station-safe","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The police station is a hive of activity. Officers coordinate on radios, medics tend to the wounded, and volunteers distribute food and water.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Welcome to the last safe block. Name's Officer Daniels. Let's get you checked out.","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're given a cot in a conference room. Other survivors sit quietly, staring at nothing. The weight of everything you've been through settles on your shoulders.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"An officer announces that a convoy will be heading to the stadium evacuation point tomorrow. You have a choice to make.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d70b4e3067d7484cbabf6189","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You carefully ascend to the upper level. The source of the scraping becomes clear—a young woman is trying to push a car off the edge to create a distraction below. She's terrified but tough.","label":"Approach the woman cautiously","targetScene":"garage-survivor","targetSceneDescription":"The woman, whose name is Jade, was hiding in the garage when the outbreak hit. She's been surviving alone for days. She knows a route to the stadium through the maintenance tunnels. She offers to guide you.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The scraping sound could be a trap. You decide to leave the garage quietly and continue on foot.","label":"Leave the garage quietly","targetScene":"alley-escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"garage-upper-level","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You ascend the concrete ramp to the upper level of the parking garage. The scraping sound grows louder. You peer between rows of parked cars.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You see her—a young woman with a streak of gray in her dark hair, her hands bloody from shoving against the bumper of an old sedan. She's trying to push it off the ledge.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"She senses you before she sees you. She spins, a tire iron in her hand, ready to fight.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"Whoa! I'm not infected! I'm just trying to get out of this city!","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_16712d36a6e444c28c04b88c","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You climb through the broken window into a dark, ransacked apartment. A radio on the kitchen counter crackles with static—then clears. '...stadium... evacuation... repeat... military evacuation at the football stadium...'","label":"Listen to the radio","targetScene":"stadium-call","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You search the apartment for supplies. You find a backpack, some canned food, and a map of the city. The stadium is marked three miles east.","label":"Search for supplies","targetScene":"stadium-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"building-interior","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You squeeze through the broken window, landing silently on a carpeted floor. You're in an apartment—someone's home, now abandoned. Furniture is overturned, drawers pulled out.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"A radio on the kitchen counter flickers with a blinking red light. It's picking up a signal. You turn up the volume.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A distorted recording loops: '...this is an emergency broadcast... military evacuation in progress at the football stadium... all survivors are advised to make their way to the stadium... repeat... the stadium is a designated safe zone...'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7dfe5a29b26541629cb4109a","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"Armed with the handgun, you feel more confident. You and Mrs. Gutierrez head for the stairwell. The journey ahead is dangerous, but you're ready.","label":"Head for the stadium","targetScene":"stadium-run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You strap the gun to your hip and lead Mrs. Gutierrez through the building's back exit, hoping to avoid the main streets.","label":"Take the back exit","targetScene":"alley-escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"armed-exit","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You check the handgun. It's loaded. The weight of it in your hand changes something—you're not just prey anymore. You're a survivor.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"I don't like guns. But I like those things out there even less.","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You pack the supplies into your backpack: canned food, water, first-aid kit, ammunition. Mrs. Gutierrez finds a sturdy walking stick and hefts it like a club.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Together, you leave the apartment for the last time. The hallway is empty. The stairwell is quiet. Somewhere out there, the stadium waits.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e0d20b20763d4223ba406f6a","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You head toward the stadium, visible above the rooftops. The journey is long but clear. You arrive at the gates as dusk falls.","label":"Head to the stadium","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You decide to explore the neighborhood first, hoping to find more supplies or other survivors.","label":"Explore the neighborhood","targetScene":"alley-escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"stadium-call","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The radio message repeats on a loop. The stadium. That's where you need to go. You memorize the directions and turn off the radio to save the batteries.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"The stadium... I used to go there with my husband. Football games. Concerts. It seems like another life now.","character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Gutierrez","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You leave the apartment and emerge onto the street. The stadium rises in the distance, a beacon of hope against the smoke-filled sky. You start walking.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_24f68cd6fa9d4b6495460e55","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You follow the highway out of the city. The road stretches ahead, empty and open. You've left the nightmare behind. Ahead lies only the unknown.","label":"Drive into the unknown","targetScene":"ending-free","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You don't leave. You find a high point on the highway and look back at the city one last time. So much loss. But you're still here.","label":"Look back at the city","targetScene":"ending-survivor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"highway-out","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You clear the last row of abandoned cars. The highway opens up before you—clear asphalt stretching toward the horizon. The city is behind you.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You stop for a moment and look back. The city skyline is shrouded in smoke. Fires flicker like candles on a birthday cake for the dead. You turn away.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The road ahead is empty. Quiet. The world beyond the city is unknown—it could be safe, or it could be worse. But for the first time since the outbreak began, you have a choice. You're free.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7c1ce6ed8ee1446eac6ee400","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You climb aboard the troop transport. The soldiers are heading to reinforce the stadium. You're going back into danger, but with support. This time, you're not alone.","label":"Ride with the convoy","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The convoy is too large, too slow. You wave them on and continue on foot, moving faster on your own.","label":"Continue on foot","targetScene":"highway-out","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"military-convoy","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The convoy rumbles to a halt. Armored vehicles, troop transports, supply trucks. A soldier jumps down from the lead vehicle, weapon ready.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"jump"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"You a survivor? Get in the transport. We're heading to the stadium to reinforce the evacuation.","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You climb aboard. The transport is full of young soldiers, their faces pale with fear but their eyes hard with determination. One of them hands you a rifle.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"You know how to use one of these?","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_98dab714004f4db6a97529ee","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[],"id":"ending-survivor","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You made it. Against all odds, against the darkness that swallowed the world, you survived.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The road ahead is uncertain. The infection is still out there. Friends are lost. The world will never be the same. But you're still breathing. You're still fighting. You're still you.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"This is not the end of your story. This is just the beginning.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ed9252b3807e49a994b1fc79","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[],"id":"ending-together","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You and Marcus stand side by side, looking out at the uncertain future. Two strangers who became brothers in the fire.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"},{"character":"Marcus","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"What now?","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"We survive. Together.","character":"Marcus","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"And that's exactly what you do.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_41923a13d0e847c2bcc3340b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[],"id":"ending-last-stand","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The barricade falls. The infected pour through. You fight with everything you have, side by side with the people who became your family.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"angry"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You take down three, four, five of them. But there are always more. Your weapon breaks. Your body gives out.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"fall"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"As the world fades, you think of the choices you made, the people you met, the battles you fought. You did not go quietly into that good night. You raged against the dying of the light.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"And in the end, that's all anyone can do.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d92ec141878a486b87c97409","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[],"id":"ending-free","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You step out of the darkness and into the light. The sun is warm on your face. The air smells of trees, not smoke. The sounds of the city are gone.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're free. The infection, the chaos, the death—it's all behind you. Ahead lies a world waiting to be rebuilt.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The nightmare is over. But the dream is just beginning.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7f5c52a8351044b39ec79be3","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You find Jade and follow her through the maintenance tunnels. She knows the city's underground like the back of her hand. After an hour of navigating, you emerge near the stadium.","label":"Follow Jade through the tunnels","targetScene":"stadium-camp","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You thank Jade but decide to go alone. The tunnels could be a trap.","label":"Go alone","targetScene":"tunnel-alone","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"garage-survivor","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The woman lowers her tire iron slightly. 'You're not one of them?' Her voice is hoarse, like she hasn't spoken in days.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"No. I'm trying to get to the stadium. Military evacuation.","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"The stadium? That's where I was heading. I'm Jade. I've been hiding in this garage for three days. I know a way through the maintenance tunnels that'll get us there without going through the streets.","character":"Jade","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Jade","effect":"walk"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2b0a83b86d81410ab04eb210","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The rumors are true. The military is considering firebombing the city. You need to get out—now. You make plans to leave the camp.","label":"Plan to escape the camp","targetScene":"highway-out","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You decide to confront the military command about the rumors. If they're planning to destroy the city, there must be another way.","label":"Confront the commanders","targetScene":"ending-survivor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"camp-rumors","location":"Street Level","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["sunny"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You move through the camp, listening. Whispers travel faster than news here. The stories are all different, but they share a dark thread.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"walk"}]},{"type":"dialogue","content":"I heard they're going to firebomb the whole city. Containment protocol. They're not evacuating us—they're just getting us out of the blast zone.","character":"You","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Your blood runs cold. You look up at the stadium walls, suddenly feeling less like a sanctuary and more like a cage.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You need to find out the truth. And you need to decide what to do with it.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":6801,"output":5818,"cacheRead":57344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69963,"cost":{"input":0.00061209,"output":0.00104724,"cacheRead":0.00114688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00280621}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783090990567,"responseId":"gen-1783090990-VHuEhUCPGnLCPooarCpv","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
