{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to implement the start scene. Let me think about the choices the player can make. The scene description mentions:\\n\\n1. A frantic pounding at the front door - Marcus, the neighbor, begging to be let in\\n2. The fire escape with a guttural howl from the alley below\\n3. The city outside the window is in chaos\\n\\nSo logical choices would be:\\n- Open the door for Marcus\\n- Go to the window to assess the situation\\n- Grab supplies/weapon and prepare\\n- Try the fire escape\\n\\nLet me create the start scene with these choices. I need to think about the checkpoint system.\\n\\nThe system says:\\n- I can flag new scenes as checkpoints\\n- Minimum spacing between checkpoints (not defined yet, let me check)\\n- Maximum frontier checkpoints at a time (not defined)\\n- Maximum distance from checkpoint\\n\\nLet me implement the start scene first, and as I create scenes, I'll create new scene stubs. Let me start with the initial implementation.\\n\\nFor the start scene, I'll offer three choices:\\n1. Open the door for Marcus\\n2. Look out the window at the city chaos\\n3. Grab your emergency bag and head for the fire escape","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me implement the starting scene with choices that branch the story.\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_837565d3e73349f89c178e15","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"start","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":true,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The emergency broadcast on your phone didn't end with instructions; it ended with a wet, choking scream that cut to static just as the power grid blew, plunging your apartment into an oppressive, heavy darkness.","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Outside your third-story window, the familiar hum of the city has mutated into a chaotic symphony of screeching tires, distant explosions, and an underlying, rhythmic *scuffling* sound that makes the hairs on your arms stand up.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A frantic, heavy pounding suddenly rattles your front door, accompanied by the panicked voice of your neighbor **Marcus** begging to be let in. From the alleyway directly below your fire escape, you hear the unmistakable sound of breaking glass and a guttural, distinctly non-human howl.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"internal_dialogue","character":"The Narrator","content":"Everything has gone to hell in the span of minutes. You need to move. Now. Every second you hesitate is a second closer to whatever is *out there* finding you.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Marcus's terrified voice cuts through the chaos, begging for help. You've known him for two years—he loaned you sugar, you fed his cat once. You can't just leave him out there. You stride to the door, hand reaching for the deadbolt.","label":"Open the door for Marcus","targetScene":"open_for_marcus","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You unlock the deadbolt and pull open the door, revealing Marcus in the dim hallway light, his face pale and streaked with sweat. Behind him, the stairwell door creaks ominously."},{"description":"You need information before you act. Silently, you creep to the window, pressing yourself against the wall as you peer through the curtain at the nightmare unfolding in the streets below. The city is burning, and something is moving through the flames.","label":"Look out the window to assess the situation","targetScene":"window_lookout","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You edge to the window and peek through the blinds. The city below is a war zone—cars overturned, fires spreading, and strange, loping figures darting between the wreckage. You need a plan."},{"description":"Your hands are shaking as you grab the emergency duffel bag you've kept packed since the last storm season. Flashlight, water, first aid kit, multi-tool. The fire escape is right there, and the back alley might be safer than the front of the building.","label":"Grab your emergency bag and head for the fire escape","targetScene":"fire_escape_choice","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You snatch your bag and move to the kitchen window, sliding it open. The rusted fire escape groans as you step onto it, the cold night air hitting your face. Below, the alley is dark, but you can hear scuttling sounds."}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":4527,"output":1168,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":5695,"cost":{"input":0.00040742999999999997,"output":0.00021024,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00061767}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783112634928,"responseId":"gen-1783112635-9nRZ8n6QFNd0ogJl4E7I","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
