{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me continue implementing the remaining open stubs. Let me list what's still open and implement them.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e963b6eed8b54f918e4e1972","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"armed_escape_with_marcus","location":"Fire Escape","passiveLocationEffects":["dark","wind"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"Armed with a lamp and a fire extinguisher, you and **Marcus** slip out onto the fire escape. The metal groans but holds. Below, the alley is dark and silent.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Marcus","content":"They came from the subway, right? So we stay above ground. That's our strategy.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You have the high ground for now. The fire escape offers two paths—up or down.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"'Up. We can see more from above.' You climb toward the roof, weapon in hand. Knowledge is power, and from the roof you can chart a safe course.","label":"Climb to the roof for a better view","targetScene":"roof_view_armed","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You reach the roof and survey the city. The creatures seem drawn to sound and light. You spot a path through the darker, quieter streets."},{"description":"'Down. We need to get out of this building.' You descend into the alley, ready to fight anything that comes near.","label":"Descend to the alley and fight if necessary","targetScene":"alley_fight","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You drop into the alley, weapons ready. A creature rounds the corner and you have seconds to react."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2ef20f78abc54fb9a090a45f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"phone_info","location":"Building Hallway","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You pull out your phone, the screen painfully bright in the darkness. Social media is a cascade of panic. Videos of the creatures—people calling them 'Skinners' for the way they wear human skin—spread across every platform.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"One post catches your eye: a live stream from a woman barricaded in a convenience store. She says the military is setting up checkpoints on the highway. Another post mentions the old subway tunnels as the origin point—something was released from a research facility beneath the city.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Marcus","content":"A research facility? Under the city? This wasn't an accident. Someone *made* these things.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"sad"}]}],"choices":[{"description":"The highway. That's the way out. You show Marcus the post about military checkpoints and decide to head for the on-ramp.","label":"Head for the highway military checkpoint","targetScene":"highway_checkpoint","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You navigate through side streets toward the highway. In the distance, you can see searchlights and hear gunfire. The military is holding the line."},{"description":"If the creatures came from a research facility, there might be answers there—and maybe a way to stop them. You decide to find the facility.","label":"Investigate the research facility origin","targetScene":"research_facility","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You find an old subway map on your phone and locate the research facility entrance. It's in the abandoned Central Station—three blocks away."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b941810977894717bd19cae0","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"stairwell_to_roof","location":"Building Hallway","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You push open the stairwell door, Marcus close behind. The concrete stairs spiral upward into darkness. The air is cold and still. Your footsteps echo in the confined space.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"As you climb, you pass the fourth-floor landing. A sign reads 'ROOF ACCESS—AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY.' The door at the top is steel, heavy, and it's slightly ajar.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Marcus","content":"Wait. Do you hear that? Something's on the roof.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}]}],"choices":[{"description":"You creep up the last few steps and peer through the gap in the door. On the roof, you see a helicopter rotor spinning slowly and a figure in military gear waving a flashlight.","label":"Approach the roof door cautiously","targetScene":"military_roof","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You push the door open and step onto the roof. A military helicopter is on the landing pad, and a soldier motions for you to hurry."},{"description":"It could be a trap. You decide not to take the risk and instead head back down to find another escape route.","label":"Back away and find another exit","targetScene":"retreat_from_roof","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You quietly descend back down the stairs, looking for another way out. The ground floor has a fire exit that leads to a side alley."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bb0cce0cf69e4f549dc54506","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"signal_survivor","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You grab your flashlight and flick it on, pointing it toward the building across the street. You flash three times—the universal signal for 'I'm here.'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The figure across the way stops moving. Then they flash back. Three times. Then they point—emphatically, repeatedly—toward the hospital on Fifth Street. You can see its silhouette against the burning sky, its rooftop lit by emergency lights.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The figure disappears from view, but the message is clear: the hospital is a rendezvous point. A safe zone.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The hospital is only a few blocks away. If there are survivors gathering there, that's your best chance. You grab your bag and head out.","label":"Head to the hospital rendezvous point","targetScene":"to_hospital","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You exit your apartment and make your way toward the hospital, navigating through the chaotic streets. The emergency lights guide you like a beacon."},{"description":"The signal could be a trap. You decide to stay put and observe for a while longer before committing to a risky journey.","label":"Stay and observe before making a move","targetScene":"observe_and_wait","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You watch from your window for several minutes, tracking movement patterns. You notice the creatures avoid certain areas—places with bright lights or loud noises."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2f777889e4b947a8898f02ad","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"sealed_apartment","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You finish boarding up the last window. The apartment is dark, sealed tight, and utterly silent except for your own breathing. You've created a tomb.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Hours pass—or maybe minutes. Time loses meaning in the dark. The sounds outside fade and swell like a terrible tide. You huddle in the corner, your emergency bag clutched to your chest.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Then you hear it: footsteps in the hallway. Slow. Deliberate. They stop outside your door. A voice—human, strained—whispers through the wood: 'Please... let me in... they're coming...'","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"It sounds human. Terrified. You can't just leave them to die. You start moving the barricade.","label":"Open the door for the stranger","targetScene":"open_for_stranger","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You pull aside the barricade and open the door. A woman stumbles in, bleeding from a wound on her arm. She gasps out a warning before collapsing."},{"description":"It could be one of *them*, mimicking a human voice. You've read about creatures that do that. You stay silent, pressing yourself against the wall, hoping they go away.","label":"Stay silent and don't open the door","targetScene":"silent_refusal","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You remain perfectly still, not making a sound. The pleading continues for a minute, then turns into a guttural hiss. Whatever it was, it moves on."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a02f4f9b07bd4a929f2ffc80","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"bedroom_intrusion","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The crash from the bedroom sends adrenaline surging through your veins. You grip the hammer tight and move toward the sound, your footsteps silent on the worn carpet.","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The bedroom door is half open. Through the gap, you can see the curtains billowing in the night breeze from a shattered window. Glass crunches under your foot as you push the door open.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The room is empty. But on the floor, near the broken window, something glints in the faint light—a metal canister, about the size of a soda can, with a blinking red light on its side. It wasn't there before.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You pick up the canister carefully. It's warm, and the blinking light suggests it's active. This might be important—maybe a signal device or something dropped by the creatures.","label":"Examine the mysterious canister","targetScene":"mysterious_canister","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You pick up the canister and examine it. It has a small display that reads 'SAMPLE 7—ACTIVE' and a symbol you don't recognize. This could be connected to the outbreak."},{"description":"You don't know what that thing is, but the broken window means you're exposed. You grab your bag and climb out through the window onto the fire escape, leaving the canister behind.","label":"Flee through the broken window to the fire escape","targetScene":"flee_through_bedroom","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You climb out the broken bedroom window onto the fire escape, leaving the mysterious device behind. The alley below is dark, but you can see a path to safety."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8c8f0fbc1b034881bd3f199a","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"wall_communication","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You tap back on the wall. Three knocks. A pause. Then a response—three knocks, weaker but clear. Your neighbor is alive.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You develop a crude code: one knock for yes, two for no. You learn that your neighbor is Diana, a nurse from 3A. She's injured—a deep cut on her leg from broken glass. She's barricaded herself in her bathroom. The creatures haven't found her yet.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"She knocks a message: 'Stairwell clear. Fire escape clear. Roof dangerous.' Important information.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Diana is injured and needs help. You decide to go to her. You unbarricade your door and slip into the hallway, hoping the stairwell is truly clear.","label":"Go help Diana in apartment 3A","targetScene":"help_diana","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You enter the hallway and find Diana's door unlocked. She's in the bathroom, pale from blood loss. You manage to stop the bleeding and help her to her feet."},{"description":"Diana gave you valuable intel. You decide to use it and take the fire escape alone, heading down to find a way out of the city.","label":"Use the intel and take the fire escape down","targetScene":"use_intel_fire_escape","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Armed with Diana's information, you take the fire escape down to the alley. The path ahead is dangerous, but at least you know what to expect."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_738443bf08824aa08696dc37","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"total_fortification","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You work with frantic precision. Nails hammered into window frames. Furniture stacked against the door. The apartment transforms into a bunker.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"As you work, you find a forgotten corner of your kitchen pantry—a stash of canned goods, a bottle of whiskey, and a battery-powered radio. You turn it on, static hissing before a weak signal comes through.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"'...repeat, this is an emergency broadcast. The outbreak is contained to the downtown area. Military checkpoints are established at all major highways. Citizens are advised to shelter in place or proceed to the nearest evacuation center. Do not—' The signal cuts to static.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The broadcast said to shelter in place. You have supplies, a radio, and a fortified position. You settle in for a long wait.","label":"Shelter in place and wait for rescue","targetScene":"shelter_in_place","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You settle into your fortified apartment, rationing supplies and monitoring the radio. Days pass in darkness. Then you hear heavy boots in the hallway."},{"description":"The broadcast mentioned evacuation centers. You can't just sit here—you need to reach one. You grab your supplies and prepare to make a run for it.","label":"Make a run for the nearest evacuation center","targetScene":"run_for_evacuation","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You gather your supplies and unbarricade the door. The hallway is clear. You make your way toward the evacuation center, following the distant sound of helicopter rotors."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e163386878564e0fad6247d3","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"utility_closet","location":"Apartment 3C","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You open the utility closet door. The smell of dust and old cardboard greets you. Shelves line the walls, cluttered with tools, old paint cans, and forgotten items.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You grab a crowbar—solid iron, perfect for both prying and swinging. A heavy-duty flashlight. Duct tape. A box of nails. Your arms fill with useful tools.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"As you reach for a hammer on the top shelf, your foot kicks something hollow on the floor. You clear away a dusty rug and find it: a square outline in the floorboards. A trapdoor. You never knew this was here.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"A secret trapdoor in your apartment? This could be an escape route—or a way into the building's basement. You pry it open with the crowbar.","label":"Open the trapdoor and investigate","targetScene":"trapdoor_secret","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You wedge the crowbar into the seam and pry open the trapdoor. A ladder descends into darkness. The air that rises is cold and smells of earth and concrete."},{"description":"You're not ready to crawl into an unknown hole. You gather your tools and prepare to head out the front door, better armed than before.","label":"Take the tools and head out the front door","targetScene":"armed_exit_front","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Crowbar in hand, flashlight in the other, you unbarricade the door and step into the hallway. You're ready for whatever comes."}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":950,"output":5076,"cacheRead":26752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32778,"cost":{"input":0.0000855,"output":0.0009136799999999999,"cacheRead":0.00053504,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0015342199999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783112826067,"responseId":"gen-1783112826-QhmI0MUZ2oJjNbiqdHDp","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
