{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me implement more of the remaining stubs. I'll do another batch.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6bb87cba986d4b7f9b2de1c8","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You shout instructions to Diana through the wall—barricade the door, stay quiet, save your phone battery. She taps back: 'Understood.' You promise to return with help.","label":"Promise to find help and return","targetScene":"find_help","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You and Marcus leave the building, determined to find help and return for Diana. The streets are dangerous, but you have a mission."}],"id":"promise_to_return","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Apartment 3C","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You press your mouth close to the wall and speak loudly but clearly. 'Diana! Barricade your door! Stay quiet! We're going for help!'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Three weak knocks come back. She understood.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Marcus","content":"We can't just leave her. But... we can't help her if we're dead. Let's find help and come back.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"sad"}]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6152ecef227e45a2b47e0883","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You climb into the car. Marcus turns the key. The engine roars to life—and every creature within a block turns toward the sound.","label":"Floor it and escape","targetScene":"car_chase","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You peel out as creatures swarm toward the car. Marcus weaves through abandoned vehicles, heading for the highway."},{"description":"The car is too risky. You decide to stay on foot—quieter, more maneuverable.","label":"Abandon the car and continue on foot","targetScene":"on_foot_again","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You leave the car behind and continue on foot, weaving through back alleys. It's slower, but safer."}],"id":"abandoned_car","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"City Streets","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You approach the abandoned car carefully. It's a sedan, driver's door hanging open. The keys dangle from the ignition, swaying slightly.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Marcus","content":"A car! We can drive out of here!","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"But a car engine is loud. It will attract attention. Is the risk worth it?","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9771227fc32a4b5a9e7a3e2f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You and Marcus approach the police station from the rear. A back door is unlocked. Inside, you find an armory—lockers full of rifles and shotguns.","label":"Enter the police station armory","targetScene":"police_armory","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You arm yourselves with proper weapons from the police station. The firepower gives you confidence. You can fight back now."},{"description":"The front of the station is overrun. You can see officers trapped on the roof, firing down at the creatures swarming the entrance.","label":"Help the officers on the roof","targetScene":"officers_on_roof","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You find a way onto the police station roof and help the trapped officers fight off the creatures. Together, you hold the line."}],"id":"police_station","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"City Streets","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You and **Marcus** crawl through the fence and cross the overgrown lot. The police station looms ahead—a two-story brick building with bars on the windows.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The front entrance is crawling with creatures, their pale forms writhing in the light of a burning patrol car. But the back alley looks clear.","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c0d25562cbb5444b90c41a5e","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You land on the rooftop and approach the survivors cautiously. There are four of them—a family with two kids. They have a radio and news of a safe zone.","label":"Join the survivor group","targetScene":"survivor_group","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You join the family of survivors. They've been in contact with the military. The evacuation point is the stadium, three miles north."},{"description":"The group looks trustworthy, but you decide to keep your distance. You exchange information and then continue alone.","label":"Exchange information and go solo","targetScene":"solo_info_exchange","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You share information with the other survivors and then continue on your own path. They warn you about a nest of creatures in the subway station ahead."}],"id":"rooftop_survivors","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You take a running start and leap across the gap. Your feet hit the gravel of the adjacent rooftop and you roll, coming up in a crouch. **Marcus** follows, his landing less graceful but successful.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"run"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"The survivors turn toward you. A man steps forward, hands raised. 'You made it! Thank God—we thought we were the only ones left in this part of the city.'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_54a0608afd6d496f99c35510","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You find a service ladder bolted to the side of the building. It descends to a delivery alley on the north side. A path opens up.","label":"Take the service ladder down","targetScene":"service_ladder","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You descend the service ladder into a quiet delivery alley. From here, you can see the highway in the distance."},{"description":"The roof access door is unlocked. You find a set of stairs leading back down into the building's upper floor.","label":"Enter the roof access door","targetScene":"roof_door_entry","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You enter the building through the roof access. You're on the top floor of what looks like an office building. Cubicles stretch into the darkness."}],"id":"find_safer_route","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You wave to the survivors across the gap, signaling that you'll find another way. They wave back and disappear from view.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You search the rooftop and find a service ladder bolted to the side of the building, leading down to an alley. There's also a roof access door that might lead inside.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b055d0c157ee436cbcee1f09","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"From the roof, you spot a clear path through the back streets. You and Marcus descend and move quickly, avoiding the main roads.","label":"Follow the clear path","targetScene":"clear_path","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You navigate the side streets, keeping to the shadows. The path leads to a residential area that seems untouched by the chaos."},{"description":"A nearby fire station has its doors open. There might be emergency vehicles or communication equipment inside.","label":"Check the fire station for supplies","targetScene":"fire_station","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You enter the fire station. The engines are still here, but the crews are gone. You find axes, flashlights, and a working radio."}],"id":"roof_view_armed","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You and **Marcus** climb to the roof, weapons in hand. The view is sobering—the city burns in patches, and the creatures move through the streets like a dark tide.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"But you notice patterns. The creatures avoid bright lights and loud noises. They cluster around the subway entrances. The residential streets to the north look clear.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ffe0ff52ed0e46b1bcbf6d95","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The creature rounds the corner and sees you. It lets out a shriek and lunges. You swing the lamp like a club, connecting with its head. It crumples.","label":"Fight the creature","targetScene":"alley_combat","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You fight the creature in the alley, your improvised weapons finding their marks. More will come at the sound of combat. You need to move fast."},{"description":"You fire the extinguisher, filling the alley with a cloud of white foam. The creature shrieks and recoils, giving you time to run.","label":"Use the fire extinguisher as a distraction and flee","targetScene":"foam_and_flee","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The foam cloud gives you cover. You and Marcus sprint down the alley as the creature thrashes blindly behind you."}],"id":"alley_fight","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"City Streets","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You drop into the alley, weapons ready. The ground is slick with rain. A scraping sound comes from around the corner, growing louder.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A creature rounds the dumpster—tall, pale, limbs bending at impossible angles. Its human face stretches into a grotesque smile as it sees you.","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":551,"output":3363,"cacheRead":41216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45130,"cost":{"input":0.00004959,"output":0.00060534,"cacheRead":0.00082432,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00147925}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783112935949,"responseId":"gen-1783112936-PdzOUVrqiJwwAi5vh0fZ","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
