{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There are many open stubs still. Let me implement more in batches. I'll create some key scenes that conclude story arcs or lead to significant outcomes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me implement a large batch of scenes. I'll focus on key story conclusions and continuing branches.\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8d3fd2459db54c07a20975ed","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You approach the military checkpoint with your hands raised. Soldiers in full combat gear aim rifles at you before lowering them. 'You're safe now. Get in the truck.'","label":"Surrender to the military checkpoint","targetScene":"military_safe_zone","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You're taken to a refugee camp outside the city. You've survived the first night. But the nightmare is far from over."},{"description":"The military is shooting everything that moves. You can't be sure they won't shoot you too. You bypass the checkpoint and continue north on foot.","label":"Bypass the checkpoint and go north","targetScene":"north_on_foot","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You skirt around the military checkpoint, heading north through residential areas. The creatures seem fewer here, but the silence is unsettling."}],"id":"highway_checkpoint","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"City Streets","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You follow the sounds of gunfire and shouting toward the highway. The on-ramp is a bottleneck of abandoned cars and military vehicles. Soldiers in hazmat suits wave flashlights, scanning the crowd of civilians for signs of infection.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A sergeant spots you. 'You! Are you bitten? Have you been scratched by any of them?'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b0cdd0bef1934f39a6f84ee3","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You find the entrance to Central Station—an abandoned subway hub. The tunnels below are dark and cold. You descend, hoping to find answers.","label":"Descend into the research facility","targetScene":"central_station_lab","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You navigate the dark subway tunnels, following signs to the old research wing. The air grows colder. You find a locked door marked 'PROJECT HOLLOW EARTH.'"},{"description":"The facility entrance is swarming with creatures. You can't get in. You retreat and look for another way to survive.","label":"Retreat and find another way","targetScene":"retreat_from_facility","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You back away from the subway entrance. The answers will have to wait. Survival comes first."}],"id":"research_facility","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"City Streets","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You make your way toward Central Station, where the research facility entrance is supposedly located. The streets grow quieter as you approach—fewer creatures, fewer fires. It's as if even they avoid this place.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The station looms ahead, its grand facade cracked and darkened. A symbol on the door catches your eye—a biohazard warning, freshly painted.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_979867d71f3b411ba01c1e82","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You step onto the roof, hands raised. The soldier lowers his weapon. 'Get in. We're the last evacuation flight.' You climb aboard the helicopter.","label":"Board the military helicopter","targetScene":"helicopter_evacuation","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The helicopter lifts off, carrying you away from the burning city. You've made it out. But looking down, you wonder how many didn't."},{"description":"Something feels wrong. The soldier's eyes are too wide, too glassy. You notice a wound on his neck. You back away slowly.","label":"Refuse and retreat","targetScene":"suspicious_soldier","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You back away from the helicopter. The soldier's expression twists—and you see the truth. He's infected. You flee back into the building."}],"id":"military_roof","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You push the roof door open and step out into the open air. A Black Hawk helicopter sits on the landing pad, its rotor spinning slowly. A soldier in full gear stands beside it, waving frantically.","instantLocationEffects":["wind"],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Soldier","content":"Move! Move! This is the last evac! We're pulling out!","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8e388218d816459186dbccfd","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You descend the stairs, looking for another exit. The ground floor fire door leads to a side alley. You push through and emerge into the night.","label":"Exit through the ground floor fire door","targetScene":"fire_door_exit","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You emerge from the building into a quiet side street. The sounds of chaos echo from the main roads, but here, it's almost peaceful."}],"id":"retreat_from_roof","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Building Hallway","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marcus","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You decide the roof is too risky. You turn and descend the stairs, looking for another way out.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The stairwell spirals down past each floor. Through the door on the second floor, you hear movement—not creatures, but human footsteps.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9513a2e93af0420c9fe19dcd","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You reach the hospital's emergency entrance. The doors are barricaded with gurneys, but a nurse spots you and opens a side door. 'Quick, inside!'","label":"Enter the hospital","targetScene":"hospital_safe_room","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You're ushered into the hospital. The lobby has been converted into a triage center. Doctors and nurses move between patients. You've found sanctuary."},{"description":"The hospital is overflowing. You decide it's not safe—too many people, too many entrances for the creatures. You keep moving.","label":"Keep moving past the hospital","targetScene":"past_hospital","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You walk past the hospital, heading deeper into the residential districts. The further from downtown, the safer it seems."}],"id":"to_hospital","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"City Streets","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You navigate the rain-slicked streets toward the hospital. The emergency lights on the rooftop guide you like a lighthouse. The hospital is a fortress of light in a sea of darkness.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"As you approach, you see that the hospital is still operational—armed guards at the entrances, ambulances coming and going. It's a beacon of civilization.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b7aea55a60614e49a82bdc50","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You watch from your window for an hour, tracking the creatures' movements. You notice a pattern—they move in packs of five to eight, patrolling in circuits. There's a ten-minute window between patrols on the east side.","label":"Plan your escape using the patrol patterns","targetScene":"escape_using_patterns","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You time the patrols and make your move during the gap. You slip out of the building and head east, staying ahead of the creature patrols."},{"description":"The creatures seem to be drawn to sound. You test this by throwing a bottle down the alley. They converge on the noise instantly.","label":"Experiment with sound as a distraction","targetScene":"sound_distraction_plan","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You've learned that sound draws them. You can use this knowledge to create diversions. You start planning a route that uses noise to clear your path."}],"id":"observe_and_wait","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Apartment 3C","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You stay at the window, watching. The city burns and the creatures hunt. But as you watch, patterns emerge in their seemingly random movement.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"They follow the lights. They avoid the dark alleys. They respond to sound with terrifying speed. Knowledge is power—and you're gathering intel.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aaa8ed9e9acb418cb8194ac9","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You unbarricade the door and open it a crack. A woman in a bloodied nurse's uniform stumbles in. 'Thank you—they're everywhere—the hospital fell—' She collapses from exhaustion.","label":"Let the nurse in and help her","targetScene":"nurse_survivor","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The nurse, Elena, tells you about the massacre at the hospital. She has a radio that picks up military frequencies. Together, you might find a way out."},{"description":"You can't trust anyone right now. You stay silent, not moving. The voice keeps pleading, then slowly turns to a guttural snarl. It wasn't human at all.","label":"Stay silent and let the creature leave","targetScene":"creature_minics","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The thing outside eventually gives up and moves on. You've learned something terrifying—the creatures can mimic human voices. You can trust no one."}],"id":"open_for_stranger","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Apartment 3C","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The voice outside the door continues pleading. 'Please... I'm hurt... they're coming...' It sounds so human. So desperate.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"internal_dialogue","character":"The Narrator","content":"But Marcus said the creatures wear human faces. Is this one of them? Or a real survivor?","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":46711,"output":3291,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50002,"cost":{"input":0.00420399,"output":0.00059238,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00479637}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783112968618,"responseId":"gen-1783112968-twRTzRuTeOGsErdpIDpg","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
