{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me implement the three scenes. I'll implement each with choices leading to new stubs. Let me design each one carefully.\\n\\n**1. hallway_confrontation**\\nAlex is at the door, injured. The stairwell door is bulging. Choices could be:\\n- Pull Alex inside and barricade the door\\n- Grab Alex and run for the rooftop\\n- Confront what's in the stairwell\\n- Leave Alex and run alone\\n\\n**2. alley_descent**\\nIn the alley, something near the basement window. Choices could be:\\n- Investigate the basement window\\n- Try to escape through the alley to the street\\n- Climb back up or find another way in\\n- Maybe meet Maya here\\n\\n**3. hiding_in_darkness**\\nIn the closet. Footsteps approaching. Choices could be:\\n- Stay silent and hidden\\n- Try to make a run for it\\n- Grab a weapon and attack\\n\\nLet me implement all three now, setting them up with choices that create new scene stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me implement all three branching scenes. I'll design each with compelling choices.\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8947698686a443b08564f21b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"hallway_confrontation","location":"The Hallway","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You throw open the door and grab Alex by the arm, pulling them inside. The scratch on their forearm is warm and wet under your fingers. Alex stumbles in, eyes wild, gasping for breath.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Alex Chen","content":"Oh god oh god thank you—they're in the stairwell—Mrs. Vasquez from 3D—she just—she *attacked* Mr. Chen—I saw her—her eyes were all white and she was—","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A heavy *THUD* against the stairwell door cuts Alex off. The metal groans. Something on the other side is testing its strength. Then another thud. And another. A chorus of wet, hungry sounds seeps through the crack beneath the door.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Player","content":"We can't stay here. That door won't hold long.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You slam your apartment door shut and throw the deadbolts back into place. Together, you and Alex drag the heavy bookshelf from your room in front of the door. The thudding against the stairwell door grows louder, more insistent—but the hallway door between you and them is solid. For now, you're safe. But for how long?","label":"Barricade yourselves in the apartment","targetScene":"barricaded_apartment","targetSceneDescription":"Inside the fortified apartment with Alex. The stairwell door is breaking. The infected are coming. Supplies are limited.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"There's a fire escape at the end of the hall, but more importantly—the rooftop access is through that door at the far end. Higher ground means more options. You grab Alex's hand and bolt down the hallway, past the groaning stairwell door, toward the rooftop ladder.","label":"Flee down the hall toward the rooftop access","targetScene":"rooftop_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Running down the hallway toward the rooftop ladder. The infected are breaking through behind you. Alex is injured and slowing down.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Your kitchen knife. The fire extinguisher. You scan the hallway for anything that could be a weapon. The stairwell door is going to break any second—but maybe you can get the drop on them. Ambush them as they come through.","label":"Arm yourself and prepare to fight whatever comes through","targetScene":"hallway_standoff","targetSceneDescription":"Standing your ground in the hallway, armed and ready. The stairwell door splinters. The infected pour through.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1d07baf2a85d436abc05a6e0","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"alley_descent","location":"The Alleyway","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You slip out the window onto the fire escape, the cold metal biting into your hands. The ladder descends with a rusty screech that sounds like a gunshot in the quiet. You freeze, listening. The howling from before has stopped. Nothing stirs—yet.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You climb down, your footsteps echoing on the metal grates. The alley below is a canyon of shadows. Trash bags are torn open, their contents strewn across the wet pavement. A dumpster lies on its side, leaking something dark. And there, at the far end—a basement window, shattered, its black mouth gaping open.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"As your feet touch the ground, you hear a soft click behind you. A voice—low, female, urgent—hisses from the shadows.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Maya Ortiz","content":"Don't. Move. There's one in the dumpster.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You freeze mid-step. The woman emerges from the shadow of a recessed doorway—Maya, as she'll later introduce herself. She gestures with her crowbar toward the overturned dumpster. A low, wet growl emanates from within. She whispers that she knows a safe route through the basement, but it means going into the dark.","label":"Trust the stranger and follow her lead through the basement","targetScene":"basement_passage","targetSceneDescription":"Following Maya into the dark basement through the shattered window. She knows the way. But trust is a luxury in times like these.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You shake your head at the stranger. You don't know her, and you don't trust easy. You spot the mouth of the main street at the end of the alley. If you can make it to the cars, maybe you can find one that still runs. You bolt for the street.","label":"Ignore the stranger and make a run for the main street","targetScene":"street_run","targetSceneDescription":"Running through the debris-choked alley toward the main street. The infected are everywhere. Cars are wrecked. The city has fallen.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You crouch low, peering into the darkness of the shattered basement window. If there's a safe route through the building, you'd rather take your chances alone than with a stranger. You slip through the window into the pitch-black basement below.","label":"Sneak into the basement alone through the broken window","targetScene":"basement_alone","targetSceneDescription":"The pitch-black basement of the apartment building. Unknown dangers lurk in the dark. You have only your phone's light.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_302ea7fd11b64c5a8b9f454c","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"hiding_in_darkness","location":"The Apartment","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You scramble into the closet, pulling the door shut until it's just a crack. You bury yourself under a pile of winter coats, your heart pounding so loud it feels like a drum in your ears. The darkness is absolute, suffocating.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Outside, Alex's screams cut off with a wet, sickening sound. Then—silence. You hold your breath. Seconds stretch into eternities.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Heavy footsteps approach your door. They stop. You hear a wet sniffing sound—something *smelling* through the gap under the door. A low, guttural growl. Then the doorknob rattles.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The door swings open. Through the crack in the closet, you see a shape—tall, silhouetted against the dim light from the window. It tilts its head, scanning the room. Its eyes catch the moonlight: white, pupil-less, hungry.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You press a hand over your mouth, squeezing your eyes shut. You become a statue. The creature paces the room—you hear it knocking things over, sniffing, searching. It stops directly in front of the closet. The door creaks as it pulls it open. Your coats shift. Its breath, hot and fetid, washes over you... and then, slowly, it moves away. The front door creaks shut. It's gone. For now.","label":"Stay utterly silent and still, hoping it passes","targetScene":"survived_the_closet","targetSceneDescription":"Alone in the ransacked apartment. The creature has left, but you don't know if it's really gone. The city is quiet—too quiet.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Your hand closes around something solid—a heavy Maglite you keep in the closet for emergencies. The creature is still searching the room, its back half-turned. This is your only chance. You burst from the closet, swinging with all your strength.","label":"Attack the creature with the Maglite","targetScene":"closet_attack","targetSceneDescription":"A desperate fight in the dark apartment. You swing the Maglite at the infected creature. One chance to survive.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You remember the fire escape. The window in your bedroom is still open. If you can slip past the creature, dive through the window, and pull the ladder down... it's insane, but staying here is death. You wait for it to move toward the kitchen, then you explode out of the closet, diving for the bedroom.","label":"Make a break for the open fire escape window","targetScene":"dash_to_fire_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Dashing through the apartment toward the open bedroom window. The creature is right behind you. The fire escape is your only exit.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":9585,"output":2790,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12375,"cost":{"input":0.00086265,"output":0.0005022,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00136485}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783114698361,"responseId":"gen-1783114698-Y9fYirqmYrTTMphSrTWn","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
