{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me now implement the remaining stubs: apartment_supplies, bathroom_escape, rooftop_sanctuary, city_overlook, hallway_fight, vasquez_apartment, maintenance_tunnels, sewer_entry, convenience_store, intersection_battle, police_cruiser, lobby_entry, boiler_room, crawlspace_tunnel, survivor_rooftop_climb, survivor_alley, through_the_wall, flee_into_hallway, hospital_keycard, alley_landing, desperate_rooftop_climb.\\n\\nThat's a lot. Let me keep going and implement several more.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me continue implementing more scenes\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a384a37f315a440faf0b2b81","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"apartment_supplies","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You start grabbing anything useful. Canned goods from the kitchen, a first-aid kit from under the sink, duct tape, rope, the kitchen knife. Alex finds your emergency backpack and starts filling it with bottles of water.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The front door groans under the assault. The deadbolts are holding, but the wood is starting to splinter. You have maybe two minutes.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Alex Chen","content":"I found your old camping gear in the closet—there's a hatchet! And... oh god, my arm. Look at my arm.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You look at Alex's wound. The scratch is angry and red, dark veins spiderwebbing out from it. Alex's skin feels hot to the touch. Whatever this infection is, it's spreading fast.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You grab the hatchet, shove the supplies into the backpack, and make for the bathroom window. The infected are seconds from breaking through. You help Alex through the narrow window first, then pass the bag, then squeeze through yourself. You land on the first-floor extension roof, the cold night air washing over you.","label":"Escape through the bathroom window with supplies","targetScene":"extension_roof","targetSceneDescription":"Standing on the first-floor extension roof with Alex and your supplies. Below is the alley. Above is the fire escape. The city stretches out before you.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You need to treat Alex's wound. You grab the first-aid kit and start cleaning the scratch with alcohol. Alex hisses in pain. You bandage it tightly, but the dark veins are already spreading. You need real medicine—antibiotics—or answers. Maybe the hospital has both.","label":"Treat Alex's wound and plan to find a hospital","targetScene":"wound_treatment","targetSceneDescription":"Working on Alex's wound in the besieged apartment. The infection is spreading. You need to get to a hospital—fast.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bd3a6b67cd694fc4b0a9caf2","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"bathroom_escape","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You shove Alex toward the bathroom. The bathroom window is small, but you've seen the roof below—a flat extension above the first-floor units. You kick the window open, cold air rushing in.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Alex Chen","content":"I can't—I won't fit—","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You help Alex through—they barely squeeze past the frame. You hear fabric tear, but they're through, landing on the roof with a grunt. You follow, the window scraping your back. You land on the tar-paper surface, the drop only six feet. Behind you, the apartment door finally gives way with a splintering crash, and you hear them pour inside.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"jump"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're on a narrow roof, maybe fifteen feet wide, extending to the edge of the building. Below is the alley. Above, the fire escape ladder dangles just out of reach.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You jump and grab the bottom rung of the fire escape ladder. It swings down with a metallic screech, and you climb. Alex follows. From this height, you can see into the second-floor windows—and movement inside one of them. Someone is signaling with a flashlight. Survivors.","label":"Climb the fire escape and signal back to the survivors","targetScene":"fire_escape_signal","targetSceneDescription":"On the fire escape, seeing a flashlight signal from a second-floor window. Other survivors are in the building. Do you go to them?","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The alley below is dark but quiet. You help Alex down from the roof edge—a careful drop to the garbage bags below. From the alley, you can move between buildings, stay in the shadows, and avoid the main streets.","label":"Drop down into the alley and move through the shadows","targetScene":"alley_route","targetSceneDescription":"In the dark alley, navigating through the debris. Staying off the main streets is your best chance. The infected are everywhere.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9ab56b12a1f74314bdecef85","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"rooftop_sanctuary","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You drag an old wooden pallet and some discarded furniture over the rooftop hatch. It's not much, but it'll slow them down. Alex slumps against the HVAC unit, breathing shallowly, clutching their arm.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You examine Alex's wound in the dim light. The scratch is bad—infected, swollen, with dark tendrils creeping toward their shoulder. Alex's eyes are glassy.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Alex Chen","content":"I don't feel so good. I'm cold. Why am I so cold?","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The hatch shudders as something slams against it from below. The barricade holds, but not forever. You look around the rooftop—the water tower, the maintenance shed, the edge of the building, and the distant glow of fires across the city.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You search the maintenance shed and find supplies: an old first-aid kit, a crowbar, some rope, and a half-empty bottle of whiskey. You use what you can to clean Alex's wound and give them something for the pain. But Alex is getting worse. You need real help.","label":"Treat Alex with makeshift supplies and radio for help","targetScene":"rooftop_medical","targetSceneDescription":"Using found supplies to treat Alex on the rooftop. You find an old ham radio in the shed. Maybe someone is listening.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"From the roof, you can see the neighboring building—a pharmacy. The roof is only six feet away. If you jump it, you can get down into the pharmacy through its roof access. They'll have real medicine there. You tell Alex to wait, that you'll be back.","label":"Jump to the neighboring building's pharmacy roof","targetScene":"pharmacy_roof_jump","targetSceneDescription":"Leaping across the gap to the neighboring building. A pharmacy roof access awaits. Medicine, supplies—and unknown dangers—lie inside.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fcb6d0ab2b0c4e388bcc0e1b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"city_overlook","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You stand at the edge of the rooftop, the wind whipping around you. The city spreads out below like a map of hell. Fires burn in a dozen places, painting the smoke-choked sky in shades of orange and crimson. Sirens wail in the distance, growing fainter by the hour.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":["wind"]},{"type":"narration","content":"The bridge is visible to the north—a massive suspension structure, its lights mostly dark. Cars are abandoned on its approach, some crashed, some burning. But you can see dark shapes moving across it—survivors? Infected? Both, probably.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Alex Chen","content":"We'll never make it that far on foot. We need a car. Or... I don't know... a miracle.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You scan the streets below. There's a parking garage two blocks east—maybe vehicles still inside. A fire station three blocks west—possible weapons and an emergency vehicle. And directly below, a hardware store with its front door smashed in.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The parking garage is the best bet for a working vehicle. You and Alex descend from the rooftop, navigating through the building's interior to reach the ground floor. From there, it's a dash through the streets to the garage entrance.","label":"Make for the parking garage to find a vehicle","targetScene":"parking_garage","targetSceneDescription":"A multi-level parking garage, dark and full of shadows. Cars sit abandoned, some with keys still in the ignition. But you're not the only things in here.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The fire station could have more than just vehicles—fire axes, turnout gear, maybe a working radio. It's a gamble, but the payoff could be huge. You point west and start planning your route.","label":"Head for the fire station for weapons and gear","targetScene":"fire_station","targetSceneDescription":"A fire station three blocks away. The bay doors are open, revealing a fire truck inside. But something has made this station its nest.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":531,"output":2983,"cacheRead":23936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27450,"cost":{"input":0.00004779,"output":0.00053694,"cacheRead":0.00047872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00106345}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783114854713,"responseId":"gen-1783114854-qozx2xLcIpQGglVHmmOL","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
