{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me now implement the remaining open stubs. Let me check what I still need to do.\\n\\nCurrent open stubs (newly created):\\n- extension_roof\\n- wound_treatment\\n- fire_escape_signal\\n- alley_route\\n- rooftop_medical\\n- pharmacy_roof_jump\\n- parking_garage\\n- fire_station\\n\\nPreviously created but not yet implemented:\\n- hallway_fight\\n- vasquez_apartment\\n- maintenance_tunnels\\n- sewer_entry\\n- convenience_store\\n- intersection_battle\\n- police_cruiser\\n- lobby_entry\\n- boiler_room\\n- crawlspace_tunnel\\n- survivor_rooftop_climb\\n- survivor_alley\\n- through_the_wall\\n- flee_into_hallway\\n- hospital_keycard\\n- alley_landing\\n- desperate_rooftop_climb\\n\\nThat's a lot of stubs. Let me implement them in batches.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me keep going and implement more of these scenes"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2229511c1d4a42d889371491","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"hallway_fight","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Hallway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","shake"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You swing the fire extinguisher in a wide arc. It connects with the first infected's skull—a wet, hollow crack. The creature crumples, but two more scramble over its body, hissing and snapping.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"jump"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're overwhelmed in seconds. A hand closes around your ankle. Teeth sink into your calf. You scream and swing again, feeling the extinguisher connect with something soft. You break free and stumble backward, bleeding.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The hallway is a writhing mass of pale bodies. You're losing ground. Your leg burns where you were bitten. The taste of copper fills your mouth. You need to get out—NOW.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You're bitten, bleeding, and outnumbered. There's only one chance—you shove through the infected, using the fire extinguisher as a battering ram, and throw yourself down the stairwell. You tumble down the concrete steps, landing hard on the second-floor landing. Your leg screams in protest, but you force yourself up and keep moving.","label":"Fight your way to the stairwell and escape downward","targetScene":"stairwell_descent","targetSceneDescription":"Tumbling down the stairwell, bitten and bleeding. The infected are right behind you. You need to find shelter before the infection takes hold.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"There's an apartment door right next to you—3C. You've never met the tenant, but the door is solid wood with a heavy deadbolt. You slam the door shut behind you, throwing the lock, and press your back against it as bodies crash into the other side. You're trapped, but alive.","label":"Dive into apartment 3C and barricade yourself in","targetScene":"apartment_3c","targetSceneDescription":"Inside a stranger's dark apartment. The door is under siege. You're injured. The apartment might have supplies—or other dangers.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a177eb51cff44c129ee2eb9f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"vasquez_apartment","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Hallway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You dive through the half-open door of 3D and slam it shut behind you. The apartment is dark, ransacked—drawers pulled out, cushions slashed, a chair overturned. Mrs. Vasquez's collection of ceramic angels lies shattered on the floor.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The infected slam into the door behind you. It holds, but not for long. You scan the room. The window is open, curtains billowing in the night breeze. Below, the fire escape platform. But there's something else—a faint light coming from the bedroom. A flashlight. Someone's here.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You move toward the light, stepping carefully over the debris. The bedroom door is slightly ajar. The light flickers. You hear a soft whimper.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You push the bedroom door open. Huddled in the corner is a young girl—maybe eight years old—holding a flashlight. She looks up at you with tear-streaked eyes. She's holding a photo of Mrs. Vasquez. 'They took my grandma,' she whispers. 'She turned into one of them.'","label":"Comfort the child and find a way out together","targetScene":"child_survivor","targetSceneDescription":"A young girl hiding in the bedroom. Her grandmother was Mrs. Vasquez. She's alone, scared, and needs protection. The infected are at the door.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Your heart breaks, but you can't take a child with you. You turn away from the bedroom, cross to the open window, and slip out onto the fire escape. You tell yourself it's for the best as you descend into the darkness below.","label":"Leave the child and escape via the fire escape alone","targetScene":"guilty_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Descending the fire escape alone, leaving the child behind. The guilt is heavy, but survival is paramount. The alley below offers uncertain freedom.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d03ad16b61c84b9391c563a3","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"maintenance_tunnels","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You follow Maya through the shattered window into the basement. She moves with practiced ease, her small flashlight cutting through the oppressive darkness. The basement is a maze of support pillars, old furniture, and forgotten belongings.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Maya Ortiz","content":"The tunnels run under this whole block. I've been using them to move between buildings. The infected don't seem to go down here—too dark, too many turns. But there are other things. Rats. And places where the ceiling's collapsed.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"She leads you to a heavy metal door. Beyond it, the maintenance tunnels stretch into darkness—narrow corridors lined with pipes and cables, the air thick with dust and the distant sound of dripping water. The city's heartbeat, underground.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Maya seems to know what she's doing. You follow her through the winding tunnels, trusting her instincts. She navigates by memory, taking lefts and rights with confidence. After ten minutes, you emerge through a grate into the parking garage of a neighboring building.","label":"Follow Maya through the tunnels to safety","targetScene":"tunnel_exit_garage","targetSceneDescription":"Emerging from the maintenance tunnels into a dark parking garage. Maya knows the city's underground like the back of her hand. She might be your best chance at survival.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You thank Maya but decide to go your own way. The tunnels branch off in multiple directions. You take a left where she takes a right, choosing a path that slopes downward. The air grows colder, damper. You hear the trickle of water ahead—maybe a sewer line, maybe a way out.","label":"Split from Maya and explore the lower tunnels alone","targetScene":"lower_tunnels","targetSceneDescription":"Exploring deeper tunnels alone. The air is damp and cold. Strange echoes bounce off the concrete walls. You're not sure if you're heading toward escape or deeper into the earth.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a7f3aaf002714065b4be9ee8","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"sewer_entry","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You pry the drainage grate open—it's heavy, rusted, but it moves. Below, a ladder descends into darkness. The smell hits you first: sewage, rot, and something chemical. You climb down, your feet splashing into cold, ankle-deep water.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The sewer tunnel stretches in both directions, a curved concrete pipe lit only by your phone's dying flashlight. Water trickles along the bottom. The walls are covered in graffiti and dark stains. Echoes carry strangely—you hear sounds from blocks away, distorted and ghostly.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You hear something ahead. A splashing sound. Rhythmic. Growing louder. Something is moving through the sewers—and it's heading your way.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Whatever is making that sound is coming from ahead. You turn and splash back the way you came, looking for an exit. There's a maintenance ladder about twenty feet back that leads up to another grate. You climb, pushing against the grate with all your strength.","label":"Turn back and escape through another grate","targetScene":"street_emergence","targetSceneDescription":"Climbing out of the sewer into a residential street. The neighborhood is quiet—too quiet. But you've escaped the tunnels.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You press yourself against the curved wall of the sewer pipe, kill your light, and stand perfectly still. The splashing grows louder. A shape passes by in the darkness—large, quadrupedal, sniffing at the water. It pauses right where you're standing, snuffling at the air. Then it moves on.","label":"Hide and let the creature pass","targetScene":"sewer_hide","targetSceneDescription":"Hiding in the dark sewer as something large passes by. The creature is gone, but you're lost in the tunnels. Which way is out?","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":5132,"output":2827,"cacheRead":24192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32151,"cost":{"input":0.00046188,"output":0.00050886,"cacheRead":0.00048384000000000003,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00145458}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783114899675,"responseId":"gen-1783114899-4u4Z0fbkOW9bEw7vMZvT","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
