{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue implementing more stubs. Let me do several at once.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8b99bf79355543f09031e6bf","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"convenience_store","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You duck through the shattered glass of the convenience store. The smell hits you—spilled soda, rotting food, and copper. Shelves are overturned, their contents strewn across the linoleum floor. A fluorescent light buzzes weakly overhead.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You grab what you can—bottled water, energy bars, a first-aid kit from behind the counter. You find a sturdy crowbar tucked under the register. Jackpot.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A noise from the back. The storage room door is ajar. Something shuffles inside. You freeze, crowbar raised. The door creaks open wider.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You creep toward the storage room, crowbar ready. Through the gap, you see a figure hunched over—an infected, feasting on something you'd rather not identify. It hasn't seen you yet. You can slip out the front, or you can take it out and secure the store.","label":"Sneak past and escape out the front","targetScene":"store_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Slipping out of the convenience store with your supplies. The street is dangerous, but you're better equipped now.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You need this place as a safe spot. You raise the crowbar and push the door open wider. The infected turns, hissing, mouth dripping. You swing before it can scream.","label":"Attack the infected in the storage room","targetScene":"store_fight","targetSceneDescription":"Fighting for control of the convenience store. If you can clear it out, this place could be a temporary sanctuary with supplies.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d73293f209694972abf17ba6","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"intersection_battle","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You sprint toward the survivors, grabbing a broken pole from a smashed traffic light as you run. Three survivors—two women and a man—are fighting back-to-back against a cluster of infected. One of the women goes down, a nurse in blood-soaked scrubs, as you arrive.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You swing the metal pole into the nearest infected's skull. It drops. The survivors turn, surprised, but they don't hesitate. The man—a burly guy in a leather vest—nods at you.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Maya Ortiz","content":"Wait—you? You're the one from the alley! Good timing. We were about to get overwhelmed.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Maya Ortiz","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The group fights off the remaining infected. The nurse on the ground isn't moving. The other survivor—a young man with a bat—helps you create a perimeter. For a moment, there's silence.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Maya and the other survivors are forming a group. They've been moving together, surviving together. The burly guy, Marcus, says they're heading for the bridge—there are reports of a safe zone on the other side. You can join them and increase your chances.","label":"Join the survivor group heading for the bridge","targetScene":"survivor_group","targetSceneDescription":"Joining Maya, Marcus, and the others. A group of survivors moving through the ruined city toward a rumored safe zone beyond the bridge.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Groups attract attention. More infected will come. You thank them for the assist but decide to go solo. You grab what supplies you can from the fallen nurse's bag and slip away down a side street.","label":"Go solo and slip away while the group regroups","targetScene":"solo_side_street","targetSceneDescription":"Alone again on a dark side street. The sounds of the city surround you. You have some supplies and your wits. It'll have to be enough.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c97de06b990c444286c4711b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"police_cruiser","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You sprint for the police cruiser, weaving between abandoned cars. The lights are still circling—blue and red, casting surreal shadows across the street. The driver's door is open. The officer who was inside is... gone.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You slide into the driver's seat. The keys are in the ignition. A shotgun is mounted in the front seat. The radio crackles with static.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You key the radio. Through bursts of static, you hear fragments: '...containment zone... St. Mary's Hospital... survivors gathering...' The signal cuts in and out, but you've got a direction. A destination.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The cruiser has a full tank. You crank the engine, throw it into drive, and floor it. The car roars to life, plowing through debris and infected alike. You follow the radio's directions toward St. Mary's Hospital, where survivors are reportedly gathering.","label":"Drive the cruiser toward St. Mary's Hospital","targetScene":"hospital_drive","targetSceneDescription":"Racing through the ruined streets in a police cruiser toward St. Mary's Hospital. The radio said survivors are there. But radio signals can lie.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The shotgun is what you need. You grab it, check it's loaded, and grab the extra shells from the glove compartment. But a car is too loud, too visible. You'll go on foot, using the cruiser as a temporary shelter while you plan your next move.","label":"Take the shotgun and supplies but go on foot","targetScene":"armed_foot","targetSceneDescription":"Armed with a police shotgun and heading into the city on foot. You're better equipped now, but the noise of the shotgun will draw every infected for blocks.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":3693,"output":1926,"cacheRead":28672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34291,"cost":{"input":0.00033237,"output":0.00034668,"cacheRead":0.00057344,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0012524900000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783114934896,"responseId":"gen-1783114934-BztR40GX62vsddfdR6Hq","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
