{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There are many open stubs. Let me implement several more, focusing on keeping the stories compelling and diverse. Let me implement a batch of these.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"There are many paths to explore! Let me implement several more\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1613126147ef4cf7b74ef4c5","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"lobby_entry","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Stairwell","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You climb the stairs from the basement, emerging into the building's ground-floor lobby. The space is cavernous and cold, with a cracked marble floor and a massive chandelier hanging askew. The front doors are open, swinging in the wind.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The lobby is a war zone. Overturned couches, shattered glass, dark splatters across the walls. A body lies near the reception desk—the night guard, his radio still crackling with static.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You creep toward the body. The guard's belt has a set of keys and a nightstick. The radio murmurs: '...repeat, all units... St. Mary's has fallen... survivors moving to...'—static—'...the docks. Repeat, the docks.'","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You grab the keys, the nightstick, and the radio. The docks are several miles away, but you could make it if you find a vehicle. You step through the broken front doors onto the street, the cold night air hitting you.","label":"Head out toward the docks based on the radio message","targetScene":"road_to_docks","targetSceneDescription":"Making your way through the devastated streets toward the city docks. A rumored evacuation point. But the path is long and dangerous.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The lobby has a maintenance closet. You check it and find a janitor's uniform, some cleaning supplies, and—more importantly—a master key ring for the entire building. You could go back up, check other apartments for supplies or survivors.","label":"Take the master keys and search other apartments","targetScene":"master_keys","targetSceneDescription":"Armed with a master key ring. You can access any apartment in the building. Each door is a mystery—supplies, survivors, or infected waiting inside.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9c071866f0334ac0ac5ed6fe","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"boiler_room","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You push open the heavy metal door marked 'BOILER ROOM.' A wave of heat hits you, along with the smell of oil and rust. The room is a tangle of pipes, valves, and industrial machinery. A single bare bulb casts weak yellow light.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The boiler is still running, its flame casting dancing shadows across the walls. You spot tools hanging on a pegboard—wrenches, a hacksaw, a hammer. A workbench holds more supplies. And in the corner... a hatch in the floor.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You lift the hatch. Stone steps descend into darkness. The maintenance tunnels. This is what Maya was talking about. From here, you could go anywhere.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The boiler room is defensible, has tools, and is warm. You could barricade the door and hole up here for a while. Maybe wait for daylight. Rest. Plan. The supplies on the workbench could sustain you for a day or two.","label":"Barricade the boiler room and rest until dawn","targetScene":"boiler_room_shelter","targetSceneDescription":"Taking shelter in the warm boiler room. You barricade the door and try to rest. The sounds of the city filter through the walls. Morning will bring new choices.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The maintenance tunnels are your way out. You grab a wrench as a weapon, a flashlight from the workbench, and descend the stone steps into the darkness below. The tunnels could take you anywhere in the block.","label":"Descend into the maintenance tunnels","targetScene":"boiler_tunnels","targetSceneDescription":"Descending into the maintenance tunnels beneath the building. Dark, narrow, and silent. The tunnels connect to multiple buildings. Freedom is somewhere ahead.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_47d058f2309449c19692be56","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"crawlspace_tunnel","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You get on your hands and knees and crawl into the narrow passage. The space is tight—your shoulders scrape the walls. Dust fills your lungs. Cobwebs brush against your face. You crawl forward, one hand over the other, into absolute darkness.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The tunnel forks. Left leads upward at a slope—you can feel fresh air coming from that direction. Right continues level, and you hear a distant dripping sound. Both paths are black as pitch.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Fresh air means an exit. You crawl up the sloping tunnel, emerging through a broken vent cover into a dark alley on the other side of the block. You've escaped the building. A new part of the city awaits.","label":"Follow the fresh air to the surface","targetScene":"new_alley","targetSceneDescription":"Emerging from a vent into an unfamiliar alley. You've crossed to a new block. The city is even worse here—more fires, more chaos.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The dripping sound could mean water—a valuable resource. You crawl down the level tunnel, emerging into a small underground chamber. A pipe has burst, creating a pool of cold, clean water. And stacked in the corner are boxes of emergency supplies—someone's hidden cache.","label":"Explore the sound of dripping water","targetScene":"hidden_cache","targetSceneDescription":"Discovering a hidden emergency cache in an underground chamber. Food, water, medical supplies—someone prepared for this. You've struck gold.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4ab550b9399d4c4898e8c26c","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"survivor_rooftop_climb","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You step out of your ransacked apartment into the dark hallway. The fluorescent light is dead now, leaving only the glow of your phone. The hallway is empty—for now. You creep toward the rooftop ladder at the far end.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The ladder groans as you climb, each footstep agonizingly loud. You push open the rooftop hatch and emerge into the cold night air. The city sprawls below you, a patchwork of fire and shadow.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're not alone on the rooftop. A figure stands near the edge, silhouetted against the burning skyline. They turn at the sound of the hatch opening—a woman, mid-thirties, holding a baseball bat. She looks as surprised to see you as you are to see her.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The woman introduces herself as Jenna, a school teacher who lived two buildings over. She climbed across the rooftops to escape the infected. She's been watching the city, trying to spot safe routes. She knows a path across the rooftops that leads to a fire station with working vehicles.","label":"Team up with Jenna and follow her rooftop route","targetScene":"rooftop_highway","targetSceneDescription":"Following Jenna across the rooftops of the city. A dangerous sky-high journey, but the infected can't climb. The fire station awaits.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You can't trust anyone. You thank Jenna but keep your distance. You settle into a corner of the rooftop, sheltered by the HVAC unit, and try to rest. Dawn will bring clarity. For now, you survive.","label":"Keep to yourself and rest on the rooftop until dawn","targetScene":"rooftop_vigil","targetSceneDescription":"A cold, lonely vigil on the rooftop. The city burns below. You try to rest, but every sound makes you jump. Dawn is hours away.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d40e64fa86a843c0b289b3ba","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"survivor_alley","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You climb down the fire escape, your footsteps echoing in the narrow alley. The ground is slick with rain and something darker. Trash bags are torn open, their contents scattered like the remains of ordinary life.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A cat darts out from behind a dumpster, making you jump. It stares at you with wide eyes before disappearing into the shadows. The alley leads to the main street, where the scale of the nightmare becomes clear: buildings burn, cars are wrecked, and shapes shuffle through the smoke.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You see the entrance to a subway station at the end of the street. The trains aren't running, but the tunnels below could be a safe passage—dark, uncharted, but away from the chaos on the surface.","label":"Head for the subway station entrance","targetScene":"subway_entry","targetSceneDescription":"Descending into the dark subway station. The turnstiles are broken. Tunnels stretch into darkness. The subway could be a path through the city—or a tomb.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"On the main street, you spot a group of infected gathered around a crashed delivery truck. Beyond them, an all-night pharmacy. The pharmacy would have medicine, supplies. If you can distract the infected, you can slip inside.","label":"Sneak around the infected toward the pharmacy","targetScene":"pharmacy_sneak","targetSceneDescription":"Sneaking through the shadows toward an all-night pharmacy. Infected roam the street. One wrong move and they'll be on you.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b63601a53ef14053b0ce8895","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"through_the_wall","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You grab a hammer and start swinging at the drywall. The first swing punches through. The second tears a hole big enough to see through. Mrs. Vasquez's apartment is dark and still.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You widen the hole and climb through into her living room. The place is tidy—eerily so. A half-finished cup of tea sits on the coffee table. A photo album lies open, showing pictures of a young girl—Mrs. Vasquez's granddaughter.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The apartment has canned goods in the pantry, a fully stocked medicine cabinet, and a landline phone—dead, like all the lines. But on the kitchen counter, you find a note in shaky handwriting: 'They took Lily. I went after her. If you're reading this, please find my granddaughter. - Elena Vasquez'","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You stuff your backpack with the canned goods and medicine. The note about Lily weighs on you, but you have to prioritize your own survival. You leave through Mrs. Vasquez's front door into the hallway—it's quieter on this side of the building.","label":"Take the supplies and leave via the hallway","targetScene":"vasquez_hallway","targetSceneDescription":"Stepping into the hallway from Mrs. Vasquez's apartment. The far end of the hall is dark. You hear movement from the stairwell.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You can't ignore the plea. You find a photo of Lily—a smiling girl with pigtails—and pocket it. If you're going to survive this, you need a purpose. Finding Lily gives you one. You gather supplies and head out, determined to find her.","label":"Search for Lily, Mrs. Vasquez's granddaughter","targetScene":"search_for_lily","targetSceneDescription":"Searching for a lost child in a fallen city. The note said 'they took her.' The infected took her. Or something worse. Either way, you have a mission now.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":18610,"output":3651,"cacheRead":16384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38645,"cost":{"input":0.0016749,"output":0.0006571799999999999,"cacheRead":0.00032768,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0026597599999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783114971914,"responseId":"gen-1783114972-uWB29ZAVui9nzTbjbpJJ","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
