{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me keep implementing more scenes. I still have many open stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9d2581e61a0449b79ec0bf70","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"flee_into_hallway","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Hallway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You burst out of your apartment, bag in hand, and sprint down the hallway. The lights are dead. Your phone's flashlight cuts a narrow path through the darkness.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The stairwell door is at the end of the hall. You can hear them below—the wet clicking sound of infected. They're climbing the stairs. Coming up.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You have two choices: go through the stairwell and fight your way down, or try the fire escape at the other end of the hall. Either way, you're running out of time.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You push through the stairwell door and start descending. The infected are below you—you can hear them, see their pale shapes moving in the dim light. You climb over the railing and jump down a full flight, landing hard, rolling, and keep running.","label":"Descend the stairwell, jumping past the infected","targetScene":"stairwell_jump","targetSceneDescription":"Leaping down the stairwell, bypassing the infected. You land hard but keep moving. The ground floor lobby is just ahead.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You turn and run back the other way, toward the fire escape window. You can hear the infected pouring into the hallway behind you. You slide the window open, climb out onto the metal platform, and start descending.","label":"Double back and escape via the fire escape","targetScene":"flee_fire_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Climbing down the fire escape as infected pour into the hallway behind you. The metal groans. Below, the alley waits in darkness.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8d0dfb80a03a4d0ea91cd9b7","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"hospital_keycard","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You kneel beside the fallen creature. The hospital gown is stained, torn, but the nametag is clear: 'KOWALSKI, M.—St. Mary's Hospital—Staff.' A key card on a lanyard is clipped to the collar. You take it.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"St. Mary's Hospital. Three blocks away. If this infection started there, the answers might be there too. Patient zero. Origin. Treatment. Cure. Or maybe just more infected, more death.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You stand, key card clutched in your hand. The apartment is a wreck, but you have a destination now. A purpose. The hospital calls.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You grab your things and head out immediately, following the streets toward St. Mary's Hospital. The key card opens doors—literally. You move through the chaos, determined to find answers.","label":"Head directly to St. Mary's Hospital now","targetScene":"direct_hospital","targetSceneDescription":"Making your way through the devastated streets toward St. Mary's Hospital. The key card in your pocket might be the key to answers. Or to a tomb.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You're not ready for the hospital yet. You need more supplies, more information. You check your apartment for anything useful before you go—maps, a better weapon, food. Preparation could mean the difference between answers and becoming one of them.","label":"Prepare more before heading to the hospital","targetScene":"prepare_for_hospital","targetSceneDescription":"Scavenging your apartment for supplies before the hospital run. Maps, weapons, food. Every item could save your life.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f227fb81e08b45f88fc8d998","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"alley_landing","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You hit the ground hard, the impact jarring through your legs. You roll, the gravel scraping your palms. Above, the creature is scrambling down the fire escape after you, moving with terrifying speed.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"fall"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]},{"type":"narration","content":"You scramble to your feet and run. The alley stretches ahead, leading to the main street. You can see lights—flickering headlights, maybe a car. You run toward them, lungs burning.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You burst out of the alley onto the main street. A van is idling at the curb, its back doors open. A figure waves at you frantically.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The figure is a中年 man, panicked, waving you into the van. 'Get in! Get in!' he shouts. Behind you, the creature emerges from the alley. You don't hesitate—you dive into the van, and the man floors it, tires screeching.","label":"Jump into the stranger's van and escape","targetScene":"van_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Racing away from the alley in a stranger's van. The man says his name is Gary, and he's gathering survivors. He knows of a safe house.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You don't trust the stranger. You veer away from the van, ducking between two parked cars. The creature is right behind you, but you weave through the obstacle course of wrecked vehicles, using them as cover.","label":"Dodge between cars and lose both the creature and the van","targetScene":"car_dodge","targetSceneDescription":"Weaving through a maze of wrecked cars. The creature is persistent. You need to find cover and lose it.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_43b7bfcfc142468c94cd76b2","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"desperate_rooftop_climb","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You grab the edge of the fire escape cage and haul yourself up, muscles screaming. The creature is right behind you, its claws scraping metal. You climb onto the narrow roof ledge, fingers finding purchase on the brickwork.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"jump"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You pull yourself onto the rooftop just as the creature lunges. It catches your ankle, but you kick free, scrambling across the gravel. The rooftop stretches before you—open, exposed, and vast.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]},{"type":"narration","content":"The creature hauls itself onto the roof behind you, hissing. You're trapped on a rooftop with a monster. There's no obvious exit. But you see a maintenance shed, the edge of the building, and a gap between your building and the next.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The gap between buildings is about eight feet. A running jump could clear it. You sprint across the rooftop and leap, arms windmilling, your feet hitting the edge of the neighboring building. You stumble, catch yourself, and turn. The creature hesitates at the edge—it can't make the jump. You're safe. For now.","label":"Make a running jump to the next building","targetScene":"building_jump","targetSceneDescription":"Landing on the neighboring rooftop after a desperate leap. The creature is stranded. But you're in unknown territory now.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You don't run—you fight. You grab a loose piece of gravel and hurl it at the creature's face, then charge, tackling it. You grapple at the edge of the roof, struggling desperately, trying to throw it off the side.","label":"Stand your ground and try to throw the creature off the roof","targetScene":"rooftop_struggle","targetSceneDescription":"A life-or-death struggle at the edge of the roof. You and the creature wrestle for control, the four-story drop waiting below.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":38942,"output":2470,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41412,"cost":{"input":0.00350478,"output":0.0004446,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00394938}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783115010178,"responseId":"gen-1783115010-VMs20RzckFxAxvHPVz4O","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
