{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue implementing more scenes. I still have many open stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_249657b0b5414db988e4c767","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"extension_roof","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You land on the first-floor extension roof, the tar paper crunching under your feet. Alex lands beside you, clutching the backpack of supplies. The roof is narrow, maybe eight feet wide, stretching from the building to the edge of the property.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Above you, the fire escape platform hangs within reach. Below, the alley is dark and quiet. Across the street, you see movement in a second-floor window—a flashlight blinking. Someone is signaling. A pattern: three short flashes, three long, three short. SOS.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You grab the fire escape ladder and pull it down. It clatters as it descends. You and Alex climb up to the second-floor platform. The window is open. Inside, a family of three huddles in the dark—a mother, father, and teenage son. They've been watching the street, too scared to move.","label":"Climb up and respond to the SOS signal","targetScene":"sos_family","targetSceneDescription":"Meeting a family of survivors in a second-floor apartment. They've been hiding since the outbreak began. They have supplies and information.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The alley is your path. You help Alex down from the roof edge, dropping into the darkness below. You move through the shadows, sticking to the walls, avoiding the open street. The city is a maze of dangers, but the dark is your ally.","label":"Drop into the alley and move through the shadows","targetScene":"alley_shadows","targetSceneDescription":"Moving through the dark alley system. Staying in the shadows, avoiding open streets. The infected hunt by sound and movement.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7541a48ec8504984aca65f2a","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"wound_treatment","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You clean Alex's wound with alcohol, the sharp smell filling the small bathroom. Alex hisses through clenched teeth, tears streaming down their face. The dark veins are spreading, creeping up toward their shoulder.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Alex Chen","content":"I can feel it. Moving. Like something's crawling under my skin.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You bandage the wound tightly. It's all you can do. The door is still holding, but the infected are relentless. You need to get Alex to a hospital—real medicine, real help.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You check your phone. No signal. But you remember the map you saw in the stairwell. St. Mary's Hospital is three blocks east. It's not far, but getting there through the chaos will be a nightmare.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Alex needs a hospital. You grab the map, the supplies, and your weapon. You and Alex will have to fight your way through the building to the ground floor, then make a run for St. Mary's. It's three blocks of pure hell, but it's the only option.","label":"Fight through the building toward St. Mary's Hospital","targetScene":"hospital_run","targetSceneDescription":"Fighting through the infected building toward the street. St. Mary's Hospital is three blocks away. Alex is weakening. Every minute counts.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The hospital is too far. Alex is too weak. You look around the apartment and spot a first-aid manual on your shelf. You flip through it, looking for anything about infected wounds. There's a section on rabies—similar symptoms. Maybe... maybe if you clean it deep enough, cauterize it...","label":"Try a desperate home treatment to slow the infection","targetScene":"desperate_treatment","targetSceneDescription":"A desperate attempt to treat Alex's wound at home. Cauterization, deep cleaning—it's risky, but the alternative is watching Alex turn.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1c698141a3f04ff2ba06a5a2","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"fire_escape_signal","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You climb the fire escape, the cold metal rungs biting into your hands. At the second-floor window, you see a face peering out—a young woman with a flashlight. She waves you over.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The window slides open. The woman helps you and Alex inside. The apartment is dark, but you can see it's been fortified—furniture pushed against the doors, supplies stacked in corners. A man and an elderly woman sit on the floor, looking terrified.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Maya Ortiz","content":"I'm Maya. This is Marcus and Mrs. Chen. We've been holding out here since it started. We saw you on the fire escape. Glad you made it.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Maya's group has been surviving. They have supplies, weapons, and a plan. Marcus says they've been monitoring a police scanner—there's a evacuation point being set up at the docks. A boat is supposed to come at dawn. You can join them.","label":"Join the survivor group and plan for the docks","targetScene":"dock_evacuation_plan","targetSceneDescription":"Planning with Maya's group. The docks are the last hope. A boat at dawn. But getting there means crossing the most dangerous part of the city.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The group seems nice, but you've seen how groups attract attention. You thank them for the shelter but insist on leaving. You take some supplies they offer and slip back out the window, continuing down the fire escape to the ground.","label":"Take supplies and continue alone","targetScene":"alone_again","targetSceneDescription":"Leaving the safety of the group behind. You continue down the fire escape, alone again. The city is a graveyard, and you're the only mourner.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5012cc31194442ac91cb1350","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"alley_route","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You drop down into the alley, the impact softened by a pile of trash bags. You help Alex down, and together you press yourselves against the wall, listening. The night is full of sounds—distant screams, breaking glass, the ever-present scuffling.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The alley connects to a network of back passages behind the buildings. You move single file, staying in the shadows. Alex is breathing heavily, the wound obviously paining them.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You come to a junction. One path leads toward the main street, where you can see the glow of fires. The other leads deeper into the alley system, toward the industrial part of the neighborhood. A third path is a narrow gap between two buildings, barely wide enough to walk through.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The main street is dangerous, but it's also the fastest route to the hospital Alex needs. You take a deep breath and lead Alex toward the street, ready to face whatever comes.","label":"Head toward the main street","targetScene":"alley_to_street","targetSceneDescription":"Emerging from the alley onto the main street. The chaos is in full swing. But the hospital is visible in the distance.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The industrial area might have vehicles, tools, and fewer infected. You lead Alex deeper into the alley network, toward the old factory district. It's a longer route, but potentially safer.","label":"Head deeper into the industrial alley network","targetScene":"industrial_alley","targetSceneDescription":"Moving through the industrial back alleys. Abandoned factories and warehouses loom overhead. The silence here is heavier than the chaos of the main streets.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The narrow gap between buildings could be a shortcut. You squeeze through, Alex following. The walls press in on both sides, and you emerge in a small courtyard behind a row of shops. A delivery truck is parked here, its keys in the ignition.","label":"Take the narrow passage to the courtyard","targetScene":"courtyard_truck","targetSceneDescription":"Emerging into a hidden courtyard. A delivery truck sits with keys inside. This could be your ticket out of the city.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":41627,"output":2654,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44281,"cost":{"input":0.00374643,"output":0.00047772,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004224149999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783115031440,"responseId":"gen-1783115031-Bd9dWXG2BRuXComoFpXH","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
