{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"That's a lot of stubs. I've created a large, branching choose-your-own-adventure horror game. Let me implement a few more key scenes to flesh out important story threads, particularly ones that lead to major endings or conclusions.\\n\\nLet me implement several more that are critical to major storylines.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me implement several more key scenes to flesh out major story branches"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0e044edabebd4689b4f8b83f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"rooftop_medical","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You search the maintenance shed. Behind coils of old rope and dusty boxes, you find a rusted first-aid kit, a crowbar, and—most importantly—a ham radio. You set the radio on the roof and crank it to life.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You clean Alex's wound as best you can with the limited supplies, then pour a little whiskey on it. Alex hisses but nods—it helps. The dark veins haven't spread further, but they haven't receded either.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The radio crackles. You adjust the frequency, filtering through static. Then a voice cuts through: '...this is Sergeant Torres, National Guard... evacuation point established at...'—static—'...docks. Repeat, the docks. Survivors are being transported to a quarantine zone outside the city. If you can hear this, make your way to Pier 7. We leave at dawn.'","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The docks. That's your ticket out. You help Alex to their feet and head for the edge of the rooftop. The fire escape at the side of the building will take you down. From there, it's a straight shot to Pier 7—if you can make it through the streets.","label":"Make for the docks evacuation point","targetScene":"evacuation_run","targetSceneDescription":"Descending from the rooftop, heading for the docks. The National Guard is evacuating survivors. Dawn is still hours away. The streets are a war zone.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The radio is a lifeline. You hunker down on the rooftop, using the radio to gather more information. You learn that the infection is spreading, that safe zones are falling, and that the military is losing control. But you also learn about a research facility that was working on a cure before communications went dark.","label":"Stay and gather more intel from the radio","targetScene":"radio_intel","targetSceneDescription":"Gathering intelligence from the ham radio. You learn about a research facility, a possible cure, and the true scale of the outbreak.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0aef06ea9749437e9474b6ea","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"pharmacy_roof_jump","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Rooftop","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["wind"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You back up, take a running start, and leap across the gap. You hit the neighboring roof hard, rolling to absorb the impact. You made it.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"jump"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You look back. Alex is still on the other roof, looking pale and scared. The gap is too wide for them in their condition.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Alex Chen","content":"I can't... I can't make that jump...","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Alex Chen","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You're separated. Alex is on one roof, you're on another. Behind Alex, the hatch shudders—the infected are breaking through. You see a fire escape ladder on the side of your building, leading down. And on Alex's side, a window into the building that might offer another route.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You can't abandon Alex. You look around and find an old wooden plank in a pile of debris on the roof. You wedge it across the gap, creating a makeshift bridge. 'Come on, Alex! You can do this!' Alex takes a breath, steps onto the plank, and crosses, shaking but alive.","label":"Build a bridge across the gap for Alex","targetScene":"plank_bridge","targetSceneDescription":"Using a plank to bridge the gap. Alex crosses safely. Together, you descend into the pharmacy building through its roof access.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You shout instructions to Alex: go back through the building, find another way down, meet you at the pharmacy. Then you turn and descend the fire escape alone. It's a risk, but splitting up might be the only way to save you both.","label":"Split up and meet at the pharmacy","targetScene":"split_pharmacy","targetSceneDescription":"Splitting up from Alex to cover more ground. You'll meet at the pharmacy below. Trusting Alex to survive alone weighs heavily on you.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_72547843512c47738f106497","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"parking_garage","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You approach the parking garage cautiously. The entrance is a dark maw, the gate arm broken and hanging crooked. Inside, rows of cars sit in shadow, their windshields glinting dimly.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You move through the rows, checking vehicles. Most are locked. One has a shattered window. You find a sedan with the keys still in the ignition—a miracle. The engine turns over with a low rumble. You have a vehicle.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"But as the engine roars to life, you hear something respond. From the upper levels of the garage, a crash. Then another. Something is up there—and it's coming down.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]}],"choices":[{"description":"You throw the car into reverse, spin around, and gun it toward the exit. Something crashes onto the hood of the car—an infected, its white eyes staring through the windshield. You swerve, throwing it off, and burst out into the street. You're mobile. You're free.","label":"Floor it and escape the garage immediately","targetScene":"car_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Racing out of the parking garage in a stolen sedan. You have wheels now. The city is your obstacle course.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You kill the engine and slip out of the car. The noise will draw them, but a car is useless if the streets are blocked. You need to scout ahead first, see if there's a clear route. You creep toward the upper levels to see what's coming.","label":"Scout the upper levels for the threat","targetScene":"garage_scout","targetSceneDescription":"Creeping up the ramps of the parking garage. Something large is moving on the upper levels. You need to know what you're dealing with.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_142684f7d31845c0b138cafa","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"fire_station","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You approach the fire station. The bay doors are open, revealing a red fire engine inside, its lights still glowing faintly. The station looks empty—too empty. No sign of the firefighters.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You step inside. The station is a mess—overturned desks, a shattered coffee mug, a radio still playing static. Fire axes hang on the wall. Lockers stand open, their contents strewn across the floor.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Then you hear it. From the bunk room in the back: a wet, rhythmic sound. Chewing. Something is back there, feeding.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You grab a fire axe from the wall. The weight is reassuring. You creep toward the bunk room, ready to face whatever is in there. If you can clear the station, you'll have a fortress with a working vehicle.","label":"Clear the station with the fire axe","targetScene":"station_clearing","targetSceneDescription":"Advancing on the bunk room, axe in hand. The infected inside is feeding. You have the element of surprise.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The fire engine is what you need. You don't need to clear the whole station. You grab a spare set of turnout gear, an axe, and climb into the engine. The keys are in the ignition. You start it up, the diesel engine roaring, and back out of the bay.","label":"Grab gear and take the fire engine","targetScene":"fire_engine_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Driving a fire engine through the ruined streets. The truck is big, tough, and can push through barricades. But it's also loud and slow.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9ebab2fdf7da40e49f87e564","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"child_survivor","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Hallway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You kneel down to the girl's level. She's trembling, clutching a photo of her grandmother—Mrs. Vasquez.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Player","content":"It's okay. I'm not going to hurt you. What's your name?","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Child","content":"L-Lily. They took grandma. She... she changed. She tried to... I ran and hid.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Child","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Lily. The same girl from the note in Mrs. Vasquez's apartment. She's about eight, with pigtails and wide, terrified eyes. She's holding a small backpack with a teddy bear poking out. The infected are at the apartment door, pounding.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You take Lily's hand. 'We're getting out of here together.' The window is your only exit. You carry her to the fire escape, helping her climb down as the infected break through the door behind you. Together, you descend into the dark alley.","label":"Take Lily with you through the fire escape","targetScene":"lily_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Escaping with Lily through the fire escape. You're responsible for a child now. Every decision carries extra weight. But you're not alone anymore.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You can't take a child into that nightmare. You find a hiding spot—a crawlspace under the bed—and stash Lily there with supplies. 'Stay quiet. I'll come back for you.' You seal her in, hoping against hope you can keep that promise.","label":"Hide Lily and leave to find help alone","targetScene":"hide_lily","targetSceneDescription":"Hiding Lily in a crawlspace and leaving to find help alone. The promise weighs on you. You have to make it back.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":45142,"output":3293,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48435,"cost":{"input":0.00406278,"output":0.00059274,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00465552}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783115057800,"responseId":"gen-1783115057-zuta5NDCblCIMoBCyHvJ","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
