{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let me now implement several more scenes to continue expanding the story\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6bceebc1e1ec47bdab688958","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"guilty_escape","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Hallway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You turn away from the bedroom door and climb out onto the fire escape. The cold metal bites into your hands as you descend, each step taking you further from the crying child. The guilt is a physical weight in your chest.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Player","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You reach the ground and disappear into the shadows of the alley. Above, you hear the infected break into the apartment. You force yourself to keep moving, telling yourself it was the only way.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The alley leads to a side street. The city stretches before you, full of horrors and possibilities. But the face of that little girl stays with you, a ghost you can't shake.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You can't live with yourself. You turn around and go back. You climb the fire escape, re-enter the apartment, and find Lily still hiding, still alive. This time, you take her hand and don't let go.","label":"Go back for Lily","targetScene":"return_for_lily","targetSceneDescription":"Going back for Lily. Second chances are rare in the apocalypse. You won't waste this one.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You harden your heart and walk away. The guilt will fade. It has to. You move through the side streets, looking for a way out of this nightmare alone.","label":"Walk away and focus on survival","targetScene":"survivors_guilt","targetSceneDescription":"Walking away from Lily, carrying the weight of guilt. The streets are dark and full of danger. You're alone with your choices.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4e69aee06ca84cefa85bf70a","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"tunnel_exit_garage","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You emerge from a grate into a parking garage. Maya leads you to a corner where she's stashed supplies. She hands you a bottle of water.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Maya Ortiz","content":"Welcome to my forward operating base. It's not much, but it's safe. I've been using this garage as a waypoint. There's a car on level 3 that still runs.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Maya shows you the garage. It's a multi-level structure, dark and echoing. Several cars are parked, but most are damaged. On level 3, a sturdy SUV sits waiting, its keys in the cupholder. Fuel is low, but it could get you out of the city.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You and Maya take the SUV. She knows the side streets, the ways around the blockages. Together, you navigate through the ruined city, heading for the bridge and the rumored safe zone beyond.","label":"Take the SUV with Maya and escape the city","targetScene":"suv_escape","targetSceneDescription":"Racing through the city in an SUV with Maya. The bridge is your goal. Safety is on the other side—if the reports are true.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"You thank Maya but decide to stay in the city. There's the hospital to investigate, the key card in your pocket, and the mystery of the infection to solve. Maya thinks you're crazy, but she gives you her radio frequency. 'If you change your mind,' she says.","label":"Stay in the city to investigate the outbreak","targetScene":"stay_and_investigate","targetSceneDescription":"Staying in the fallen city to find answers. The key card, the hospital, the origin of the infection. Maya heads for the bridge without you.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_478823cc8bf845018cb43d5b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"survivor_group","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You join Maya and Marcus. The group catches its breath in the alcove of a shattered bank. Marcus introduces the others—a young man named Derek with a baseball bat, and a dazed woman in scrubs named Chloe, a nurse at St. Mary's.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Chloe","content":"St. Mary's... it was ground zero. The first cases came in three days ago. Quarantine patients. But it wasn't enough. It spread through the hospital like wildfire.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Chloe","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Marcus","content":"We're heading for the docks. National Guard is setting up an evacuation. But Chloe says there's something at the hospital—research, samples. Something that might explain all this.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The group has a plan and strength in numbers. You decide to stay with them and head for the docks. Together, you navigate the devastated streets, fighting off infected, picking up more survivors along the way. The docks represent hope.","label":"Stay with the group and head for the docks","targetScene":"group_to_docks","targetSceneDescription":"Moving through the city with the survivor group. Safety at the docks is the goal. But the path is long and the infected are everywhere.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The research samples at the hospital could be the key to understanding the infection—or even finding a cure. You can't walk away from that. You split from the group and head for St. Mary's alone, promising to meet them at the docks if you make it.","label":"Split off to investigate St. Mary's Hospital","targetScene":"group_hospital_detour","targetSceneDescription":"Heading alone to St. Mary's Hospital. The research samples Chloe mentioned could hold the key to everything. The group will try to reach the docks without you.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_794e598789304a0abbdf7023","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"hospital_drive","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"The Alleyway","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You floor the gas pedal, the police cruiser roaring through the streets. You swerve around abandoned cars, run over debris, and plow through a cluster of infected that scatter too slowly.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The hospital appears ahead—a massive concrete structure, its windows dark except for a few flickering emergency lights. The parking lot is a graveyard of abandoned vehicles. Ambulances sit with their doors open.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You skid to a halt at the emergency entrance. The doors are smashed open. Inside, darkness and silence. But the radio mentioned survivors gathering here. Are they still inside?","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"You grab the shotgun, take a deep breath, and enter the hospital. The emergency room is a triage nightmare—overturned gurneys, spilled supplies, dark stains. You hear movement deeper in. Someone—or something—is still here.","label":"Enter the hospital and search for survivors","targetScene":"hospital_search","targetSceneDescription":"Searching the dark corridors of St. Mary's Hospital. The emergency room is a graveyard. But there are signs of life deeper in.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"The hospital is too dangerous. You've got a working car and a shotgun. You turn the cruiser around and head for the docks instead—the radio said evacuation, and that's your best bet.","label":"Abandon the hospital and head for the docks","targetScene":"cruiser_to_docks","targetSceneDescription":"Racing away from the hospital toward the docks. The evacuation is your priority. The hospital can wait—if it's still standing.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":46925,"output":2414,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49339,"cost":{"input":0.00422325,"output":0.00043452,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0046577699999999994}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783115100163,"responseId":"gen-1783115100-lMupMPYQGOrwBiNg69jz","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
