{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! So the game starts in a post-apocalyptic scenario. There's a lot of potential here. Let me create some characters and locations first, then implement the start scene with choices.\\n\\nLet me think about what kind of story this will be. It seems like a horror/apocalypse survival story. Let me create:\\n- Locations: The protagonist's apartment, the hallway, the alleyway, etc.\\n- Characters: The neighbor (neighbor), maybe some antagonists\\n\\nLet me start building this out.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"This is a great setup! A post-apocalyptic horror scenario. Let me first create some characters and locations to build the world, then implement the starting scene.\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f2e786e8c01a478db3d3b2ae","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Third-Story Apartment","appearanceDescription":"A cramped one-bedroom apartment in a pre-war building. The living room features a worn-out sofa, a coffee table with a dead laptop, and curtains drawn tight over the window. The kitchenette is small but functional, with cabinets and a pantry. A narrow hallway leads to a bathroom and a bedroom. The fire escape is accessible through the living room window.","backstoryDescription":"Your rented apartment on the third floor of an aging urban building. It's been your home for two years—a modest space filled with mismatched furniture and the accumulated detritus of a solitary life. Tonight, it's turned from a sanctuary into a potential death trap.","vignette":"The apartment is dark except for the faint glow of emergency lights from the street below. Shadows stretch and writhe across the walls with every flicker. The air smells of dust, stale cooking oil, and something faintly metallic—like blood."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_52db7bd009a540afbfcad4ae","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Hallway Landing","appearanceDescription":"A narrow, dimly lit hallway with peeling wallpaper and a threadbare carpet runner. Three apartment doors line the walls—yours, your neighbor Mrs. Castellano's, and the empty unit at the end. A single flickering fluorescent light struggles to push back the darkness. The stairwell leading down to the ground floor is visible at the far end.","backstoryDescription":"The building's second-floor hallway, normally mundane and unremarkable, has become a threshold between relative safety and the chaos unfolding outside and downstairs.","vignette":"The fluorescent light buzzes and stutters, casting everything in a sickly green pallor. The pounding on your door echoes like a heartbeat. From below, strange clicking and scraping sounds drift up the stairwell."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d0750f76040044af9ed67d83","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Alleyway Below Fire Escape","appearanceDescription":"A narrow gap between two brick buildings, cluttered with dumpsters, cardboard boxes, and shattered glass. The fire escape ladder hangs down from above, its bottom rung dangling just out of reach. Puddles of unknown liquid reflect the distant glow of fires burning somewhere in the city.","backstoryDescription":"The alley below your fire escape—a shortcut you've used a hundred times to get to the bodega on the corner. Now it seems to be the hunting ground of something that sounds far from human.","vignette":"Shadows move in unpredictable patterns. The smell of rot and garbage mingles with the sharp tang of ozone. A low, guttural growl reverberates off the narrow walls, its source hidden in the darkness."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d6e6138359ad4207a8f34b47","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Mrs. Castellano","appearanceDescription":"An elderly woman in her late 70s, small and frail with silver-white hair pulled into a tight bun. She wears a floral housecoat over her nightgown, and her eyes—wide with terror—are a pale, watery blue. Her hands tremble as she clutches a wooden crucifix.","backstoryDescription":"Your next-door neighbor for the past two years. A widow who bakes biscotti every Sunday and always asks about your day. She's kind, religious, and utterly terrified right now—she's pounding on your door, begging for help.","vignette":"Her voice cracks with desperation. Through the peephole, you can see her silhouette, small and trembling, casting anxious glances over her shoulder toward the stairwell."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":968,"output":1083,"cacheRead":2048,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4099,"cost":{"input":0.00008711999999999999,"output":0.00019494,"cacheRead":0.00004096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00032302}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783115721301,"responseId":"gen-1783115721-yq3EKE1O7SAezbslghFp","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
