{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me implement a few more.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_35a7d13988ed4084944a6156","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"fortify_together","location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"choices":[{"label":"Ignore the tapping—focus on reinforcing the windows","description":"Whatever is tapping, you can't afford to be distracted. You grab more furniture, more boards. You nail plywood over the window frames. The tapping continues, patient and unhurried.","targetScene":"reinforce_windows","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"The apartment becomes a wooden cage. Plywood covers every window. But as you hammer the last nail, you realize you've sealed yourself in with the tapping thing—and it's already inside."},{"label":"Investigate the tapping at the window","description":"Slowly, you approach the window. The tapping is rhythmic. Deliberate. Like someone knocking to be let in. You pull back the curtain just enough to see.","targetScene":"window_tapping","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"At the window, a figure perches on the fire escape platform. It's not trying to break in. It's just... watching. Tapping. Waiting."},{"label":"Whisper a plan to Mrs. Castellano—escape through the bathroom window","description":"The bathroom window faces the other side of the building—a different alley, maybe a different fate. You whisper your plan to Mrs. Castellano. It's risky, but it might be your only way out.","targetScene":"bathroom_window_escape","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You creep toward the bathroom with Mrs. Castellano. The tapping at the living room window continues, oblivious—or unconcerned—that its prey is slipping away."}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You help Mrs. Castellano to her feet, her legs shaky but functional. 'We need to block every entrance,' you tell her. 'The door, the windows—everything.'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Mrs. Castellano","content":"I have boards in my apartment—my late husband Marco, he was always preparing for hurricanes. I have nails too.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Together, you work in desperate efficiency. She retrieves the supplies from her apartment while you clear the hallway, heart pounding each second she's out of sight. She returns, arms full of pine boards and a rusty hammer. You start nailing them across the front door frame.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"As you drive the last nail into the door frame, a new sound freezes your blood. From the living room window—*tap. Tap. Tap.* Slow. Deliberate. The sound of something knuckle-deep on the other side of the glass.","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"internal_dialogue","character":"You","content":"It's at the window. It watched us fortify the door and just... walked around. They're herding us.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":2940,"output":929,"cacheRead":12416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16285,"cost":{"input":0.0002646,"output":0.00016722,"cacheRead":0.00024832,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00068014}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783115866321,"responseId":"gen-1783115866-tadUujfaSPA7N1zKkBoT","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
