{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me implement a few more.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b40db0700a774ee0acbcb513","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"listen_at_door","location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"choices":[{"label":"Run to the fire escape","description":"That voice—it knows you're alone. It knows your name. The door isn't safe anymore. You bolt for the living room window, fumbling with the lock.","targetScene":"fire_escape_view","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"label":"Answer it back","description":"Your voice shakes, but you force words out. 'Who are you? What do you want?' Perhaps if it's talking, you can buy time. Perhaps you can negotiate.","targetScene":"answer_the_whisper","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Your question hangs in the air. For a long moment, there's only silence. Then the voice responds—and it's coming from inside your apartment."},{"label":"Stay perfectly silent and still","description":"You don't move. You barely breathe. Maybe if you pretend you didn't hear it, it'll go away. Maybe it'll think the apartment is empty.","targetScene":"perfect_silence","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Minutes crawl by in absolute silence. Just when you think it might have worked, you hear the front door unlock. The deadbolt turns by itself."}],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You freeze, holding your breath, pressing your ear to the wood. The silence is absolute. No pounding. No breathing. No footsteps.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Then—a whisper. So faint you almost miss it. It comes through the wood like a cold draft, curling around the edges of the door frame.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"'I know you're in there.'","instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The voice is wrong. It's using human speech, but the cadence is off—like someone who learned language from a book and never quite mastered the rhythm. It continues, growing slightly louder:","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"You","content":"(whispering) It's not Mrs. Castellano. It's not even human.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1341,"output":722,"cacheRead":16384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18447,"cost":{"input":0.00012069,"output":0.00012996,"cacheRead":0.00032768,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00057833}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783115896445,"responseId":"gen-1783115896-Hr5U7USQjWcBc0e017JJ","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
