{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue with more open stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7486c9add16b418c8dc1b43a","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You slip the chain and open the door a crack. The hallway is empty, but you hear movement from the stairwell. This is it. Your one chance. You step out, weapon raised, and move toward the sound.","label":"Step into the hallway to confront it","targetScene":"confront_hallway","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"No. Charging out is suicide. You hold your position, knife ready, back to the wall. Let it come to you. Let it make the first move.","label":"Hold position and let it come to you","targetScene":"hold_position","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"strike_first","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"The knife feels solid in your hand. Real. The weight of it anchors you. You've made your choice—you're not going to cower in the dark, waiting for death to find you.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You approach the door, stepping over the barricade you've built. Your hand finds the deadbolt. The creature on the other side has gone quiet, as if it knows what you're about to do.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You take a breath. Then another. Your heart is a war drum in your chest.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"'I'm not dying tonight,' you whisper. And you open the door.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"angry"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7b40d913f2f24ca08ac9c2d6","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The waiting is agony. Every creak, every drip of water makes you flinch. But you stay. You hold. You listen to the sounds of the building settling around you, trying to distinguish between normal sounds and the sounds of things that hunt.","label":"Stay and wait it out","targetScene":"wait_them_out","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't take the waiting anymore. The suspense is worse than death. You grab your weapon and head for the door, determined to make your stand on your terms.","label":"Go on the offensive","targetScene":"strike_first","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"hold_position","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"You press your back against the wall beside the doorframe, knife held low, breathing slow. The creature is out there. You can hear it—the wet slide of its limbs on the hallway floor. It's circling. Waiting.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Minutes pass. The sounds fade. The hallway goes quiet. But you don't move. You've read enough horror stories to know that silence is just another kind of trap.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Your legs begin to cramp. Your knuckles are white around the knife handle. Still, you hold. The night stretches on, an endless corridor of shadows and waiting.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f6fcbfa8e8d4f178d300534","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You throw the door open wide. The hallway is empty—but the air is wrong. Too cold. Too still. You take a step out, poker raised, and the door swings shut behind you with a click. You're in the hallway now. Committed.","label":"Step into the hallway and confront it","targetScene":"confront_hallway","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You test the poker against the door, driving the hook into the wood with a satisfying thunk. If it comes through, it'll get a face full of iron.","label":"Drive the poker into the door frame as a defense","targetScene":"hold_position","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"confront_hallway","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Hallway Landing","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"The hallway stretches before you, a tunnel of flickering shadows. The fluorescent light at the far end buzzes and stutters, casting the world in sickly green pulses.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You take a step. Then another. The poker feels heavy in your hands. Somewhere in the building, a pipe groans. From the stairwell, you hear it—a wet, rhythmic sound. Breathing. Or something like breathing.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"A shape detaches itself from the shadows at the end of the hall. It's tall. Too tall. Its head brushes the ceiling as it moves toward you with a gait that doesn't quite match the rhythm of walking.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"type":"narration"},{"content":"'Hello,' it says. Not a question. Not a greeting. Just the word, spoken in a voice that sounds like it's learning what a voice should be.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":3098,"output":1643,"cacheRead":31744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36485,"cost":{"input":0.00027882,"output":0.00029574,"cacheRead":0.00063488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00120944}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783118111209,"responseId":"gen-1783118111-32TDzgazh19PfweIGXvl","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
