{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue with the fire escape branch and other remaining stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_111aef00770c41ecaa838435","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The creature is climbing toward you. You can't go back up—it's between you and the window. You swing the knife as hard as you can, aiming for where its neck should be. The blade connects with something solid. The creature screeches—a sound like tearing metal—and falls.","label":"Fight back with your weapon","targetScene":"fight_creature_alley","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"There's no time to think. You let go of the ladder and drop the remaining fifteen feet, landing hard on the wet concrete. Your ankle screams in protest, but adrenaline pushes you forward.","label":"Drop and run","targetScene":"drop_and_run","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"fight_creature_alley","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Alleyway Below Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"content":"The pale hand grips the ladder rung just below you. You see it now—a creature unfolding itself from the darkness of the alley, its limbs too long, its skin slick with rain. It tilts its head up and you see its face: a mouth where a mouth shouldn't be, opening in a silent scream.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You have seconds. The knife is in your hand. The creature is climbing. The rain is cold on your face.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"It reaches for you. Its fingers are too long, too many joints, tipped with black nails that gleam in the dark. You swing.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"angry"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6c40ef66906946ea9cf97f1b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You hit the ground running, your feet slapping wet concrete. The mouth of the alley is twenty feet away. Fifteen. Ten. Behind you, you hear a wet, clicking chorus—they're chasing you. You burst out onto the street and—","label":"Sprint for the street","targetScene":"sprint_from_alley","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't outrun them. You duck behind a dumpster, pressing yourself into the shadows, praying the smell of garbage masks your scent.","label":"Hide behind the dumpster","targetScene":"freeze_on_escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"sprint_from_alley","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Alleyway Below Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"content":"You hit the ground running. The impact jars your spine but you don't stop—can't stop. Your feet find the wet concrete and you sprint toward the dim glow at the mouth of the alley.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Behind you, the clicking intensifies. They're giving chase. You can hear them—multiple sets of limbs scraping concrete, moving faster than anything that size should be able to move.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"The street is ten feet away. Five. You can see cars overturned, a fire burning in a dumpster, the silhouette of a bus slumped against a lamppost. The city has become a war zone.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You burst out of the alley and—","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_65880e48122645d591049bfd","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You freeze. The creature below hasn't seen you yet. But it's climbing. You press yourself flat against the fire escape platform, barely breathing, as it passes directly beneath you. If it looks up, you're dead.","label":"Freeze and hope it passes","targetScene":"freeze_on_escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You scramble back up the fire escape as fast as you can. The ladder groans beneath you. Below, the creature hisses and begins climbing faster.","label":"Scramble back up to the apartment","targetScene":"scramble_back_inside","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"freeze_on_escape","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Alleyway Below Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"content":"You freeze. Every muscle in your body locks tight. The rain streams down your face as you press yourself against the cold metal of the fire escape, trying to become part of the structure.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Below you, the creature stops climbing. It tilts its head, listening. You can hear it sniffing the air—a wet, sucking sound. Your heart is so loud you're sure it can hear it.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"The creature lets out a low, clicking call. From further down the alley, another answers. They're communicating. Coordinating.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Then, slowly, it begins to descend back into the shadows. It didn't see you. Not yet.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":5381,"output":1640,"cacheRead":32768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39789,"cost":{"input":0.00048429,"output":0.0002952,"cacheRead":0.00065536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00143485}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783118144997,"responseId":"gen-1783118145-zcV8FQkH1XDlUeN3GZDq","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
