{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue with the remaining open stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_83f72e9fc5924cd6a752f364","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You make a break for the roof access door at the end of the hallway. If you can get to the roof, you might be able to cross to the next building.","label":"Run for the roof access door","targetScene":"roof_attempt","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You retreat back into your apartment and decide to wait. Maybe they'll leave. Maybe help will come.","label":"Retreat and wait","targetScene":"wait_them_out","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"roof_attempt","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Hallway Landing","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"The hallway is dark and silent. The emergency lights have died, leaving only the faint glow of distant fires filtering through the windows. You move quickly but quietly, sticking to the walls, avoiding the center of the hall where the floorboards creak.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"The stairwell door is ahead. Beyond it, the roof access ladder. Your hand touches the cold metal of the door handle. You pause.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"From the other side of the door, you hear it. Scratching. Slow. Deliberate. Something is on the stairs. Waiting.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_42217bf6ed914c3b80cfd66b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You wait. Hours pass. The sounds outside slowly fade. When dawn finally breaks, pale gray light seeps through the curtains. You've survived the night. But now you have to face what's left of the world.","label":"Wait until dawn breaks","targetScene":"wait_for_dawn","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't wait anymore. The waiting is killing you slowly. You grab your weapon and head for the door.","label":"Stop waiting — go on the attack","targetScene":"strike_first","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"wait_them_out","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"You settle in for a long wait. You drag a chair into the darkest corner of the room, where you can see both the door and the window. The knife is in your lap. Your back is against the wall.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Time becomes meaningless. The dark is absolute. Sounds drift through the walls—scraping, clicking, the occasional distant scream that cuts off abruptly. Each sound is a small death.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You think about Mrs. Castellano. About the Rossi child on the fourth floor. About all the people in the building. About the city beyond. Is anyone else alive? Or are you the last?","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cd38d01930044d269976833b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You scramble up the fire escape, heart pounding. You reach your window and practically fall through it, landing hard on the living room floor. You're back inside. Shaken. Alive.","label":"Climb back inside the apartment","targetScene":"back_to_door_or_alley_knowledge","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't go back inside. The creatures know where you live now. You climb to the roof instead, hoping to find another way down.","label":"Climb up to the roof instead","targetScene":"roof_attempt","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"scramble_back_inside","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Alleyway Below Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"content":"You scramble up the fire escape, your hands slipping on the rain-slicked metal. Below, the clicking grows louder—they're coming. Fast.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Your window is still open. You dive through it, landing hard on the floor, glass crunching beneath you. You spin and slam the window shut, fumbling with the lock.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"type":"narration"},{"content":"A pale hand slaps against the glass from outside. Then another. The window rattles in its frame. You scramble backward, reaching for anything you can use to barricade it.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":33680,"output":1468,"cacheRead":6144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41292,"cost":{"input":0.0030312,"output":0.00026424,"cacheRead":0.00012288000000000002,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0034183200000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783118166508,"responseId":"gen-1783118166-Ye61mUlezfRQBG3uQdvN","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
