{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue with the remaining open stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b8e48e6c71e74c66a714fb00","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You drop to the ground, landing hard. Your ankle twists but you force yourself up and run, limping toward the mouth of the alley. The creatures are right behind you.","label":"Run for the street","targetScene":"sprint_from_alley","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You hit the ground and roll, coming up behind a dumpster. You press yourself into the shadows, hoping they lose you in the maze of trash and debris.","label":"Hide in the shadows","targetScene":"freeze_on_escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"drop_and_run","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Alleyway Below Fire Escape","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"script":[{"content":"You let go of the ladder and drop. The ground rushes up and you hit hard—the impact slams through your legs, your spine. Pain lances up your ankle. But you're alive.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You force yourself to your feet. The alley spins around you. At the far end, shapes are moving—more of them, drawn by the noise. You need to move. Now.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_83fb415254da4e92a35ce293","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"The guilt is unbearable. You open the door and run down the hallway, calling for her. You can't let her face this alone.","label":"Go after her","targetScene":"go_after_castellano","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You made your choice. It was the hard one, but it was the right one. You focus on survival now.","label":"Stay and survive alone","targetScene":"alone_and_surviving","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"go_after_castellano","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Hallway Landing","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"You can't live with yourself. You throw open the door and run into the hallway. 'Mrs. Castellano!' you shout, your voice echoing off the walls.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"The hallway is empty. Her door is ajar. From inside her apartment, you hear a wet, rhythmic sound—and a voice. Mrs. Castellano's voice, but wrong. Hollow. 'I'm in here,' it says. 'Come in. Please.'","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You stand in the hallway, frozen. The door is open. The voice is wrong. But she might still be alive in there.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_516a70dff8834b27a3b22b7f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You're alone now. You check your supplies, barricade the door tighter, and settle in for a long night. The weight of your decision presses down on you, but you're alive. For now.","label":"Alone and surviving","targetScene":"alone_and_surviving","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't stay here. Alone with your guilt and the sounds of things moving in the walls. You grab your keys and head for the rooftop.","label":"Head for the roof","targetScene":"roof_attempt","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"alone_and_surviving","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"You close the door and lean against it, sliding down to the floor. The silence of the apartment is deafening. It was always quiet here, but now the quiet is different. It's the quiet of a grave.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You think about Mrs. Castellano. Her biscotti. The way she always asked about your day. The way she said 'grazie' when you held the door for her. And now she's alone out there. With them.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You could go after her. Or you could stay. The choice is yours, and either way, you'll carry it forever.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a7b32028766f4a63907f56ee","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You know enough. The creatures mimic voices, they have lamprey-like mouths, they wear people like costumes. You close the chain on the door and brace yourself for what's coming.","label":"Brace yourself — prepare for the creature at the door","targetScene":"brace_for_impact","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't face this alone. You open the door and pull her inside, hoping you haven't made a fatal mistake.","label":"Pull her inside","targetScene":"open_door_for_neighbor","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"brace_with_knowledge","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Hallway Landing","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"Mrs. Castellano's description burns itself into your mind. Creatures with spiral mouths. Mimics that learn voices. Things that fall from the sky like rain. You know what you're dealing with now. And it changes everything.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"The wet footsteps on the stairs grow louder. Closer. Mrs. Castellano is still outside your door, whispering through the wood: 'Please. It's coming. Please let me in.'","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You have a choice: believe her bravery and open the door, or trust her horrifying description and prepare for the worst.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":152,"output":1926,"cacheRead":41216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43294,"cost":{"input":0.00001368,"output":0.00034668,"cacheRead":0.00082432,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00118468}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783118186249,"responseId":"gen-1783118186-C0jwcTGbBvP2h7CEJKMx","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
