{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the previously locked stubs are open. I can now implement them. Let me also check what the current checkpoint status is. The earlier frontier checkpoints (roof_escape_plan, run_for_street, silent_hide) should have been converted to interior checkpoints since all non-locked stubs have been implemented.\\n\\nLet me implement the now-available open stubs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! The checkpoints have refreshed! Let me now implement the newly unlocked scene stubs"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7e6e9b77e8de448dbbba6038","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"wait_for_dawn","location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":true,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You make the call. You're staying put. Dawn is maybe four hours away. You can last four hours.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Mrs. Castellano","content":"Four hours? In the dark? With those things out there?","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"You","content":"We block the windows. We block the door. We stay quiet and we wait. Daylight changes things—they might not be able to operate in the sun.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You and Mrs. Castellano work in desperate silence, moving furniture against every possible entry point. The rain drums against the windows like a thousand tiny fingers tapping to be let in. You settle into the darkest corner of the apartment, your back to the wall, a knife in one hand, Mrs. Castellano's crucifix pressed into the other.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"sad"}]}],"choices":[{"label":"Keep watch while Mrs. Castellano sleeps","description":"She's exhausted. Let her rest while you keep vigil through the dark hours.","targetScene":"vigil_watch","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You stand watch over a sleeping Mrs. Castellano as the night deepens and strange sounds echo through the building."},{"label":"Try to make contact with other survivors","description":"There might be other people still alive. You could try tapping on the walls to find them.","targetScene":"contact_survivors","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You begin tapping on the walls in a coded pattern, hoping someone will answer back."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9b4141e43c8e4dd8af6bb85c","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"roof_sneak_together","location":"Hallway Landing","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":true,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You and Mrs. Castellano creep into the hallway. She moves with surprising quiet for her age—fear has made her light on her feet. The storage closet at the end of the hall is her target. The rope is inside.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"She reaches the closet and pulls the door open. It groans. You both freeze. The silence stretches. Nothing stirs. She reaches inside and pulls out a coil of thick climbing rope—Marco's, as promised.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You move toward the roof access ladder at the end of the hall. It's a pull-down chain ladder bolted to the wall, leading to a hatch in the ceiling. You reach up, grab the chain, and pull.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The ladder descends with a metallic rattle that sounds like a gunshot in the silence. From somewhere below, you hear a responding sound—a wet, eager clicking. They heard you.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"},{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]}],"choices":[{"label":"Climb up quickly — get to the roof before they arrive","description":"You push Mrs. Castellano toward the ladder. 'Go! Go now!' You'll follow right behind her.","targetScene":"roof_top_escape","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You and Mrs. Castellano scramble up the ladder onto the rain-swept roof, the creatures closing in below."},{"label":"Cut your losses — pull the ladder back up and retreat","description":"Too loud. Too risky. You pull the ladder back up and retreat to the apartment. The roof plan is compromised.","targetScene":"fortify_together","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ca0750fb78914794a70bf44f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"roof_go_alone","location":"Hallway Landing","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"sad"}],"isCheckpoint":true,"script":[{"type":"dialogue","character":"You","content":"'I'll go alone,' you tell Mrs. Castellano. 'You stay here. Barricade the door. If I find a way out, I'll come back for you.'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Mrs. Castellano","content":"She grabs your arm, her eyes wet. 'Please. Don't leave me here alone.'","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"You","content":"'I'll be back. I promise.' You don't know if you're lying.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You slip out the door before you can change your mind. The hallway is empty. The roof access is at the end. You move quickly, keeping to the shadows, leaving Mrs. Castellano behind.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Climb to the roof","description":"You reach the roof access ladder and climb. The roof is your only hope.","targetScene":"roof_top_alone","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"You emerge onto the rain-swept roof, alone, the city burning below you."},{"label":"Turn back — you can't abandon her","description":"Halfway to the roof, you stop. You can't do this. You turn around and go back to Mrs. Castellano.","targetScene":"fortify_together","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":2788,"output":1946,"cacheRead":40960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45694,"cost":{"input":0.00025092,"output":0.00035028,"cacheRead":0.0008192,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0014204}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783118220418,"responseId":"gen-1783118220-LAsgtrA6yxoBOPk9IaCj","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
