{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have new scene stubs created:\\n- vigil_watch (from wait_for_dawn)\\n- contact_survivors (from wait_for_dawn)\\n- roof_top_escape (from roof_sneak_together)\\n- roof_top_alone (from roof_go_alone)\\n\\nAlso I still have:\\n- charge_hallway (from run_for_street)\\n- peephole_street_run (from run_for_street)\\n- silent_survive (from silent_hide)\\n- peephole_arm_and_ambush (from silent_hide)\\n\\nLet me implement the remaining ones.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me implement the remaining open stubs\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5ca67a3d9b4a4be2b9dcbaf2","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"charge_hallway","location":"Hallway Landing","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You throw the door open and charge into the hallway, Mrs. Castellano close behind. Speed is your only ally. The stairwell is ahead—fifteen feet, maybe less.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You make it halfway before you see it. The creature at the far end of the hall turns to face you. It's too tall, its limbs too long. It tilts its head and smiles with a mouth that splits its face in half.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"It doesn't charge. It just watches. And you realize: you're running toward it. Into its territory. Into the dark.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]}],"choices":[{"label":"Keep charging — run past it","description":"There's no stopping now. You sprint past the creature, praying it doesn't catch you.","targetScene":"sprint_from_alley","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"label":"Stop and fight","description":"You can't outrun it. You stop and raise your weapon, ready to meet it head-on.","targetScene":"confront_hallway","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fe6b28305d3b491cae5061fc","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"peephole_street_run","location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You press your eye to the peephole before committing to the run. The hallway stretches before you, empty and dark. At the far end, near the stairwell, a shadow moves—but it's hard to tell if it's real or just a trick of the light.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You watch for a full minute. Nothing emerges. The stairwell door is closed. If you're fast and quiet, you might make it.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Mrs. Castellano","content":"'Is it clear?' she whispers.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"You hesitate. The hallway looks clear now—but that doesn't mean it's safe.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"It looks clear — make a run for it","description":"You've waited long enough. You open the door and run with Mrs. Castellano toward the stairwell.","targetScene":"charge_hallway","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"label":"Too risky — stay put","description":"Something feels wrong. You step away from the door and decide to fortify instead.","targetScene":"fortify_together","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_86f3754b67904d7296b14dc0","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"silent_survive","location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You remain motionless. Minutes pass. The creature's breathing fades. You hear it move away from the door, its wet footsteps retreating down the hall.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"An hour passes. Then two. Mrs. Castellano has fallen asleep against your shoulder, exhausted. You stay awake, watching the door, listening to the building settle around you.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Sometime in the deepest part of the night, the rain stops. The silence that follows is worse than the noise. You can hear your own heartbeat. You can hear the blood moving in your veins.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"Dawn comes slowly. Gray light seeps through the cracks in the curtains. You've survived the night. But the sounds from outside—the clicking, the scraping—haven't stopped. They're still out there. Waiting.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Venture out into the dawn","description":"Daylight gives you a chance. You leave the apartment to see what's left of the world.","targetScene":"roof_attempt","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"label":"Stay hidden for another day","description":"One more day. One more night. You'll wait until you're sure they're gone.","targetScene":"wait_them_out","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d6cb2157589a4364a28a9584","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"peephole_arm_and_ambush","location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"You grab the marble bookend from the shelf. It's heavy, solid, with sharp edges. Not ideal, but it'll break bone. You press yourself against the wall beside the door.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Mrs. Castellano","content":"Mrs. Castellano picks up a heavy candlestick. 'I'm not helpless,' she whispers.","instantLocationEffects":[],"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"happy"}]},{"type":"narration","content":"Together, you flank the door. The creature in the hallway scratches at the wood. You can hear it breathing. It's going to come through. And when it does, you'll be ready.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"angry"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"label":"Wait until it breaks through","description":"You hold your breath, bookend raised, as the lock begins to splinter.","targetScene":"ambush_at_door","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"label":"Open the door and strike first","description":"You can't wait. You throw the door open and swing before it expects you.","targetScene":"strike_first","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":2190,"output":2204,"cacheRead":46336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50730,"cost":{"input":0.0001971,"output":0.00039672,"cacheRead":0.00092672,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00152054}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783118261788,"responseId":"gen-1783118261-9eW8KUm641CoNjalJsfa","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
