{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check if I can create new checkpoints. The frontier checkpoints from the previous batch have been cleared. I can now implement these as checkpoints if they're far enough from the nearest checkpoints.\\n\\nLet me just implement them all as ending scenes or checkpoints.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me implement these final scene stubs\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_912dc7dfbdde4ef3a39df590","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You keep watch through the long night. Nothing tries to enter. When dawn breaks, pale and gray, you gently wake Mrs. Castellano. 'It's morning,' you say. 'We made it.' The sounds outside have quieted. Maybe the creatures fear the light.","label":"Survive the night — emerge at dawn","targetScene":"roof_attempt","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"Halfway through the night, you hear footsteps in the hallway. Something is coming. You nudge Mrs. Castellano awake and prepare for the worst.","label":"Something is coming — prepare to fight","targetScene":"ambush_at_door","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"vigil_watch","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"Mrs. Castellano curls up on the floor, using her folded arms as a pillow. Within minutes, her breathing evens out. She's asleep. You don't know how she can sleep at a time like this, but you're glad she can.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You settle into a chair facing the door, knife in hand. The night creeps by. Every creak, every groan of the building makes you flinch. But nothing comes.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Your eyelids grow heavy. You fight it. You can't fall asleep. You can't. But the darkness is warm and the rain is rhythmic and—","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You jerk awake. How long were you out? Seconds? Minutes? The room is unchanged. Mrs. Castellano is still asleep. The door is still closed. But the tapping at the window has stopped.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1a700452d0a54f758210aafe","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"A tap comes back. Three slow knocks from the apartment next to Mrs. Castellano's. Someone is alive in there. You press your mouth to the wall and whisper: 'Stay quiet. Stay alive. We'll find you.' Whether they heard you or not, you've made a connection. You're not alone.","label":"Keep tapping — establish communication","targetScene":"silent_survive","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The response tap gives you hope. You signal that you're moving to the roof and will try to come back for them.","label":"Signal your plan and move out","targetScene":"roof_attempt","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"contact_survivors","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"content":"You press your ear to the wall and tap. Once. Pause. Twice. The code you and your childhood friends used. A simple question: 'Anyone there?'","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Silence. You tap again, louder this time. Mrs. Castellano watches you, hope flickering in her eyes.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Then—a response. Three slow taps from somewhere in the building. Not from Mrs. Castellano's apartment. From deeper in. Someone else is alive.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7c1ea13eaa7e47018af31110","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You make it to the roof of the next building. From there, you spot a police barricade three blocks away—survivors! But the streets between are crawling with creatures. The rope and your wits are all you have left.","label":"Cross the rooftops toward the barricade","targetScene":"roof_top_escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The view from the roof is terrifying. The creatures are everywhere—climbing walls, moving through streets, perched on rooftops. You pull Mrs. Castellano down behind a ventilation unit. 'We wait,' you whisper. 'We watch. We learn their patterns.'","label":"Find cover on the roof and observe","targetScene":"silent_survive","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"roof_top_escape","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain","wind"],"script":[{"content":"You burst through the roof hatch into the cold night air. The rain hits you like a wall. The sky is the color of bruised fruit, lit from below by scattered fires. The city sprawls beneath you, wounded and burning.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Mrs. Castellano follows, pulling the hatch closed behind her. The roof is flat and gravelly, dotted with ventilation units and satellite dishes. The next building is close—maybe eight feet of gap between you and it.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Mrs. Castellano","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You look down. The alley below is full of them. Dozens of pale shapes moving in the dark, their upturned faces like flowers turning toward the sun. They know you're up here.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"type":"narration"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b96e86c11edc4f7b8e7bab9d","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"choices":[{"description":"You make a running leap across the gap between buildings. You land hard, rolling on the gravel of the next roof. Below, the creatures screech in fury. You're one building closer to freedom.","label":"Leap to the next building","targetScene":"roof_top_escape","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"You can't leave Mrs. Castellano behind. You turn back—you have to warn her, to find her, to make this right.","label":"Go back for Mrs. Castellano","targetScene":"go_after_castellano","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}],"id":"roof_top_alone","isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Third-Story Apartment","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain","wind"],"script":[{"content":"You emerge onto the roof alone. The wind whips at your clothes. The city is a patchwork of fire and shadow below you. You can see for miles—and everywhere you look, you see movement. Pale shapes crawling across every surface.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"You","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"You think about Mrs. Castellano, alone in your apartment. You made a promise. You don't know if you can keep it.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"The next rooftop is three feet away. A jump you could make in your sleep. Beyond it, another. And another. A path through the sky, if you're brave enough to take it.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":355,"output":2283,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53326,"cost":{"input":0.00003195,"output":0.00041094,"cacheRead":0.00101376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00145665}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783118293272,"responseId":"gen-1783118293-xqD6HM1YNhMMUMvHTXAZ","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
