{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, characters created. Now let me create the locations.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me create the locations:\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ecb72477ddfc4f518af4e7f8","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Suburban Backyard","vignette":"A modest fenced backyard where the extraordinary has become ordinary. A crystalline alien craft the size of a small car rests in a smoldering circle of grass, its surface humming with otherworldly energy. Flowerbeds and a child's swing set frame this impossible visitor.","appearanceDescription":"A well-kept suburban lawn bordered by a white picket fence and overgrown rose bushes. A child's wooden swing set stands to one side, next to a vegetable garden. In the center, the grass is blackened and scorched in a perfect circle, where a teardrop-shaped crystalline craft sits, pulsing with soft internal light.","backstoryDescription":"This backyard has been in Elena's family for three generations — a place of birthday parties, summer barbecues, and quiet evenings watching stars. Tonight, it becomes the site of first contact, forever changing its peaceful history."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f76fe2084f784499b059c11e","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Vasquez Family Kitchen","vignette":"The warm heart of the home, this cozy kitchen smells of coffee and cinnamon. Yellow curtains frame the window overlooking the backyard, offering a view of the impossible craft resting on the lawn. A half-eaten dinner sits forgotten on the table.","appearanceDescription":"A warm, lived-in kitchen with worn wooden cabinets, a farmhouse sink, and a large oak table covered with a checkered cloth. Dishes are drying by the sink, and a child's drawings — of rockets and aliens — are taped to the refrigerator. The back door's glass pane looks out onto the glowing craft in the yard.","backstoryDescription":"This kitchen has hosted countless family dinners, late-night homework sessions, and heart-to-heart conversations. The window has always been Elena's favorite spot for stargazing, but tonight it frames a sight she could never have imagined."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9050e55005694bd6957d8c4c","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Inside the Alien Craft","vignette":"The interior defies physics — larger within than without, a cathedral of crystalline geometry. Walls of faceted crystal pulse with living light, and the air hums with a frequency that resonates in the bones. Strange symbols dance across every surface, telling stories in light.","appearanceDescription":"A spherical chamber with walls of translucent crystal that shift between deep blue and silver. The floor seems to be made of polished obsidian, reflecting the pulsing lights above. Floating platforms and crystal formations serve as unknown furniture. The air itself glitters with suspended particles of light, and a gentle warmth emanates from every surface.","backstoryDescription":"This craft is a biological extension of its pilot, grown from crystalline seeds rather than built. It has crossed interstellar voids, ridden gravity waves, and now rests in a suburban backyard — the first of its kind to touch Earth's soil."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e1f95a339a8748df9f8ef1ea","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Veil's Mobile Command Unit","vignette":"A command vehicle disguised as a delivery truck, stuffed with surveillance equipment, communication arrays, and weapons designed for the extraordinary. It's the nerve center of a covert operation that has happened many times before — though never quite like this.","appearanceDescription":"The interior of a repurposed delivery truck, lined with monitors showing satellite imagery, heat signatures, and encrypted data streams. A small tactical table occupies the center, with a holographic projector mapping the surrounding neighborhood. Weapon cases are secured to the walls alongside hazmat suits and unknown containment devices.","backstoryDescription":"Mobile Command Units like this one have been deployed across the globe for decades, quietly containing evidence of the unexplained. This unit was scrambled from a nearby black site within minutes of the craft's atmospheric entry."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":4692,"output":1005,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":5697,"cost":{"input":0.00042228,"output":0.0001809,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00060318}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783134127406,"responseId":"gen-1783134127-O5eOj07EY5DdugCiRaTv","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
