{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All three are open. Let me implement them one by one, creating new branching paths.\\n\\nLet me think about the story structure:\\n\\n1. **approach_craft** - Elena investigates the craft up close. This could lead to meeting Zylar, the alien.\\n2. **observe_from_kitchen** - Elena and Leo watch from inside. They might see patterns that reveal something about the alien's intentions.\\n3. **call_authorities** - The call alerts Agent Cole and The Veil, who arrive.\\n\\nLet me implement each scene. I'll make some of them checkpoints so I can continue the story further.\\n\\nLet me start with **approach_craft** - this is a major path where Elena interacts with the alien.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"All scene stubs are open. Let me implement them one at a time, starting with approaching the craft:\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8f4e26addb1e468a87ce126f","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"approach_craft","location":"Suburban Backyard","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The grass crunches under your feet, frosted with the first chill of autumn. Each step brings you closer to the impossible — a vessel from beyond the stars, resting in your own backyard like a fallen star. The humming intensifies, resonating deep within your chest, and the crystalline surface of the craft ripples with light as if aware of your approach.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"You stop about ten feet away. The craft's surface is smooth like polished glass, yet somehow organic — veins of light pulse beneath its skin in a rhythm almost like a heartbeat. As you watch, a section of the hull begins to shift, the crystals parting like a blooming flower, revealing a warm golden glow from within.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Dr. Elena Vasquez","content":"Oh my god... it's opening.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"A figure emerges. It's roughly humanoid but made of flowing light — a column of liquid starlight that shifts and shimmers. Two points of golden light focus on you like eyes. It makes no sound, yet a voice resonates directly in your mind — warm, curious, and slightly desperate.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Dr. Elena Vasquez","effect":"jump"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Zylar","content":"You... perceive me. You are the first on this world who can. Please. I have crossed the great dark to find aid. My people are dying.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"narration","content":"The words aren't spoken — they appear as pure meaning in your consciousness, bypassing language entirely. You understand Zylar perfectly. Behind you, Leo gasps from the back door.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Your scientific training kicks in. This is the moment every astrobiologist dreams of. You introduce yourself, ask questions about Zylar's biology, their civilization, their technology. You want to learn everything. Leo creeps closer, utterly fascinated.","label":"Engage scientifically — ask questions and learn about Zylar","targetScene":"scientific_exchange","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Elena engages Zylar in a scientific dialogue, learning about crystalline life forms, their dying star, and their desperate mission. Leo joins them, forming a bond with the alien."},{"description":"Your motherly instincts override everything. You step between Zylar and Leo, demanding to know if they're dangerous. You need guarantees of safety before any communication continues. The air crackles with tension.","label":"Demand safety guarantees — protect Leo first","targetScene":"protective_demand","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Elena takes a defensive posture, demanding to know if Zylar poses any threat. Zylar demonstrates its peaceful intentions by sharing a vision of its dying homeworld, appealing for help."},{"description":"You take a leap of faith. Zylar came here for help, and something in its light feels true. You extend your hand toward the being of light, offering trust without conditions. The gesture hangs in the air, waiting for a response.","label":"Extend your hand in trust and friendship","targetScene":"gesture_of_trust","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetSceneDescription":"Elena extends her hand in a gesture of trust. Zylar responds by sharing a fragment of its consciousness with her, creating a profound empathic connection that lets Elena feel what Zylar feels."}],"isCheckpoint":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":5252,"output":1190,"cacheRead":4608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11050,"cost":{"input":0.00047268,"output":0.0002142,"cacheRead":0.00009216,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0007790399999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783134172871,"responseId":"gen-1783134173-GbdIkmXFfIf8tL1TjerC","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
