{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me do the remaining ones: let_zylar_go_ending, promise_to_help, grounded_bond, scientific_partnership","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me implement the remaining stubs\\n\\n\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_474f19a7249a4d20a227bcd2","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"let_zylar_go_ending","choices":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Suburban Backyard","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"You hold Leo close and watch as Zylar's craft powers up. The crystalline hull glows brighter and brighter until it's blinding. Agent Cole's men arrive, shouting orders — but it's too late."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"The craft rises silently, a teardrop of light ascending into the night sky. For a moment, it hangs among the stars, indistinguishable from them. Then it's gone — a streak of light fading into the cosmic dark."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Dr. Elena Vasquez","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"Zylar is gone. The Keth will find another way, or they won't. You'll never know. But Leo is safe. That's what matters."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"In the weeks that follow, you return to teaching. But something has changed. At night, you sit on the back porch and look up at the stars. And Leo... Leo keeps drawing. Pictures of a shining being, waving goodbye. Underneath, in careful letters: 'See you soon.'"},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"**THE END — The One That Got Away**"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d1641e80456247d8b9eaf42b","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"promise_to_help","choices":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Suburban Backyard","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"You make a solemn vow, feeling the weight of it settle into your bones. You will help Zylar save its people. Whatever it takes, for however long it takes."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue","character":"Zylar","content":"Your promise is etched in my light now, Elena Vasquez. The Keth will sing of this night for eons — the night a human chose hope over fear."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"The bond between you glows warm in your chest. You are different now. You carry a fragment of an alien civilization within you, and you will carry it until the Keth are saved. It's a burden. It's a gift. It's the most meaningful thing you've ever done."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Dr. Elena Vasquez","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"**THE END — The Promise**"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01480246641045e4bc19f052","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"grounded_bond","choices":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Suburban Backyard","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"You withdraw from the deep connection, but a thin thread of light remains — a gentle bond that keeps you linked to Zylar without overwhelming you. You can feel its emotions at the edge of your awareness, like a distant melody."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue","character":"Zylar","content":"You are wise to keep your feet on your world, Elena. A bond should never consume. This thread between us — it is enough. It is friendship."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"And so begins a partnership unlike any other. You help Zylar with its mission while maintaining your life, your work, your humanity. The thread between you grows stronger with trust, not with fusion. You are allies. You are friends. You are two beings from different worlds, walking side by side."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"**THE END — The Thread Between Worlds**"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8f174dffef3c4ae497b73ccd","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"scientific_partnership","choices":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"location":"Suburban Backyard","passiveCharacterEffects":[],"passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"script":[{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"You and Zylar settle into a professional rhythm. You ask questions, take notes, hypothesize. Zylar explains Keth physics with patience and clarity. It's like working with the most brilliant colleague you've ever had — one who happens to be made of light."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue","character":"Dr. Elena Vasquez","content":"So if we use a phased crystalline array to focus solar energy, we could theoretically create a stable bridge across spacetime?"},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue","character":"Zylar","content":"Your grasp of the principles is remarkable. Yes. The math is sound. We could begin construction within your lunar cycle."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"You work through the night, filling page after page with equations and diagrams. By dawn, you have the framework for a plan to save the Keth. It's not emotional. It's not mystical. It's science. And it's beautiful."},{"instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Dr. Elena Vasquez","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration","content":"**THE END — Partners in Science**"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":2198,"output":1799,"cacheRead":41728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45725,"cost":{"input":0.00019782,"output":0.00032382,"cacheRead":0.00083456,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0013562000000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783134744982,"responseId":"gen-1783134745-AUOK2ke4T7qSKTPDdYPn","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
