{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to create the characters and locations for this noir detective story. Let me think about what I need:\\n\\nCharacters:\\n1. **Marlowe Vance** - The detective, a grizzled private eye\\n2. **Eleanor Blackwood** - The client, a wealthy socialite with a mysterious case\\n3. Perhaps some other characters later\\n\\nLocation:\\n1. **Vance's Office** - The detective's modest office\\n\\nLet me create these first, then implement the start scene stub.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b0092f04d2cf43d69fe8685a","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Marlowe Vance","vignette":"A weary private detective in his late forties, Marlowe Vance has seen the underbelly of the city through years of missing persons cases, infidelity investigations, and the occasional murder. He operates by a personal code of justice that often puts him at odds with the police.","appearanceDescription":"A tall, lean man with graying temples, tired blue eyes, and a trench coat that has seen better days. He always has a cigarette tucked behind his ear and a five o'clock shadow that never quite becomes a beard.","backstoryDescription":"A former police detective who left the force after a corruption scandal shook the department. He started his own private investigation agency and has been working out of a cramped office downtown for the past twelve years. His reputation is one of stubborn persistence."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_23f348ded50e45fdba9236b3","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Eleanor Blackwood","vignette":"A poised and elegant woman in her early thirties, Eleanor carries herself with the confidence of old money. Behind her composed exterior, there is a deep well of anxiety about her family's dark secrets.","appearanceDescription":"Striking with raven-black hair pulled back in a sophisticated chignon, piercing green eyes, and a string of pearls that likely cost more than Vance's monthly rent. She wears a tailored navy blue dress and gloves, even in the warm weather.","backstoryDescription":"The only daughter of the wealthy Blackwood family, owners of Blackwood Shipping Corporation. She grew up in a mansion on the hill, educated in Switzerland, and recently returned to the city after her father's mysterious disappearance three weeks ago."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_535ea71afbb34dd9a06a3aeb","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Vance's Office","vignette":"A cramped, dusty office on the third floor of a dilapidated building downtown. The window overlooks a neon sign that flickers all night, casting intermittent red and blue shadows across the cluttered desk.","appearanceDescription":"A small room with peeling wallpaper, a battered wooden desk covered in case files and coffee rings, a worn leather chair behind it, and two uncomfortable chairs for clients. A filing cabinet sits in the corner, overflowing with papers. A ceiling fan spins lazily, stirring the haze of cigarette smoke.","backstoryDescription":"Vance has rented this office since leaving the police force. The landlord, a sympathetic old man named Mr. Henderson, lets him defer rent when cases are slow. The building also houses a pawn shop on the ground floor and a dance hall in the basement."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":3809,"output":803,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4612,"cost":{"input":0.00034281,"output":0.00014454,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00048735}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783174230170,"responseId":"gen-1783174230-lfjUdenFsDBWt8spcRU7","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
