{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4c50e7105f754d749a572066","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Victor Blackwood","vignette":"The patriarch of the Blackwood family, Victor is a stern and calculating businessman in his late sixties. He built the shipping corporation into a regional powerhouse through ruthless deals and strategic alliances. Now he is mysteriously missing.","appearanceDescription":"A tall, broad-shouldered man with silver-gray hair, a well-groomed mustache, and piercing eyes that match his daughter's. He favors expensive three-piece suits and always carries a silver-topped cane, though he doesn't need it to walk.","backstoryDescription":"Victor took over Blackwood Shipping at age thirty after his father's sudden death. He expanded the company aggressively, making powerful friends—and dangerous enemies. His disappearance three weeks ago left the company in chaos and his daughter terrified."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7b9e44b2e3c14dbc92964b87","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Frank Moretti","vignette":"The slick, ambitious owner of Moretti Shipping Line, Frank is a self-made man who clawed his way up from the docks. He has been aggressively trying to buy out Blackwood Shipping for months, and his methods are not always legitimate.","appearanceDescription":"A stocky man in his fifties with a slicked-back mane of black hair, a gold chain visible at his collar, and a perpetual smirk. He wears expensive but slightly loud suits, favoring pinstripes and flashy tie pins.","backstoryDescription":"Born in the tenements near the waterfront, Frank Moretti started as a dockworker, then a foreman, then owner of a single barge. Through questionable dealings and strategic partnerships with organized crime, he built Moretti Shipping into Blackwood's primary competitor."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9d183830fc264932b170719a","name":"create_character","arguments":{"name":"Detective Clara Ruiz","vignette":"A sharp, no-nonsense detective with the city police department, Clara has a reputation for solving cases that others give up on. She and Vance have a complicated history—they used to be partners before he left the force.","appearanceDescription":"A woman in her late thirties with short, practical black hair streaked with gray, warm brown skin, and intelligent dark eyes. She wears a rumpled blazer over a shoulder holster, sensible shoes, and carries a worn leather notebook.","backstoryDescription":"Clara was Vance's partner for three years in the homicide division. When Vance left the force after uncovering corruption, she stayed and worked her way up. She has never forgotten the case that broke them apart, and her feelings about Vance remain complicated—respect mixed with resentment."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":6270,"output":705,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":6975,"cost":{"input":0.0005643,"output":0.0001269,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0006912}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783174270738,"responseId":"gen-1783174270-hROVQi6SOi57Zp5KCmj1","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
