{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me implement the six open stubs. I'll make 3 of them checkpoints and the other 3 either endings or having choices that reference existing scenes.\\n\\nLet me plan:\\n\\n1. **pier_17** (from lantern_club_meeting) - Checkpoint. Leads to finding the boat or tracking the dockworker.\\n2. **inner_circle** (from lantern_club_meeting) - Non-checkpoint, maybe an ending or reference existing scenes.\\n3. **open_envelope** (from lantern_club_with_eleanor) - Checkpoint. Reveals the letter's contents and leads forward.\\n4. **secure_documents** (from lantern_club_with_eleanor) - Non-checkpoint. Eleanor confronts Crane.\\n5. **partner_ruiz** (from shipping_investigation) - Checkpoint. Working with Clara.\\n6. **alone_investigation** (from shipping_investigation) - Non-checkpoint or ending.\\n\\nLet me implement them all.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me implement the six open stubs. I'll make 3 of them checkpoints.\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e7a56fe272454814aedb80f1","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"pier_17","location":"Pier 17","passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain","wind"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":true,"script":[{"content":"The rain falls in sheets as Vance arrives at Pier 17. The wooden planks are slick and treacherous, and the wind whips off the harbor, carrying the smell of salt and decay. A single lantern burns at the far end of the pier.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"],"type":"narration"},{"content":"He finds a night watchman huddled in a small shack near the warehouse, a grizzled old sailor nursing a flask.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"I'm looking for information about a man who disappeared here three weeks ago. Victor Blackwood. He was supposed to meet someone at this pier.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marlowe Vance","effect":"walk"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"I remember that night. A fancy car pulled up around midnight. A man got out—looked like money. He was arguing with another man, one of them dock bosses. Then a boat came, and the money man went quiet. They took him aboard, and the boat sailed east.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"Did you recognize the dock boss?","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"It was Arthur Crane. I'd recognize that miserable face anywhere. He's been coming around here for months, making deals with the sort of people decent folks avoid.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marlowe Vance","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"}],"choices":[{"description":"Armed with the knowledge that Arthur Crane orchestrated the kidnapping and the boat went east, Vance sets out to find Crane's hideout.","label":"Track Crane's island hideout","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetScene":"crane_island","targetSceneDescription":"Vance charters a boat from a friendly fisherman to search the eastern islands, finding a secluded cabin where Victor is being held captive by Crane's hired men."},{"description":"Vance decides to confront Arthur Crane directly at his home, using the watchman's testimony as leverage.","label":"Confront Crane at his estate","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub","targetScene":"confront_crane_at_home","targetSceneDescription":"Vance arrives at Arthur Crane's home and finds him packing to flee. A tense standoff ensues, with Crane revealing his motive for revenge against the Blackwood family."}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_287d27f97e4745c49e35a952","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"inner_circle","location":"The Lantern Club","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"content":"Vance leans in, lowering his voice. The jazz trio plays on, masking their conversation from prying ears.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"Tell me about Victor's inner circle. Who was close to him? Who had access to his accounts, his schedule, his secrets?","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"The Proprietor doesn't name names lightly. But for Victor... I'll make an exception. His partner, Arthur Crane, has been meeting with Frank Moretti at a hotel downtown. And Victor's personal secretary, a young man named Thomas Webb, has been seen copying documents late at night.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"content":"The masked man slides a matchbook across the table. The Hotel Majestic, with a room number written inside.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"They're meeting there tonight. If you want to catch a snake, you go to where it feeds.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"}],"choices":[{"description":"Vance takes the matchbook and heads to the Hotel Majestic to catch Crane and Moretti meeting in secret.","label":"Stake out the Hotel Majestic","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene","targetScene":"pier_17"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_deb9f825a5be442cac62d7a5","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"open_envelope","location":"The Lantern Club","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":true,"script":[{"content":"Eleanor's hands tremble as she breaks the wax seal on the envelope. Inside is a letter in her father's distinctive handwriting, along with a key and a photograph.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Eleanor Blackwood","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"She reads aloud, her voice wavering.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Eleanor Blackwood","content":"'My dearest Eleanor—if you're reading this, I may not be coming home. I've discovered that our company is being used to smuggle stolen goods through the harbor. The man behind it is Arthur Crane, my partner of thirty years. He has allies in the police department, which is why I didn't go to them directly. Go to Detective Clara Ruiz. She's the only one I trust. The key opens a safety deposit box at the Merchant's Bank. Everything you need is there. I love you. — Father.'","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"character":"Eleanor Blackwood","content":"Arthur? He's been like family to us. He was at every birthday, every holiday...","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Eleanor Blackwood","effect":"sad"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":24270,"output":1740,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26010,"cost":{"input":0.0021843,"output":0.00031319999999999997,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0024975}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1783174529690,"responseId":"gen-1783174529-PKPDt5FpNxXnnzWWh6if","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423","errorMessage":"Stream ended without finish_reason"}}
