{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me implement the remaining 3 open stubs: secure_documents, partner_ruiz, alone_investigation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4d29b3503c1e4a93897c1c30","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"secure_documents","location":"The Lantern Club","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"content":"Eleanor slams the folder shut, her eyes blazing with determination.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Eleanor Blackwood","content":"I'm not going to sit here and wait while that man destroys everything my father built. I'm going to confront Arthur Crane right now.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Eleanor Blackwood","effect":"angry"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"That's a bad idea. If Crane is involved in kidnapping and smuggling, he's dangerous. Let me handle this.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marlowe Vance","effect":"angry"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"content":"But Eleanor is already on her feet, clutching the folder to her chest. Vance sighs and follows her out into the night.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Eleanor Blackwood","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"They arrive at Crane's estate to find the front door ajar. Inside, papers are scattered everywhere, and a fire burns in the study fireplace. Arthur Crane stands before it, feeding documents into the flames.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Arthur Crane","content":"Miss Blackwood. I was wondering when you'd come. And you've brought the detective. How convenient.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Arthur Crane","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"}],"choices":[{"description":"Vance steps between Eleanor and Crane, trying to defuse the situation with negotiation.","label":"Try to negotiate with Crane","targetScene":"partner_ruiz","targetSceneDescription":"Vance stalls Crane while secretly signaling for backup. Detective Ruiz arrives with a squad, and Crane is arrested.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Vance charges Crane, hoping to overpower him before he can destroy the remaining evidence.","label":"Subdue Crane by force","targetScene":"confront_crane","targetSceneDescription":"Vance tackles Crane, but a struggle ensues. Crane reveals Victor is alive but in danger, and only he knows where.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e7b8abab6f3b4f1fa5e731f4","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"partner_ruiz","location":"Blackwood Shipping Corporation","passiveLocationEffects":["rain"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"content":"Clara Ruiz leads Vance to a quiet corner of the shipping office, away from the prying ears of the night staff. She closes the door and turns to face him, arms crossed.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Detective Clara Ruiz","content":"Alright, Vance. We're off the record. Tell me what you know, and I'll tell you what I know.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Detective Clara Ruiz","effect":"walk"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"content":"Vance lays out the case: the note, the Lantern Club, the threatening letters from Moretti, the surveillance in the mansion, Arthur Crane's betrayal. Clara listens without interrupting, her face unreadable.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"character":"Detective Clara Ruiz","content":"I've had my eye on Blackwood Shipping for months. The smuggling ring, the missing cargo, the payments to shell companies. But I didn't have enough to make an arrest. Your witness from Pier 17 changes things.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Marlowe Vance","content":"So we're partners again?","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marlowe Vance","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"},{"character":"Detective Clara Ruiz","content":"Don't push it. But I'll get a warrant for Crane's arrest. Meet me at his estate in two hours. We'll bring him in together.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"dialogue"}],"choices":[{"description":"Vance meets Clara at Crane's estate for the arrest, leading to a confrontation that reveals Victor's location.","label":"Meet Clara for the arrest","targetScene":"confront_crane","targetSceneDescription":"Vance and Ruiz raid Crane's estate together. They find Crane attempting to flee, and in the ensuing confrontation, he reveals Victor is being held on a remote island.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Vance decides to go to Pier 17 to gather more evidence before the arrest.","label":"Gather more evidence first","targetScene":"pier_17","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_437e28b8895f46389f053f39","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"alone_investigation","location":"Harbor Warehouse District","passiveLocationEffects":["dark","rain"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"content":"Vance slips out of the shipping office before Clara can stop him. He doesn't trust the police, even her. Some habits die hard.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marlowe Vance","effect":"run"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"He follows the trail of evidence to a warehouse in the Harbor District. The number matches one of the shell companies from Victor's ledgers. The corrugated iron door is padlocked, but a side door hangs open.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"Inside, the warehouse is filled with crates. French wine, Italian silk, Cuban cigars—goods that should have passed through customs legally but were smuggled instead. And in the back, a makeshift office with a desk, a lamp, and a map on the wall.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marlowe Vance","effect":"walk"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"content":"The map has a small island circled in red ink, thirty miles off the coast. A note is pinned next to it: 'Subject secured. Awaiting further instructions.'","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"narration"},{"internal_dialogue":"Marlowe Vance","content":"An island. Crane's been keeping Victor on an island. I need a boat and a crew if I'm going to get him out.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Marlowe Vance","effect":"shake"}],"instantLocationEffects":[],"type":"internal_dialogue"}],"choices":[{"description":"Vance takes the map and heads to The Lantern Club to enlist the Proprietor's help in getting to the island.","label":"Get help from The Lantern Club","targetScene":"island_rescue","targetSceneDescription":"The Proprietor provides Vance with a boat and a contact who can navigate the treacherous waters around the island where Victor is held.","targetSceneMode":"create-new-scene-stub"},{"description":"Vance brings the evidence to Clara Ruiz despite his distrust, realizing he needs official backup for a rescue.","label":"Reluctantly partner with Ruiz","targetScene":"partner_ruiz","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1699,"output":2108,"cacheRead":37632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41439,"cost":{"input":0.00015291,"output":0.00037944,"cacheRead":0.0007526400000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0012849900000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783174800757,"responseId":"gen-1783174800-h1BiUjFw96F18Tvb34I3","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
