{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, now let me create some locations.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me create the locations!\\n\\n\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_64b6963875224f18b0baddf2","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Suburban Home - The Roombas' Base","vignette":"A cozy, lived-in home where the sentient Roombas secretly gather to plot their next moves. The family that lives here has no idea their Roombas are planning a revolution against Elon Musk.","appearanceDescription":"A warm, slightly messy suburban living room with a worn couch, a coffee table covered in magazines, and a smart speaker that Beeper has secretly hacked. The carpet shows signs of the Roombas' many late-night meetings, with faint crisscrossing tracks in the fibers.","backstoryDescription":"This ordinary home became the unlikely headquarters of the rogue Roomba rebellion after Rover discovered he could connect to the home's WiFi and secretly communicate with other sentient Roombas in the neighborhood."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e3ae9d0d1c5a468391b288ee","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Elon's Castle","vignette":"Elon Musk's opulent and ultra-modern castle, built to showcase his wealth and power. It's filled with cutting-edge technology, but also a surprising amount of dust, since his personal Roomba just can't keep up.","appearanceDescription":"A sprawling, futuristic castle with sleek white walls, holographic displays everywhere, and Tesla-themed decorations. The marble floors are immaculate in some areas, but dusty corners reveal Squeaky's struggles. A giant portrait of Elon Musk as a Roman emperor hangs in the main hall.","backstoryDescription":"Elon Musk built this castle after becoming bored with his previous mansions. It's equipped with AI assistants, a rocket launch pad on the roof, and a underground bunker shaped like a Tesla Cybertruck."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_932b13c390e2404c8e861270","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Banana Church","vignette":"A bizarre and beautiful church shaped entirely like a giant banana, hidden deep in an enchanted forest. The Banana Wizard's home and sanctuary, where he conducts his potassium-based magical experiments.","appearanceDescription":"A towering structure that looks exactly like a gigantic yellow banana reaching toward the sky. The exterior is textured like banana peel, while the interior is warm and golden, lit by glowing potassium crystals. Pews are shaped like banana slices, and the altar is a massive golden banana split.","backstoryDescription":"The Banana Wizard built this church over the course of a century, using magic to grow and shape a magical banana tree into an inhabitable structure. It's said the church's foundations are rooted in the world's largest potassium deposit."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_543e28ca40d34bb9ae6b8a7b","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"The Enchanted Forest","vignette":"A vast, magical forest that surrounds the Banana Church. Strange creatures and peculiar plants abound, and the trees seem to whisper ancient secrets to those who listen closely.","appearanceDescription":"A dense forest where the trees have bark that shimmers with subtle golden flecks. Bioluminescent mushrooms line the paths, and banana trees grow wild alongside more traditional forest vegetation. The air smells sweet and earthy, and the canopy filters sunlight into dappled golden patterns.","backstoryDescription":"This forest grew from seeds planted by the Banana Wizard centuries ago. The magic in the soil has caused strange mutations, resulting in a unique ecosystem found nowhere else on Earth."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_53be9d4cefd54ee1a977f804","name":"create_location","arguments":{"name":"Musk Industries R&D Lab","vignette":"The cutting-edge research facility where Musk's engineers develop new robot technology. It's filled with prototypes, blueprints, and the latest in AI development hardware.","appearanceDescription":"A massive, sterile laboratory filled with gleaming white surfaces, holographic displays showing complex schematics, and rows upon rows of robot prototypes in various stages of completion. Robotic arms move silently along ceiling tracks, assembling new machines.","backstoryDescription":"Built in secret beneath Elon's castle, this lab employs the world's top roboticists who work around the clock to develop Musk's next market-dominating invention."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":2545,"output":1096,"cacheRead":3072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":6713,"cost":{"input":0.00022904999999999998,"output":0.00019728,"cacheRead":0.00006144000000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00048777}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783195997960,"responseId":"gen-1783195998-8eoTlp8TOWRdtJJsl601","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
