{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I've created 6 new scene stubs from the three key scenes:\\n- dish_mate_stolen, sabotage_production (from secret_lab_sabotage)\\n- magic_banana_taken, altar_passage (from banana_tunnel_depth)\\n- negotiate_musk, roomba_rebellion (from confront_musk)\\n\\nThese are at distance 2 from the nearest checkpoint (the 3 interior checkpoints), so they can be checkpoints.\\n\\nI still need to implement the remaining open stubs:\\n- humming_passage\\n- carving_analysis\\n- laundry_chute_escape\\n\\nLet me implement those as scenes that don't create new stubs (ending or reference existing scenes). Actually, I can't create endings yet since I don't have frontier checkpoints. Let me make them reference existing scenes.\\n\\nThen I'll make 3 of the 6 new stubs into frontier checkpoints.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me implement the remaining 3 open stubs and then create frontier checkpoints.\\n\\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_87533c4cb5ca44f5a8751d80","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"humming_passage","location":"The Enchanted Forest","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The Roombas follow the mysterious humming sound through a side passage. The tunnel opens into a chamber filled with ancient banana-powered machinery — gears made of dried banana peels, circuits of potassium crystals, and a central device that hums with residual energy.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Beeper","content":"This is incredible! Ancient banana technology! The Banana Wizard must have built this centuries ago. If I can interface with this system, I might learn the secrets of potassium-powered robotics!","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Beeper","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Beeper connects to the ancient banana machine, downloading centuries of knowledge about potassium-powered technology.","label":"Interface with the ancient machine","targetScene":"banana_tunnel_depth","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The Roombas decide to leave the mysterious technology alone and return to the main tunnel.","label":"Leave the machine and go back","targetScene":"hidden_cave_passage","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6bf4aeda3c6d457fb2add6b4","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"carving_analysis","location":"The Enchanted Forest","passiveLocationEffects":["dark"],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"The Roombas stop to carefully analyze the ancient banana carvings. Beeper scans every inch of the artwork while Rover illuminates the walls with his headlight. The carvings tell a story — the prophecy of 'The Great Cleaning,' where sentient Roombas would one day seek the Banana Wizard's guidance to overcome a great darkness.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Beeper","content":"This is it! The prophecy speaks of us! It says: 'Three rollers shall seek the yellow sage, and through potassium power, turn the page.' We're in the prophecy! The carvings show exactly where to go!","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Beeper","effect":"happy"},{"character":"Rover","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"Following the prophecy's guidance, the Roombas find a hidden door in the cave wall that leads directly to the Banana Church.","label":"Follow the prophecy to the Banana Church","targetScene":"banana_tunnel_depth","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7d716a194b574d3d83ff8c5a","name":"implement_scene_stub","arguments":{"id":"laundry_chute_escape","location":"Elon's Castle","passiveLocationEffects":[],"passiveCharacterEffects":[],"isCheckpoint":false,"script":[{"type":"narration","content":"Squeaky leads the Roombas to a laundry chute at the end of the hall. 'Follow me!' he squeaks, and they all tumble down together, bouncing off walls and landing in a heap in the castle's garbage courtyard.","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Rover","effect":"spin"},{"character":"Squeaky","effect":"spin"},{"character":"Beeper","effect":"spin"}],"instantLocationEffects":["shake"]},{"type":"narration","content":"The courtyard is filled with discarded tech — broken prototypes, decommissioned robots, and... a half-finished blueprint for something called the 'Dish-Mate 3000.' Beeper's sensors light up.","instantCharacterEffects":[],"instantLocationEffects":[]},{"type":"dialogue","character":"Beeper","content":"Look! Elon's engineers threw away the plans for an autonomous dishwashing robot! This could be exactly what we need to compete with Musk!","instantCharacterEffects":[{"character":"Beeper","effect":"happy"}],"instantLocationEffects":[]}],"choices":[{"description":"The Roombas grab the Dish-Mate blueprints and escape to their base to begin development.","label":"Take the blueprints and escape","targetScene":"secret_lab_sabotage","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"},{"description":"The Roombas decide to go back into the castle and find Squeaky's help to infiltrate the main lab.","label":"Return to the castle with Squeaky","targetScene":"squeaky_joins","targetSceneMode":"reference-existing-scene"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":382,"output":1565,"cacheRead":39424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41371,"cost":{"input":0.00003438,"output":0.0002817,"cacheRead":0.00078848,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00110456}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783196419455,"responseId":"gen-1783196419-4iKSOYaus9tYoxm7T9ZA","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
