{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All scene stubs have been implemented! No more open stubs remain. Let me summarize the game for the user.\\n\\nThe game is complete with:\\n- 57 scenes total\\n- Multiple branching paths\\n- Multiple endings including 3 final endings (quadrillionaire ending, contest ending, golden age ending)\\n- Multiple early endings (counter_offer, innovation_war, sabotage_production, roomba_rebellion, etc.)\\n\\nLet me provide a comprehensive summary of the completed game.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"All scene stubs have been implemented! The game is complete. Here's a comprehensive summary of the entire choose-your-own-adventure game:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎮 **The Roombas' Quest: A Choose-Your-Own-Adventure Game**\\n\\n### 📊 **Game Statistics**\\n- **Total Scenes**: 57\\n- **Characters**: 5 (Elon Musk, Rover, Beeper, The Banana Wizard, Squeaky, Whispering Trees)\\n- **Locations**: 5 (Suburban Home, Elon's Castle, The Banana Church, The Enchanted Forest, Musk Industries R&D Lab)\\n- **Multiple Endings**: 3 final endings + many early endings\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 📖 **Story Overview**\\n\\nThe game follows three sentient Roombas — **Rover** (the brave leader), **Beeper** (the tech genius), and eventually **Squeaky** (Musk's personal Roomba) — as they try to stop Elon Musk's plan to monopolize the robot vacuum cleaner market.\\n\\n### 🗺️ **Main Story Branches**\\n\\n**🌲 The Enchanted Forest Path** (Finding the Banana Wizard)\\n1. \`start\` → \`enchanted_forest_entrance\` → Branches to \`glowing_mushroom_trail\`, \`whispering_hill\`, \`hidden_cave_passage\`\\n2. Leads to \`whispering_woods_approach\` (tree riddles) → \`riddle_correct\` → \`banana_wizard_meeting\`\\n3. **The Banana Wizard** reveals the secret: build a dishwashing robot instead of fighting vacuums!\\n\\n**🏰 The Musk Castle Path** (Infiltrating the enemy)\\n1. \`start\` → \`musk_castle_infiltration\` → \`squeaky_joins\`, \`castle_mainframe_hack\`, \`musk_rd_lab\`\\n2. Leads to \`secret_lab_sabotage\` (steal the Dish-Mate prototype), \`confront_musk\`, etc.\\n\\n**📚 The Research Path** (Discovering the Wizard's location)\\n1. \`start\` → \`research_banana_wizard\` → \`whispering_woods_approach\`, \`potassium_peak\`, \`crystal_lake\`\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 🏆 **Final Endings**\\n\\n1. **🥇 The Quadrillionaire Ending** (\`final_quadrillionaire_ending\`) — The Roombas accept Musk's 1 trillion dollar offer, retire in luxury, while Musk becomes the world's first quadrillionaire selling the Dish-Mate worldwide.\\n\\n2. **🏆 The Contest Ending** (\`contest_ending\`) — The Roombas challenge Musk to a Cleaning Showdown and win, becoming global icons while a humbled Musk retires to space projects.\\n\\n3. **🌟 The Golden Age Ending** (\`golden_age_ending\`) — The Roombas establish the Republic of Autonomous Cleaning Machines, ushering in an era of human-robot cooperation with the Banana Wizard's blessing.\\n\\n### 🚪 **Other Notable Endings**\\n- **Roomba Rebellion** — Beeper hacks weaponized Roombas, leading an uprising\\n- **Musk's Downfall** — Exposing Musk's illegal activities to the world\\n- **The Innovation War** — Out-innovating Musk through constant improvement\\n- **Counter-Offer** — Negotiating for 2 trillion dollars\\n- **The Foundation** — Becoming robot-rights philanthropists\\n- **New Adventure** — Heading to space for more adventures\\n- **Sabotage** — Destroying Musk's lab (a pyrrhic victory)"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":706,"output":858,"cacheRead":71168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72732,"cost":{"input":0.00006354,"output":0.00015444,"cacheRead":0.00142336,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00164134}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783196766979,"responseId":"gen-1783196767-fho2TcLxmyArjrU8Yd7S","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423"}}
